(3830170, 542232, 39430, '<td valign="top">Well hidden, but there''s a serious white balance problem in the photo, giving a blue cast to all the plants.  When shooting in cloudy light, it''s often necessary to switch to manual white balance, and set it to a cloudy day setting.  This will keep the rich greens true to colour.</td>', 'Well hidden, but there''s a serious white balance problem in the photo, giving a blue cast to all the plants.  When shooting in cloudy light, it''s often necessary to switch to manual white balance, and set it to a cloudy day setting.  This will keep the rich greens true to colour.', '2007-06-25 02:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
