(3833126, 542818, 70514, '<td valign="top">Well, it is quite sad to see "Waldo" standing in the doorway of the dreams.  Great impact, imo.  I love the processing in this.  Wonderfully executed.</td>', 'Well, it is quite sad to see "Waldo" standing in the doorway of the dreams.  Great impact, imo.  I love the processing in this.  Wonderfully executed.', '2007-06-25 19:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
