(3834285, 540553, 55199, '<td valign="top">Cool shot... lots of symbols interposed.  Looks like two Waldo''s, maybe even three.</td>', 'Cool shot... lots of symbols interposed.  Looks like two Waldo''s, maybe even three.', '2007-06-25 23:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834342, 542768, 55199, '<td valign="top">Image could be slightly more sharp.  I like this photo and I would have scored this better in a different challenge.  I feel that Waldo should not be the center of attention, but a secondary surprise that only someone who really looks into the photo can appreciate.</td>', 'Image could be slightly more sharp.  I like this photo and I would have scored this better in a different challenge.  I feel that Waldo should not be the center of attention, but a secondary surprise that only someone who really looks into the photo can appreciate.', '2007-06-25 23:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834378, 542092, 55199, '<td valign="top">Your photo would be more interesting if the clouds had more depth (maybe taken at a different time of day?).  The perspective and coloration of the buildings is interesting.  I am seeing three possible Waldos, but I''m not certain.</td>', 'Your photo would be more interesting if the clouds had more depth (maybe taken at a different time of day?).  The perspective and coloration of the buildings is interesting.  I am seeing three possible Waldos, but I''m not certain.', '2007-06-25 23:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834399, 542764, 33362, '<td valign="top">I was going to post Skip as well but decided not to. Fun GTG.</td>', 'I was going to post Skip as well but decided not to. Fun GTG.', '2007-06-25 23:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834410, 540553, 33362, '<td valign="top">ahh.. there is a person. Took me some time to find. Cutter, is that you?</td>', 'ahh.. there is a person. Took me some time to find. Cutter, is that you?', '2007-06-25 23:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834419, 542865, 55199, '<td valign="top">Lovely skin tones against the zebra pattern.  Unfortunately, your person isn''t hidden.  I could potentially see an alternate interpretation for the challenge (Waldo her missing lover/spouse), but the challenge description makes it hard for me to do so.</td>', 'Lovely skin tones against the zebra pattern.  Unfortunately, your person isn''t hidden.  I could potentially see an alternate interpretation for the challenge (Waldo her missing lover/spouse), but the challenge description makes it hard for me to do so.', '2007-06-26 00:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834436, 542261, 55199, '<td valign="top">A not-so-abandoned house.  :)  Glad he wasn''t hiding in the poison ivy! trespassers beware. ;)  I like the nostalgic feel.</td>', 'A not-so-abandoned house.  :)  Glad he wasn''t hiding in the poison ivy! trespassers beware. ;)  I like the nostalgic feel.', '2007-06-26 00:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834448, 542607, 55199, '<td valign="top">lol!  Cornfield tag anyone?  Lovely crisp greens.</td>', 'lol!  Cornfield tag anyone?  Lovely crisp greens.', '2007-06-26 00:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834453, 539064, 55199, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks surreal.  I''d be interested to see how you did the editing on this.</td>', 'Wow, looks surreal.  I''d be interested to see how you did the editing on this.', '2007-06-26 00:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834457, 542071, 55199, '<td valign="top">Clever way to hide Waldo.  However, I don''t find the photo all that interesting.</td>', 'Clever way to hide Waldo.  However, I don''t find the photo all that interesting.', '2007-06-26 00:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834466, 542743, 55199, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I like the processing.  The shapes of the trees and the moss are interesting and I like how you positioned Waldo.</td>', 'Not sure if I like the processing.  The shapes of the trees and the moss are interesting and I like how you positioned Waldo.', '2007-06-26 00:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834513, 542261, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love these old worn out buildings, and would love to see it, but that would not fare well for the purpose, would it?  I''m glad you are hidden, but easily found.  And it is a bit creepy to think of someone being in there, but that''s just my opinion.  I love how you composed and processed this image. Very nice, imo.</td>', 'I love these old worn out buildings, and would love to see it, but that would not fare well for the purpose, would it?  I''m glad you are hidden, but easily found.  And it is a bit creepy to think of someone being in there, but that''s just my opinion.  I love how you composed and processed this image. Very nice, imo.', '2007-06-26 00:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834527, 542741, 70514, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh! This is truly massive, and we really are insignificant.  Great job, glad "Waldo" is wearing red.  Great job with all the texture.</td>', 'Oh my gosh! This is truly massive, and we really are insignificant.  Great job, glad "Waldo" is wearing red.  Great job with all the texture.', '2007-06-26 00:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834531, 542611, 55199, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of focus.  I like your use of black and white. However, I wouldn''t find it very interesting without Waldo.  I like to see Waldo as a secondary surprise rather than the sole purpose.  Yet, I think you''ve technically met the challenge.  This is a tough one to vote on.</td>', 'Nice choice of focus.  I like your use of black and white. However, I wouldn''t find it very interesting without Waldo.  I like to see Waldo as a secondary surprise rather than the sole purpose.  Yet, I think you''ve technically met the challenge.  This is a tough one to vote on.', '2007-06-26 00:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834541, 541108, 55199, '<td valign="top">Has the feel of the musical "Chitty Chitty Bang Bang"  I like it.</td>', 'Has the feel of the musical "Chitty Chitty Bang Bang"  I like it.', '2007-06-26 00:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834548, 542793, 55199, '<td valign="top">Nice Reflection!  Stones are a little bright.</td>', 'Nice Reflection!  Stones are a little bright.', '2007-06-26 00:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834558, 542111, 55199, '<td valign="top">Wish the greens were darker.  Interesting fissure.  Waldina blends just enough.  :)</td>', 'Wish the greens were darker.  Interesting fissure.  Waldina blends just enough.  :)', '2007-06-26 00:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834578, 542745, 55199, '<td valign="top">I wish you had included a little more of the building on the right side so that the image would be more symmetrical.</td>', 'I wish you had included a little more of the building on the right side so that the image would be more symmetrical.', '2007-06-26 00:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834590, 542221, 55199, '<td valign="top">Two Eyes.  :)  Clever abstract.  Blacks could be more black.</td>', 'Two Eyes.  :)  Clever abstract.  Blacks could be more black.', '2007-06-26 00:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834627, 541023, 55199, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of perspective in this forest scene.  I like your placement of Waldo.  It has a pensive feel about it.</td>', 'I like your choice of perspective in this forest scene.  I like your placement of Waldo.  It has a pensive feel about it.', '2007-06-26 00:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834642, 542781, 55199, '<td valign="top">I think a bit cropped off the top (just below the first light break from the top in the clouds on the left side) would make the composition of this even stronger.</td>', 'I think a bit cropped off the top (just below the first light break from the top in the clouds on the left side) would make the composition of this even stronger.', '2007-06-26 00:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834666, 542428, 13207, '<td valign="top">Ahh!  Awesome!  Took me a good 5 minutes to find him in the sand!  Great shot, original idea.</td>', 'Ahh!  Awesome!  Took me a good 5 minutes to find him in the sand!  Great shot, original idea.', '2007-06-26 01:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834670, 541784, 55199, '<td valign="top">Is that him standing on the stairs behind the second hut from the front?  your photo is interesting because the setting is unusual, but I''d like to see a little more of the setting or some other clue to get a better sense of the culture/location.</td>', 'Is that him standing on the stairs behind the second hut from the front?  your photo is interesting because the setting is unusual, but I''d like to see a little more of the setting or some other clue to get a better sense of the culture/location.', '2007-06-26 01:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834681, 541505, 55199, '<td valign="top">I like how you hid Waldo.  :)</td>', 'I like how you hid Waldo.  :)', '2007-06-26 01:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834688, 540275, 37845, '<td valign="top">I live near Toronto, and have seen this landmark dozens of times, yet your image still makes it look better than in real life. Nice dimension to the photo, and i think its amazing that you were able to catch the entire skywalk empty (almost). 9</td>', 'I live near Toronto, and have seen this landmark dozens of times, yet your image still makes it look better than in real life. Nice dimension to the photo, and i think its amazing that you were able to catch the entire skywalk empty (almost). 9', '2007-06-26 01:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834695, 542608, 37845, '<td valign="top">Love the leading lines in this shot.</td>', 'Love the leading lines in this shot.', '2007-06-26 01:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834700, 542078, 37845, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, and great colour in this image. The sky colour looks a little off to me though, not sure if that was natural, or a result of post processing.</td>', 'Very nice shot, and great colour in this image. The sky colour looks a little off to me though, not sure if that was natural, or a result of post processing.', '2007-06-26 01:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834705, 542828, 37845, '<td valign="top">Great job in converting this to black and white.</td>', 'Great job in converting this to black and white.', '2007-06-26 01:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834710, 540929, 37845, '<td valign="top">WOW... incredible shot. When I saw the thumbnail of the photo, i was getting ready to type DNMC in this space, but you totally amazed me here. 10, and I hope you ribbon.</td>', 'WOW... incredible shot. When I saw the thumbnail of the photo, i was getting ready to type DNMC in this space, but you totally amazed me here. 10, and I hope you ribbon.', '2007-06-26 01:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
