(3836103, 539399, 70000, '<td valign="top">In alot of forests like this there is a sharp harshness htat I have had a hard time mastering. you did a great job preserving the magic and soft beautify of the forest with this photograph. the one nitpicky thing is the tree on the left. it is a bright white kind of color white the rest has this brown and green mossy feeling. a little burning or cloning would have helped that. i like the way you hid waldo as well, he isnt so small hes unfindable and yet still blends in very well</td>', 'In alot of forests like this there is a sharp harshness htat I have had a hard time mastering. you did a great job preserving the magic and soft beautify of the forest with this photograph. the one nitpicky thing is the tree on the left. it is a bright white kind of color white the rest has this brown and green mossy feeling. a little burning or cloning would have helped that. i like the way you hid waldo as well, he isnt so small hes unfindable and yet still blends in very well', '2007-06-26 12:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
