(3836194, 542602, 55837, '<td valign="top">It did trick me.  Good job.</td>', 'It did trick me.  Good job.', '2007-06-26 12:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836203, 542828, 43073, '<td valign="top">Delightful image, full of energy and drama. "Waldo" was easily found, but that''s not critical to me for this challenge. Instead, the image you have presented is interesting and has wonderful lines and flow. It actually draws me in, like a scary movie. I''m jealous that the seagull is so clearly in focus and yet has no perceptible haloing whatsoever (whenever I shoot flying birds they always have halos, even if I don''t sharpen them)! This is a "10" from me.</td>', 'Delightful image, full of energy and drama. "Waldo" was easily found, but that''s not critical to me for this challenge. Instead, the image you have presented is interesting and has wonderful lines and flow. It actually draws me in, like a scary movie. I''m jealous that the seagull is so clearly in focus and yet has no perceptible haloing whatsoever (whenever I shoot flying birds they always have halos, even if I don''t sharpen them)! This is a "10" from me.', '2007-06-26 12:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836207, 540929, 55837, '<td valign="top">Excellent.</td>', 'Excellent.', '2007-06-26 12:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836208, 540929, 43073, '<td valign="top">I expected to see a lot more of these kinds of images, but not done this well. Yours is quite good, with the lines of the background playing well over the surface and the flowers breaking them up with a splash of color. I wish the eye wasn''t looking at me, but it''s such a minor quibble I can''t even dock you any points for it. 10.</td>', 'I expected to see a lot more of these kinds of images, but not done this well. Yours is quite good, with the lines of the background playing well over the surface and the flowers breaking them up with a splash of color. I wish the eye wasn''t looking at me, but it''s such a minor quibble I can''t even dock you any points for it. 10.', '2007-06-26 12:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836210, 541542, 43073, '<td valign="top">One of the few images that, for me, had a person in plain view that I didn''t see straight away. Delightful composition, wonderful black and white with good tones throughout, and interesting lines leading my eyes away from "Waldo." 10.</td>', 'One of the few images that, for me, had a person in plain view that I didn''t see straight away. Delightful composition, wonderful black and white with good tones throughout, and interesting lines leading my eyes away from "Waldo." 10.', '2007-06-26 12:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836213, 542365, 43073, '<td valign="top">Such wonderful colors here, with shades moving so smoothly from one to the next. The person is clearly visible, but in a fitting way that works well with this image. I might have moved the main tree a little more to the right, but I''m not sure that would improve it. 10.</td>', 'Such wonderful colors here, with shades moving so smoothly from one to the next. The person is clearly visible, but in a fitting way that works well with this image. I might have moved the main tree a little more to the right, but I''m not sure that would improve it. 10.', '2007-06-26 12:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836224, 541108, 43073, '<td valign="top">I want to walk down this road, and see that car, with grass growing on the roof; I want to open that door, and sit inside where "Waldo" is, and just look around, the quiet enveloping me, the light sifting through the trees to barely touch me. A delightful image, and one of my favorites of the challenge. 10.</td>', 'I want to walk down this road, and see that car, with grass growing on the roof; I want to open that door, and sit inside where "Waldo" is, and just look around, the quiet enveloping me, the light sifting through the trees to barely touch me. A delightful image, and one of my favorites of the challenge. 10.', '2007-06-26 12:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836228, 540514, 43073, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is, or where it was shot, but I love it. I keep coming back and looking at it thinking, "This is so cool. I need to find one of these." Such great dark tones in the foreground, such bright whites around the middle, lovely composition. I might have eeked the box a bit more up and left . . . . but I might not have, too. 10.</td>', 'I have no idea what this is, or where it was shot, but I love it. I keep coming back and looking at it thinking, "This is so cool. I need to find one of these." Such great dark tones in the foreground, such bright whites around the middle, lovely composition. I might have eeked the box a bit more up and left . . . . but I might not have, too. 10.', '2007-06-26 12:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836234, 542428, 43073, '<td valign="top">I just love this. I think it''s my favorite of the challenge (but it could be tied with another). It''s strong as an image in and of itself, which draws me to it. Wonderful black and white tones, an overall appealing silvery-ness, and perfect choice of placement and subject for Waldo. Not that hard to find, but also fits perfectly in your shot. Great. 10.</td>', 'I just love this. I think it''s my favorite of the challenge (but it could be tied with another). It''s strong as an image in and of itself, which draws me to it. Wonderful black and white tones, an overall appealing silvery-ness, and perfect choice of placement and subject for Waldo. Not that hard to find, but also fits perfectly in your shot. Great. 10.', '2007-06-26 12:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836248, 542426, 43073, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot; great subjects clearly the focus of the shot, and "Waldo" well placed. I love the texture in the road/path, and the way the sky compliments the overall shot. 10.</td>', 'Lovely shot; great subjects clearly the focus of the shot, and "Waldo" well placed. I love the texture in the road/path, and the way the sky compliments the overall shot. 10.', '2007-06-26 12:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836267, 542870, 43073, '<td valign="top">This shot makes me want to walk in there, to that door, and open it, reading along the way, stopping to take in what is written, considering the blank spaces as well as those with writing. Are they tombstones? Is it really in such disrepair, with rubble lying on the ground? Wonderful conversion, great lights and darks, and subtlety throughout. 10.</td>', 'This shot makes me want to walk in there, to that door, and open it, reading along the way, stopping to take in what is written, considering the blank spaces as well as those with writing. Are they tombstones? Is it really in such disrepair, with rubble lying on the ground? Wonderful conversion, great lights and darks, and subtlety throughout. 10.', '2007-06-26 12:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836277, 542261, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like this shot; I want to shout to Waldo, "Get out of there, silly person, that building might fall down! Don''t you see the window falling in already?" The colors here fit well together, the lighting is interesting, and the composition works for me. An interesting image in which someone tried to hide. 9.</td>', 'I like this shot; I want to shout to Waldo, "Get out of there, silly person, that building might fall down! Don''t you see the window falling in already?" The colors here fit well together, the lighting is interesting, and the composition works for me. An interesting image in which someone tried to hide. 9.', '2007-06-26 12:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836305, 542870, 69368, '<td valign="top">very nice to see so many details. b + w works well.</td>', 'very nice to see so many details. b + w works well.', '2007-06-26 13:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836313, 542871, 69368, '<td valign="top">very interesting location. could be a little more saturated. A nice hideout for Waldo. Great shot. good luck</td>', 'very interesting location. could be a little more saturated. A nice hideout for Waldo. Great shot. good luck', '2007-06-26 13:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836318, 540833, 69368, '<td valign="top">beautiful scenery!  the green is a tad too powerful, IMO.</td>', 'beautiful scenery!  the green is a tad too powerful, IMO.', '2007-06-26 13:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
