(3836464, 542781, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, love the stillness of the water and the wadlo (fisherman?) staring into its depths.  Beautiful landscape</td>', 'Nice shot, love the stillness of the water and the wadlo (fisherman?) staring into its depths.  Beautiful landscape', '2007-06-26 13:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836474, 542865, 68035, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea of a semi concealed person for this challenge and I hope the voters dont punish you for it.  If they do then to hell with them this is a lovely different well executed shot (only one minor issue is that on my monitor the skin tones seem a little blown out)</td>', 'I really like this idea of a semi concealed person for this challenge and I hope the voters dont punish you for it.  If they do then to hell with them this is a lovely different well executed shot (only one minor issue is that on my monitor the skin tones seem a little blown out)', '2007-06-26 13:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836480, 541722, 29591, '<td valign="top">Beautiful night shot. Waldo seems kinda blurry though. Well done overall.</td>', 'Beautiful night shot. Waldo seems kinda blurry though. Well done overall.', '2007-06-26 13:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836484, 542621, 68035, '<td valign="top">Is he hiding to the bushes about midway down on the right?  Like the fact that I think I know but I am not 100% sure.  nice contrasts between the dirt road and the greenery although seems a little dark on the edges (not sure if that is down to deliberate vignetting or something else but it is a mite distracting</td>', 'Is he hiding to the bushes about midway down on the right?  Like the fact that I think I know but I am not 100% sure.  nice contrasts between the dirt road and the greenery although seems a little dark on the edges (not sure if that is down to deliberate vignetting or something else but it is a mite distracting', '2007-06-26 13:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836491, 542387, 68035, '<td valign="top">Cool Waldo! but even moreso lovely picture, super capture of the bridge''s spans shame about the steps but appreciate that they were a necessity so you could capture waldo</td>', 'Cool Waldo! but even moreso lovely picture, super capture of the bridge''s spans shame about the steps but appreciate that they were a necessity so you could capture waldo', '2007-06-26 13:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836493, 542854, 29591, '<td valign="top">love the light stars... neat composition and even though Waldo is easy to find it is an interesting image to look at. Well done</td>', 'love the light stars... neat composition and even though Waldo is easy to find it is an interesting image to look at. Well done', '2007-06-26 13:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836494, 542512, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice Waldo, exactly the right type of hiding ie it takes a while to spot but once you do its obvious.  Clever composition</td>', 'Nice Waldo, exactly the right type of hiding ie it takes a while to spot but once you do its obvious.  Clever composition', '2007-06-26 13:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836497, 542459, 68035, '<td valign="top">Oh my word forget about waldo by the mysterious door (where is it leading to) and instead just bask inthe wonderous sky.  Amazing colour and 3d feeling to it.  Stunning!!!!!!</td>', 'Oh my word forget about waldo by the mysterious door (where is it leading to) and instead just bask inthe wonderous sky.  Amazing colour and 3d feeling to it.  Stunning!!!!!!', '2007-06-26 13:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836502, 542768, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very cute, centred composition works well and the juxtaposition between ferns and hat is super</td>', 'Very cute, centred composition works well and the juxtaposition between ferns and hat is super', '2007-06-26 13:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836504, 541994, 68035, '<td valign="top">Oh PLEASE dont let this image get slaughtered cos waldo happens to be a bear, lovely image that makes me both smile and wish I had been there to witness that moment</td>', 'Oh PLEASE dont let this image get slaughtered cos waldo happens to be a bear, lovely image that makes me both smile and wish I had been there to witness that moment', '2007-06-26 13:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836506, 542372, 29591, '<td valign="top">Where is that place, it looks from another world. Thanks for sharing that. Waldo is not really hidden but what''s the matter!!!</td>', 'Where is that place, it looks from another world. Thanks for sharing that. Waldo is not really hidden but what''s the matter!!!', '2007-06-26 13:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836507, 542594, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nicely hidden and a super composition, love the natural archway of the trees and the almost but not quite duplication of each tree in itself</td>', 'Nicely hidden and a super composition, love the natural archway of the trees and the almost but not quite duplication of each tree in itself', '2007-06-26 13:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836510, 542848, 68035, '<td valign="top">Is waldo the head in the sea or the people on the boat, beautiful rich blueness of the water and cracking impact when you look at it together with the cloudless sky</td>', 'Is waldo the head in the sea or the people on the boat, beautiful rich blueness of the water and cracking impact when you look at it together with the cloudless sky', '2007-06-26 13:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836511, 542793, 68035, '<td valign="top">LOL do I get two points for spotting Waldo and Waldos reflection.  Lovely the leading lines in this shot</td>', 'LOL do I get two points for spotting Waldo and Waldos reflection.  Lovely the leading lines in this shot', '2007-06-26 13:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836517, 540993, 68035, '<td valign="top">Ooooo hope you dont suffer for treading an alternative path with this shot.  I like it as an image and the fact that the shadow falls behind the fencing provides a slightly ominous/entrapped feeling to it</td>', 'Ooooo hope you dont suffer for treading an alternative path with this shot.  I like it as an image and the fact that the shadow falls behind the fencing provides a slightly ominous/entrapped feeling to it', '2007-06-26 13:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
