(3836598, 541784, 79167, '<td valign="top">wow that took me a while!!!!!!!! nice job! i love all the contrasts!</td>', 'wow that took me a while!!!!!!!! nice job! i love all the contrasts!', '2007-06-26 14:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836603, 542816, 79167, '<td valign="top">is there a naked person in this photo somewhere??? i just see clothes and no person!</td>', 'is there a naked person in this photo somewhere??? i just see clothes and no person!', '2007-06-26 14:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836605, 542854, 79167, '<td valign="top">i see you! nice job blending in with the dark shadows...</td>', 'i see you! nice job blending in with the dark shadows...', '2007-06-26 14:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836611, 542374, 79167, '<td valign="top">wow...took me a minute! nice job!</td>', 'wow...took me a minute! nice job!', '2007-06-26 14:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836617, 542632, 43073, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and wonderful execution. I love that it''s an actual hand in the, well, hand! Makes me actually want to "go there" and shake it, or have a conversation (though that might be tough as they have no lips). Delightful. 9.</td>', 'Great idea, and wonderful execution. I love that it''s an actual hand in the, well, hand! Makes me actually want to "go there" and shake it, or have a conversation (though that might be tough as they have no lips). Delightful. 9.', '2007-06-26 14:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836623, 541736, 43073, '<td valign="top">Regardless of Waldo, this is a great image. The industrial feel is so clear here, the blues blue, but industrial blue; the greys great. Great light, and excellent composition, with such good use of symmetry, broken only in the differently symmetrical appearance of the ladders. One of the places that keeps modern life going, but we never see. Wonderful, bumping it up to a 10 (first had it at a 9).</td>', 'Regardless of Waldo, this is a great image. The industrial feel is so clear here, the blues blue, but industrial blue; the greys great. Great light, and excellent composition, with such good use of symmetry, broken only in the differently symmetrical appearance of the ladders. One of the places that keeps modern life going, but we never see. Wonderful, bumping it up to a 10 (first had it at a 9).', '2007-06-26 14:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836633, 542869, 43073, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge, and good use of black and white. With just the hand and foot showing, gives the image an even bleaker appearance to the whole thing. I''m always sad, but pragmatic when I see these images, as they tug at all the heart strings. Yours works in that way, and that''s a good thing, IMHO. 9.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge, and good use of black and white. With just the hand and foot showing, gives the image an even bleaker appearance to the whole thing. I''m always sad, but pragmatic when I see these images, as they tug at all the heart strings. Yours works in that way, and that''s a good thing, IMHO. 9.', '2007-06-26 14:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836640, 542221, 43073, '<td valign="top">This is one of the images that I''ve rated highly just because I think it''s cool, from conception, to execution, to final presentation. The blue is right on for these purposes, the . . . eyeballs . . . work perfectly, and the person underneath it all fits wonderfully in the theme. Nicely shot. 9.</td>', 'This is one of the images that I''ve rated highly just because I think it''s cool, from conception, to execution, to final presentation. The blue is right on for these purposes, the . . . eyeballs . . . work perfectly, and the person underneath it all fits wonderfully in the theme. Nicely shot. 9.', '2007-06-26 14:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836650, 540892, 43073, '<td valign="top">What an interesting take on a library (or bookstore?); such a grungy look for a place where knowledge is stored, but with such an attempt to bring light in through the windows at the top (that''s where all the light is in this image). Great tones in this, and textures throughout. Great capture. 9.</td>', 'What an interesting take on a library (or bookstore?); such a grungy look for a place where knowledge is stored, but with such an attempt to bring light in through the windows at the top (that''s where all the light is in this image). Great tones in this, and textures throughout. Great capture. 9.', '2007-06-26 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836659, 542230, 43073, '<td valign="top">Such clean patterns here, juxtaposed against such a dramatic sky, makes for a great image. The shades and tones of the black and white works so wonderfully. I want to run along the outside just looking at the sky. Wonderful shot. 9.</td>', 'Such clean patterns here, juxtaposed against such a dramatic sky, makes for a great image. The shades and tones of the black and white works so wonderfully. I want to run along the outside just looking at the sky. Wonderful shot. 9.', '2007-06-26 14:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836668, 540833, 43073, '<td valign="top">I loved the colors in this when I first saw it; it''s a wonderful shot, with great greys in the building, reds on the wheel, and greens dominating the rest of the image (blue green in the water, plant greens everywhere else). Waldo was easily found, but that means little to me when the image is as strong as this one is.</td>', 'I loved the colors in this when I first saw it; it''s a wonderful shot, with great greys in the building, reds on the wheel, and greens dominating the rest of the image (blue green in the water, plant greens everywhere else). Waldo was easily found, but that means little to me when the image is as strong as this one is.', '2007-06-26 14:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836690, 542871, 43073, '<td valign="top">This so much looks like an oil painting to me; wonderful subdued shades and colors, and what almost appears to be a canvas in the background (is it a wall); wonderfully captured and presented. 9.</td>', 'This so much looks like an oil painting to me; wonderful subdued shades and colors, and what almost appears to be a canvas in the background (is it a wall); wonderfully captured and presented. 9.', '2007-06-26 14:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836700, 542372, 43073, '<td valign="top">I liked this despite Waldo being so easy to find; it would almost be a better image without the person in it. But the blues in the pond are so wonderful, so deep and true, glowing, even, that I kept coming back to look at it again. Balanced against the pale colors in the sky, it has quite an effect. Well done.</td>', 'I liked this despite Waldo being so easy to find; it would almost be a better image without the person in it. But the blues in the pond are so wonderful, so deep and true, glowing, even, that I kept coming back to look at it again. Balanced against the pale colors in the sky, it has quite an effect. Well done.', '2007-06-26 14:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836704, 541023, 43073, '<td valign="top">The fog and mist so perfectly bring the foreground of this into sharp focus, really grabbing my attention. Waldo was easily found, but fits so nicely into the shot (as opposed to being kind of "inserted") that it works really well for me anyway. I love the whole appearance of this, and want to go walking in these woods searching for elves and fairy princesses. Delightful. 9.</td>', 'The fog and mist so perfectly bring the foreground of this into sharp focus, really grabbing my attention. Waldo was easily found, but fits so nicely into the shot (as opposed to being kind of "inserted") that it works really well for me anyway. I love the whole appearance of this, and want to go walking in these woods searching for elves and fairy princesses. Delightful. 9.', '2007-06-26 14:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836762, 540567, 811, '<td valign="top">Now that I see the little guy, he''s obvious.  Otherwise the oil thing in the background captures the attention.In the thumbnail, the vignette looks like the outline of a man''s face, it''s not so noticeable in the full size one though.</td>', 'Now that I see the little guy, he''s obvious.  Otherwise the oil thing in the background captures the attention.In the thumbnail, the vignette looks like the outline of a man''s face, it''s not so noticeable in the full size one though.', '2007-06-26 15:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836766, 542828, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome bw shot.  Very clear and well exposed.</td>', 'Awesome bw shot.  Very clear and well exposed.', '2007-06-26 15:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836769, 540517, 811, '<td valign="top">Wow, about didn''t see him.  He (or she) being so tiny really gives some sense to how vast the landscape is.  Photographically speaking, it looks as if the focus could have been a bit sharper.</td>', 'Wow, about didn''t see him.  He (or she) being so tiny really gives some sense to how vast the landscape is.  Photographically speaking, it looks as if the focus could have been a bit sharper.', '2007-06-26 15:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836778, 542452, 811, '<td valign="top">The greens look a bit oversaturated here, and that is making the image quality seem a bit grainy.</td>', 'The greens look a bit oversaturated here, and that is making the image quality seem a bit grainy.', '2007-06-26 15:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836780, 542607, 811, '<td valign="top">The movie Children of the Corn gave me nightmares for years.  &lt;shudder&gt;  The green face paint adds to the effect I think.</td>', 'The movie Children of the Corn gave me nightmares for years.  <shudder>  The green face paint adds to the effect I think.', '2007-06-26 15:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836782, 542426, 811, '<td valign="top">He/she blends in nicely with the road. . .</td>', 'He/she blends in nicely with the road. . .', '2007-06-26 15:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836783, 541023, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective in this shot.  Very well done.</td>', 'I like the perspective in this shot.  Very well done.', '2007-06-26 15:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836785, 542852, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice capture -- I like the perspective, the bw and the composition is effective as well.</td>', 'Nice capture -- I like the perspective, the bw and the composition is effective as well.', '2007-06-26 15:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836786, 542383, 811, '<td valign="top">He almost blends with the pillars of the bridge.  I like the colors in this.</td>', 'He almost blends with the pillars of the bridge.  I like the colors in this.', '2007-06-26 15:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836787, 540915, 811, '<td valign="top">Good symmetry and exposure in this shot.</td>', 'Good symmetry and exposure in this shot.', '2007-06-26 15:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836792, 542242, 811, '<td valign="top">I like how the vegetatin sets up a feeling of repeating patterns here that is broken nicely by the head.  Not sure what the little red splatterings are, though.</td>', 'I like how the vegetatin sets up a feeling of repeating patterns here that is broken nicely by the head.  Not sure what the little red splatterings are, though.', '2007-06-26 15:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836793, 542634, 78062, '<td valign="top">Shame the focus is out. Also the greens look a little greyish.</td>', 'Shame the focus is out. Also the greens look a little greyish.', '2007-06-26 15:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836795, 542818, 811, '<td valign="top">Looks a little heavy on the processing to me -- the greens and yellows are a bit bright, and it is just edgier than I prefer (just a personal thing).</td>', 'Looks a little heavy on the processing to me -- the greens and yellows are a bit bright, and it is just edgier than I prefer (just a personal thing).', '2007-06-26 15:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836797, 542500, 811, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  I like the hands showing like that.</td>', 'Great composition.  I like the hands showing like that.', '2007-06-26 15:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836806, 542401, 78062, '<td valign="top">A bit overcooked on the window frame, maybe some selective levels would have helped there.</td>', 'A bit overcooked on the window frame, maybe some selective levels would have helped there.', '2007-06-26 15:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836813, 541994, 78062, '<td valign="top">The focus is off here, i think the greens are a little bluish and the trees look overcooked. This could have been great with a little more tinkering to bring out the detail more in the trunks, the leaves and the spaces between them. A missed oppurtunity.</td>', 'The focus is off here, i think the greens are a little bluish and the trees look overcooked. This could have been great with a little more tinkering to bring out the detail more in the trunks, the leaves and the spaces between them. A missed oppurtunity.', '2007-06-26 15:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836816, 542781, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice pic but I would have liked the sun to have been brighter or more visible.</td>', 'Nice pic but I would have liked the sun to have been brighter or more visible.', '2007-06-26 15:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836824, 542875, 78062, '<td valign="top">This could be amazing if you played with the channel mixer. I''d have pushed the red a bit more and dropped the blues and greens to give it a bit of an ansel adams look. I like it, but feel it could be greater than it is.</td>', 'This could be amazing if you played with the channel mixer. I''d have pushed the red a bit more and dropped the blues and greens to give it a bit of an ansel adams look. I like it, but feel it could be greater than it is.', '2007-06-26 15:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836826, 541397, 78062, '<td valign="top">Needs the horizon straightening, but it does feature that DPC cliched purple sunset!</td>', 'Needs the horizon straightening, but it does feature that DPC cliched purple sunset!', '2007-06-26 15:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836840, 542492, 78062, '<td valign="top">I think this is horrible... sorry but I do. The beige colour of the background reminds me of phlegm and you''ve removed all the detail from the horse''s fur.<br/> <br/>The legs of the horse just look weird as you''ve used the effect on the hooves so it looks a bit disfigured. Also the mane looks like a block on the horses neck rather than a graceful flowing accessory.<br/> <br/>SOrry to go on but I would have preferred this in normal colour, but then again it wouldn''t be too hard to find the horse anyways. I''m at a loss.</td>', 'I think this is horrible... sorry but I do. The beige colour of the background reminds me of phlegm and you''ve removed all the detail from the horse''s fur. The legs of the horse just look weird as you''ve used the effect on the hooves so it looks a bit disfigured. Also the mane looks like a block on the horses neck rather than a graceful flowing accessory. SOrry to go on but I would have preferred this in normal colour, but then again it wouldn''t be too hard to find the horse anyways. I''m at a loss.', '2007-06-26 15:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836842, 542880, 78062, '<td valign="top">More contrast needed.</td>', 'More contrast needed.', '2007-06-26 15:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836850, 542031, 78062, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy at the top there.</td>', 'A bit grainy at the top there.', '2007-06-26 15:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836864, 538889, 78062, '<td valign="top">Looks very flat. Some playing with curves is needed here I think.</td>', 'Looks very flat. Some playing with curves is needed here I think.', '2007-06-26 15:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836874, 540567, 71664, '<td valign="top">Well Done!  I think you should win the blue ribbon.</td>', 'Well Done!  I think you should win the blue ribbon.', '2007-06-26 15:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836877, 542459, 71664, '<td valign="top">Well Done!  I think you should win the red ribbon.</td>', 'Well Done!  I think you should win the red ribbon.', '2007-06-26 15:35:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3836880, 542478, 71664, '<td valign="top">Well Done!  I think you should win the yellow ribbon.</td>', 'Well Done!  I think you should win the yellow ribbon.', '2007-06-26 15:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836883, 542632, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but the processing isn''t very good. The detail on the suit/glove has been removed and the whole image looks very grey.</td>', 'Nice picture but the processing isn''t very good. The detail on the suit/glove has been removed and the whole image looks very grey.', '2007-06-26 15:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836914, 540746, 811, '<td valign="top">Good balanced composition</td>', 'Good balanced composition', '2007-06-26 15:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836916, 542853, 811, '<td valign="top">See ya!  I think altering the composition just a bit so that the ''bare'' spot was more to the left (or right, just not centered) would make this a bit stronger, photographically.  good work with a tricky exposure situation</td>', 'See ya!  I think altering the composition just a bit so that the ''bare'' spot was more to the left (or right, just not centered) would make this a bit stronger, photographically.  good work with a tricky exposure situation', '2007-06-26 15:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836928, 541033, 811, '<td valign="top">That is the funkiest looking building I think I have ever seen.</td>', 'That is the funkiest looking building I think I have ever seen.', '2007-06-26 15:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836931, 542365, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette and colors in this</td>', 'Nice silhouette and colors in this', '2007-06-26 15:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836935, 541994, 811, '<td valign="top">The bear just kinda sneaks in there, eh?  A sharper focus would have made this shot a lot stronger, I think.</td>', 'The bear just kinda sneaks in there, eh?  A sharper focus would have made this shot a lot stronger, I think.', '2007-06-26 15:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3836939, 542625, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition and bw works well.</td>', 'Good composition and bw works well.', '2007-06-26 15:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
