(3837023, 542232, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the pink and green, but there isn''t a lot in the shot to hold the viewer''s interest</td>', 'I like the contrast between the pink and green, but there isn''t a lot in the shot to hold the viewer''s interest', '2007-06-26 16:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
