(3837074, 542608, 42013, '<td valign="top">Nice one. spottable but not too obvious.</td>', 'Nice one. spottable but not too obvious.', '2007-06-26 16:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837075, 542198, 42013, '<td valign="top">I see his shoe! ;)</td>', 'I see his shoe! ;)', '2007-06-26 16:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837076, 542049, 811, '<td valign="top">The composition is too centered, I think.  I think having the centered structure where "waldo" is more to the left or right would add interest to the shot.</td>', 'The composition is too centered, I think.  I think having the centered structure where "waldo" is more to the left or right would add interest to the shot.', '2007-06-26 16:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837077, 542720, 42013, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful scene. I''m sure Waldo is enjoying himself.</td>', 'Very peaceful scene. I''m sure Waldo is enjoying himself.', '2007-06-26 16:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837080, 541542, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the geometric feeling to this, caused I supposed by the different shapes in the frame.</td>', 'I like the geometric feeling to this, caused I supposed by the different shapes in the frame.', '2007-06-26 16:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837081, 542628, 42013, '<td valign="top">Lower right??  I cant make him out entirely.</td>', 'Lower right??  I cant make him out entirely.', '2007-06-26 16:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837082, 542478, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition and colors.  The "vignette'' effect is a bit distracting though, because it is noticeable instead of being subtle.</td>', 'Good composition and colors.  The "vignette'' effect is a bit distracting though, because it is noticeable instead of being subtle.', '2007-06-26 16:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837084, 541982, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition and the exposure works well here.</td>', 'Good composition and the exposure works well here.', '2007-06-26 16:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837085, 542747, 811, '<td valign="top">The crop feels a bit tight on the left.  Maybe a bit more included in the shot to "open" it up a bit?</td>', 'The crop feels a bit tight on the left.  Maybe a bit more included in the shot to "open" it up a bit?', '2007-06-26 16:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837086, 541986, 42013, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Fascinating area.</td>', 'Nice work. Fascinating area.', '2007-06-26 16:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837090, 542745, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I think cropping just a smidgeon off of the left would give it a better feeling of symmetry, though.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I think cropping just a smidgeon off of the left would give it a better feeling of symmetry, though.', '2007-06-26 16:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837091, 542855, 811, '<td valign="top">You could have cropped the top horizontal section off and it would have made the shot feel like it was reaching on up, without stopping.  Good use of the subject to break up the "symmetry."</td>', 'You could have cropped the top horizontal section off and it would have made the shot feel like it was reaching on up, without stopping.  Good use of the subject to break up the "symmetry."', '2007-06-26 16:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837093, 542862, 811, '<td valign="top">Two more steps and he would have been better placed, I think.  Right now, it looks like he is there by accident.</td>', 'Two more steps and he would have been better placed, I think.  Right now, it looks like he is there by accident.', '2007-06-26 16:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837095, 538889, 811, '<td valign="top">It looks like the water is coming out of nowhere.  Nice capture.</td>', 'It looks like the water is coming out of nowhere.  Nice capture.', '2007-06-26 16:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837096, 541744, 42013, '<td valign="top">Thats pretty cool. I''m assuming HDR. or is it just the nature of the painted wall?</td>', 'Thats pretty cool. I''m assuming HDR. or is it just the nature of the painted wall?', '2007-06-26 16:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837099, 538547, 811, '<td valign="top">The focus being off really detracts from what could be an interesting shot.  The colors on the floor section are really nice.</td>', 'The focus being off really detracts from what could be an interesting shot.  The colors on the floor section are really nice.', '2007-06-26 16:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837100, 542602, 42013, '<td valign="top">I''ll pick the middle one.</td>', 'I''ll pick the middle one.', '2007-06-26 16:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837102, 541505, 811, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  I like the balance created by the thicket of trees (and waldo) on the right with the singular tree on the left</td>', 'Lovely shot.  I like the balance created by the thicket of trees (and waldo) on the right with the singular tree on the left', '2007-06-26 16:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837103, 540833, 42013, '<td valign="top">Wow, very saturated greens. I like how you hid Waldo too.</td>', 'Wow, very saturated greens. I like how you hid Waldo too.', '2007-06-26 16:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837105, 542880, 811, '<td valign="top">The red shirt works well here to give some contrast to the shot.</td>', 'The red shirt works well here to give some contrast to the shot.', '2007-06-26 16:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837108, 542652, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the different "simple" shapes showcased here.  There is a lot of "movement" in the shot without anything actually moving.</td>', 'I like the different "simple" shapes showcased here.  There is a lot of "movement" in the shot without anything actually moving.', '2007-06-26 16:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837112, 541548, 811, '<td valign="top">Judging by the post on the left, the shot is "straight," yet it feels like it is tilted to the left a bit.  Maybe it is a perspective thing.</td>', 'Judging by the post on the left, the shot is "straight," yet it feels like it is tilted to the left a bit.  Maybe it is a perspective thing.', '2007-06-26 16:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837116, 542078, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors (though the grass may be a bit green).  I like how the structure and the two trees add movement to the shot by providing two places for the eyes to rest.</td>', 'Awesome colors (though the grass may be a bit green).  I like how the structure and the two trees add movement to the shot by providing two places for the eyes to rest.', '2007-06-26 16:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837117, 541736, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the industrial feeling of this shot.</td>', 'I like the industrial feeling of this shot.', '2007-06-26 16:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837121, 539518, 811, '<td valign="top">Her colors match the wall nicely.  The centered composition doesn''t work as well though.  Maybe move her, or the overall composition, more to the left or right.</td>', 'Her colors match the wall nicely.  The centered composition doesn''t work as well though.  Maybe move her, or the overall composition, more to the left or right.', '2007-06-26 16:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837124, 542720, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  There is a bit too much foreground, for my taste, leading me to believe a horizontal crop may work better.</td>', 'Nice colors.  There is a bit too much foreground, for my taste, leading me to believe a horizontal crop may work better.', '2007-06-26 16:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837135, 541772, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like this as an image (Waldo was pretty easy to find, but that''s okay with me). The approach to land, far off in the distance but within view, preparing to do whatever comes next, the transition from ferry to land, but with the water still a barrier between here and there. Well captured sky and highlights on the water, and composition that I find appealing. Nicely done. 8.</td>', 'I like this as an image (Waldo was pretty easy to find, but that''s okay with me). The approach to land, far off in the distance but within view, preparing to do whatever comes next, the transition from ferry to land, but with the water still a barrier between here and there. Well captured sky and highlights on the water, and composition that I find appealing. Nicely done. 8.', '2007-06-26 16:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837136, 542652, 43073, '<td valign="top">I''m editing this to change it from a comment that just said "6" to what I really wanted to type -- and no, "6" isn''t your score :) Here are my real comments: I like this image, it''s a wonderful black and white with great tones and a wonderful rhythm to the patterns, especially in the benches.  I found Waldo fairly quickly, but that''s not my test for this challenge (I''m actually looking for interesting images). Part of what I like here is the general emptiness you captured without making it feel cold. It''s waiting, anticipating, not lonely. Nice, I give it an 8.</td>', 'I''m editing this to change it from a comment that just said "6" to what I really wanted to type -- and no, "6" isn''t your score :) Here are my real comments: I like this image, it''s a wonderful black and white with great tones and a wonderful rhythm to the patterns, especially in the benches.  I found Waldo fairly quickly, but that''s not my test for this challenge (I''m actually looking for interesting images). Part of what I like here is the general emptiness you captured without making it feel cold. It''s waiting, anticipating, not lonely. Nice, I give it an 8.', '2007-06-26 16:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837138, 542500, 43073, '<td valign="top">Waldo was pretty easy to find here, but I don''t mind; the image itself is strong, and stands on its own aside from the challenge. The capture here, the lines, and the framing by the trees are quite strong. The tones are wonderful, with the highlights working well so bright against the otherwise darker shades of the wood. Bumping this up to a 9.</td>', 'Waldo was pretty easy to find here, but I don''t mind; the image itself is strong, and stands on its own aside from the challenge. The capture here, the lines, and the framing by the trees are quite strong. The tones are wonderful, with the highlights working well so bright against the otherwise darker shades of the wood. Bumping this up to a 9.', '2007-06-26 16:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837147, 542477, 43073, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this, and the concept is excellent. I want to find that spot,  watch the moon shine down on the water, and wait for the ghost to show up and tell me her story. Who is she waiting for? Why didn''t they return? Delightful story, excellent blues, well composed in a pleasant, minimal way. 8.</td>', 'I really like the colors in this, and the concept is excellent. I want to find that spot,  watch the moon shine down on the water, and wait for the ghost to show up and tell me her story. Who is she waiting for? Why didn''t they return? Delightful story, excellent blues, well composed in a pleasant, minimal way. 8.', '2007-06-26 16:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837148, 540993, 43073, '<td valign="top">Excellent image; the tones in the b&amp;w are good, and the textures in the side of the house come through nicely. Use of the shadow for Waldo works so well with the otherwise shadowy tone of the image, and composition is spot on. Delightful.</td>', 'Excellent image; the tones in the b&w are good, and the textures in the side of the house come through nicely. Use of the shadow for Waldo works so well with the otherwise shadowy tone of the image, and composition is spot on. Delightful.', '2007-06-26 16:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837158, 542492, 43073, '<td valign="top">What a cool image; starting with a strong image itself, and processing that just makes it stand out. It makes me wonder how much I actually see the horse when horses jump, and how much I see the surroundings, what they''re jumping, who else is around. I like an image that makes me think to see what''s there. Nicely done.</td>', 'What a cool image; starting with a strong image itself, and processing that just makes it stand out. It makes me wonder how much I actually see the horse when horses jump, and how much I see the surroundings, what they''re jumping, who else is around. I like an image that makes me think to see what''s there. Nicely done.', '2007-06-26 16:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837167, 541033, 43073, '<td valign="top">What a great image; makes me want to go there, and wander around (looking for Waldo, perhaps?); great use of color here as the buildings reflect the blue sky (or are they blue themselves), and the angles and lines just keep bringing me back to see them again. Nicely seen and shot. 8.</td>', 'What a great image; makes me want to go there, and wander around (looking for Waldo, perhaps?); great use of color here as the buildings reflect the blue sky (or are they blue themselves), and the angles and lines just keep bringing me back to see them again. Nicely seen and shot. 8.', '2007-06-26 16:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837177, 542793, 43073, '<td valign="top">"Mr Nesbit, would you stand up please." Wonderful caption, and more importantly, wonderful image. The windows reflecting not an image but tones and shades, and the deep blue throughout . . . just perfect. I might have (emphasize might) taken a tad bit more off the left side, but as is it''s a very strong, appealing image. Bumping up to 9.</td>', '"Mr Nesbit, would you stand up please." Wonderful caption, and more importantly, wonderful image. The windows reflecting not an image but tones and shades, and the deep blue throughout . . . just perfect. I might have (emphasize might) taken a tad bit more off the left side, but as is it''s a very strong, appealing image. Bumping up to 9.', '2007-06-26 16:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837181, 542459, 43073, '<td valign="top">I didn''t need to look closer (Waldo was pretty easy to see), but I don''t mind that; what''s important to me is the image itself, which is very strong. I want to find that place, with those clouds, and those hills. Are there dragons hiding nearby, or is it just a peaceful place to visit. Gets my imagination going. Well done. 8.</td>', 'I didn''t need to look closer (Waldo was pretty easy to see), but I don''t mind that; what''s important to me is the image itself, which is very strong. I want to find that place, with those clouds, and those hills. Are there dragons hiding nearby, or is it just a peaceful place to visit. Gets my imagination going. Well done. 8.', '2007-06-26 16:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837187, 542854, 43073, '<td valign="top">Waldo''s not too important here for me; this image stands on its own. The light star bursts add a really special element to this image, driving the eye down the ally. What''s there, what''s coming, or what''s leaving? Why is Waldo just standing there? Questions questions . . . nicely shot and processed image, with strong composition, coloring and lighting. 8.</td>', 'Waldo''s not too important here for me; this image stands on its own. The light star bursts add a really special element to this image, driving the eye down the ally. What''s there, what''s coming, or what''s leaving? Why is Waldo just standing there? Questions questions . . . nicely shot and processed image, with strong composition, coloring and lighting. 8.', '2007-06-26 16:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837189, 541337, 811, '<td valign="top">The building seems to be leaning a bit to the right -- perspective correction needed maybe?  Otherwise, awesome colors.</td>', 'The building seems to be leaning a bit to the right -- perspective correction needed maybe?  Otherwise, awesome colors.', '2007-06-26 16:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837190, 540275, 43073, '<td valign="top">Overwhelming. That''s my reaction to this shot. From the angle (which I love) to the tightly compressed range of shades, all silvery looking. Waldo''s there, but it''s about the lines, the curves, the metal and the glass. Delightful shot. 8.</td>', 'Overwhelming. That''s my reaction to this shot. From the angle (which I love) to the tightly compressed range of shades, all silvery looking. Waldo''s there, but it''s about the lines, the curves, the metal and the glass. Delightful shot. 8.', '2007-06-26 16:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837191, 542626, 811, '<td valign="top">This is a very desolate looking shot.</td>', 'This is a very desolate looking shot.', '2007-06-26 16:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837193, 542459, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, and the composition is good.</td>', 'Nice colors, and the composition is good.', '2007-06-26 16:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837194, 540274, 811, '<td valign="top">YIKES!  Good use of bw.</td>', 'YIKES!  Good use of bw.', '2007-06-26 16:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837198, 541117, 43073, '<td valign="top">A generally nice shot made special by the challenge (many here went the opposite direction, being good shots in spite of the challenge); here this works for me because I''m looking for Waldo, and when I found him/her, I laughed out loud. Perfect impact for the image and the challenge. 8.</td>', 'A generally nice shot made special by the challenge (many here went the opposite direction, being good shots in spite of the challenge); here this works for me because I''m looking for Waldo, and when I found him/her, I laughed out loud. Perfect impact for the image and the challenge. 8.', '2007-06-26 16:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837199, 542850, 811, '<td valign="top">The eyes being in focus is a definite plus.  However, because the tree is so dominately in front, and it is soft, it almost gives the impression that the whole shot is out of focus.</td>', 'The eyes being in focus is a definite plus.  However, because the tree is so dominately in front, and it is soft, it almost gives the impression that the whole shot is out of focus.', '2007-06-26 16:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837200, 542261, 811, '<td valign="top">Peek-a-boo.  Good composition and I like that the details are present in the wood.</td>', 'Peek-a-boo.  Good composition and I like that the details are present in the wood.', '2007-06-26 16:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837201, 542848, 811, '<td valign="top">A bit hazy looking, but I like the perspective of this.</td>', 'A bit hazy looking, but I like the perspective of this.', '2007-06-26 16:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837202, 541784, 43073, '<td valign="top">Such a great feel to this image, so perfectly processed, with delightful tones used on the subdued lighting. Such even lighting gives it a surreal look, as you''ve said, like a lost world. Excellent subject and well captured and presented image. 8.</td>', 'Such a great feel to this image, so perfectly processed, with delightful tones used on the subdued lighting. Such even lighting gives it a surreal look, as you''ve said, like a lost world. Excellent subject and well captured and presented image. 8.', '2007-06-26 16:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837204, 542329, 811, '<td valign="top">The little strip of water at the bottom is a touch distracting, but otherwise, this is a beautiful shot.</td>', 'The little strip of water at the bottom is a touch distracting, but otherwise, this is a beautiful shot.', '2007-06-26 16:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837207, 542498, 811, '<td valign="top">Really nicely done bw -- and good level of contrast</td>', 'Really nicely done bw -- and good level of contrast', '2007-06-26 16:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837211, 542372, 59577, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool location. The sea looks weird as it changes to black. I am assuming the blue in the middle is the sea anyway. I would have liked to have seen some texture on it.</td>', 'This is a very cool location. The sea looks weird as it changes to black. I am assuming the blue in the middle is the sea anyway. I would have liked to have seen some texture on it.', '2007-06-26 16:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837217, 542492, 811, '<td valign="top">You like to go for the processed look, don''t you. :)<br/>I actually find this one rather interesting.  Perhaps because the colors are way of the "natural" colors.</td>', 'You like to go for the processed look, don''t you. :)I actually find this one rather interesting.  Perhaps because the colors are way of the "natural" colors.', '2007-06-26 16:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837221, 542869, 811, '<td valign="top">Just having the foot and hand was a good idea.</td>', 'Just having the foot and hand was a good idea.', '2007-06-26 16:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837223, 542747, 43073, '<td valign="top">Good concept for the challenge, and well executed. The processing fits perfectly, and I''m just waiting for "Waldo" to jump out and yell, "Surprise!! Here I am!!!" Good feel and composition throughout. 8.</td>', 'Good concept for the challenge, and well executed. The processing fits perfectly, and I''m just waiting for "Waldo" to jump out and yell, "Surprise!! Here I am!!!" Good feel and composition throughout. 8.', '2007-06-26 16:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837224, 542221, 811, '<td valign="top">a sharper focus would have made this shot a lot stronger.</td>', 'a sharper focus would have made this shot a lot stronger.', '2007-06-26 16:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837229, 541744, 43073, '<td valign="top">Great use of the painting to "hide" "Waldo". Composition here is maybe a bit too influenced by the challenge (bringing Waldo into the frame a bit more would strengthen it to my eye), but works nicely as is. Nicely seen and shot.</td>', 'Great use of the painting to "hide" "Waldo". Composition here is maybe a bit too influenced by the challenge (bringing Waldo into the frame a bit more would strengthen it to my eye), but works nicely as is. Nicely seen and shot.', '2007-06-26 16:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837236, 541489, 43073, '<td valign="top">I was hoping for one of these; I tried to talk a friend into climbing on top of a building, but he wasn''t going for it. Here, the choices are great. Two people, the lines from the block of the buildings, and nice earth tones against the sky. I wonder how this would look in B&amp;W? I might have tried some different crops, as well (maybe moving the block lower and to the left; maybe), but for me it''s strong as is, too. 8.</td>', 'I was hoping for one of these; I tried to talk a friend into climbing on top of a building, but he wasn''t going for it. Here, the choices are great. Two people, the lines from the block of the buildings, and nice earth tones against the sky. I wonder how this would look in B&W? I might have tried some different crops, as well (maybe moving the block lower and to the left; maybe), but for me it''s strong as is, too. 8.', '2007-06-26 16:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837249, 541506, 43073, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice for the challenge. Using a person turned around to "imitate" a rock was a good choice. The image here stands on its own, as well; it''s a delightful scene in a wonderful location, and the processing and treatment you''ve given it do it justice. 8.</td>', 'Excellent choice for the challenge. Using a person turned around to "imitate" a rock was a good choice. The image here stands on its own, as well; it''s a delightful scene in a wonderful location, and the processing and treatment you''ve given it do it justice. 8.', '2007-06-26 17:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837252, 542057, 43073, '<td valign="top">I had already set this as an 8, but it''s getting bumped up. It''s just wonderful. Great greens set against the dark water and the grey paths, wonderful use of the reflection to meet the challenge (the least of my concerns here, but a plus in your case), and good use of lines to drive the eye around the image. 9.</td>', 'I had already set this as an 8, but it''s getting bumped up. It''s just wonderful. Great greens set against the dark water and the grey paths, wonderful use of the reflection to meet the challenge (the least of my concerns here, but a plus in your case), and good use of lines to drive the eye around the image. 9.', '2007-06-26 17:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837269, 542349, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the bw, but it seems a bit soft, and perhaps tilted to the right just a hair (though I admit that may be me).</td>', 'I like the bw, but it seems a bit soft, and perhaps tilted to the right just a hair (though I admit that may be me).', '2007-06-26 17:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837270, 542775, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal "motion" of this shot</td>', 'I like the diagonal "motion" of this shot', '2007-06-26 17:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837273, 542428, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring (or lack thereof) you have used here.  I just about missed "waldo" but it is rather alarming now that he has jumped out at me. :)  Having the bridge and the supports appear "soft" works once waldo is found, but until then, it gives the illusion that the shot is a touch soft, as well.</td>', 'I like the coloring (or lack thereof) you have used here.  I just about missed "waldo" but it is rather alarming now that he has jumped out at me. :)  Having the bridge and the supports appear "soft" works once waldo is found, but until then, it gives the illusion that the shot is a touch soft, as well.', '2007-06-26 17:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837274, 542857, 811, '<td valign="top">I like how the path leads through the frame</td>', 'I like how the path leads through the frame', '2007-06-26 17:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837276, 542875, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape.  The wispy cloud on the right is a neat shape.</td>', 'Nice landscape.  The wispy cloud on the right is a neat shape.', '2007-06-26 17:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837279, 542634, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this', '2007-06-26 17:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837284, 542372, 811, '<td valign="top">That is cool. At first glance, it is hard to tell if you are looking under an arch, or if it is a reflecting pool.</td>', 'That is cool. At first glance, it is hard to tell if you are looking under an arch, or if it is a reflecting pool.', '2007-06-26 17:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837286, 541676, 811, '<td valign="top">The orange and green contrast nicely here</td>', 'The orange and green contrast nicely here', '2007-06-26 17:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837289, 541117, 811, '<td valign="top">The composition is a bit too simple here.  It doesn''t compel the viewer to look past the initial impression of "it''s a shed."  Nicely exposed and focused, though.</td>', 'The composition is a bit too simple here.  It doesn''t compel the viewer to look past the initial impression of "it''s a shed."  Nicely exposed and focused, though.', '2007-06-26 17:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837295, 542598, 811, '<td valign="top">Don''t work too hard!  I think the sepia works here, because if it were in color it would be very busy, I think.</td>', 'Don''t work too hard!  I think the sepia works here, because if it were in color it would be very busy, I think.', '2007-06-26 17:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837300, 542858, 43073, '<td valign="top">An image that makes me wonder; what is this place? Is it abandoned, or used but unloved. Placement of Waldo is good, and makes me wonder what he''s doing there. Something non-Waldo-ish, I imagine, from the look of the rest of the image. A little more depth in the sky might have given this more impact for me, but as is contributes nicely to the overall washed out feeling I get from the building. 8.</td>', 'An image that makes me wonder; what is this place? Is it abandoned, or used but unloved. Placement of Waldo is good, and makes me wonder what he''s doing there. Something non-Waldo-ish, I imagine, from the look of the rest of the image. A little more depth in the sky might have given this more impact for me, but as is contributes nicely to the overall washed out feeling I get from the building. 8.', '2007-06-26 17:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837302, 541266, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but the composition feels a bit static.  Maybe not having the horizon cut the frame in half would help -- move it up or down a bit.</td>', 'Nice colors, but the composition feels a bit static.  Maybe not having the horizon cut the frame in half would help -- move it up or down a bit.', '2007-06-26 17:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837306, 542601, 811, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice sky.  The falls and trees though are a bit bland.  Perhaps there is too much included in the shot for the eye to focus on any specific thing.</td>', 'That''s a nice sky.  The falls and trees though are a bit bland.  Perhaps there is too much included in the shot for the eye to focus on any specific thing.', '2007-06-26 17:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837308, 542478, 43073, '<td valign="top">Great image, nice use of vignette to push our eyes to the house. The juxtaposition of the house with the hill looks good to me; almost as though these two things which we know are far apart somehow run together. Excellent colors and textures throughout. 8.</td>', 'Great image, nice use of vignette to push our eyes to the house. The juxtaposition of the house with the hill looks good to me; almost as though these two things which we know are far apart somehow run together. Excellent colors and textures throughout. 8.', '2007-06-26 17:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837309, 542111, 811, '<td valign="top">She blends nicely.  Good perspective and implied leading lines in this one.</td>', 'She blends nicely.  Good perspective and implied leading lines in this one.', '2007-06-26 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837311, 542781, 811, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful and serene looking.</td>', 'Very peaceful and serene looking.', '2007-06-26 17:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837315, 542621, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the orange and green, but the "edge" that it has is not appealing to me.  Also, the vignetting effect is distracting because it is so obvious, perhaps if it were more subtle, it might be more appealing ot me.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the orange and green, but the "edge" that it has is not appealing to me.  Also, the vignetting effect is distracting because it is so obvious, perhaps if it were more subtle, it might be more appealing ot me.', '2007-06-26 17:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837319, 542420, 811, '<td valign="top">Humorous. . You made me laugh.  The composition on the right is a bit too tight, I think.  Since all of them are shown completely on the left, it may feel more balanced to show them all on teh right.  If you cropped some off of the left, though, that may work as well.</td>', 'Humorous. . You made me laugh.  The composition on the right is a bit too tight, I think.  Since all of them are shown completely on the left, it may feel more balanced to show them all on teh right.  If you cropped some off of the left, though, that may work as well.', '2007-06-26 17:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837320, 540553, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this and the contrast between the building/sky and the silhouettes.</td>', 'I really like the colors in this and the contrast between the building/sky and the silhouettes.', '2007-06-26 17:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837321, 542812, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the randomness of this composition</td>', 'I like the randomness of this composition', '2007-06-26 17:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837325, 540468, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture, but having him so centered is a bit disconcerting.  Maybe if he were a bit to the left/right or up/down it would seem a bit more dynamic.</td>', 'Good capture, but having him so centered is a bit disconcerting.  Maybe if he were a bit to the left/right or up/down it would seem a bit more dynamic.', '2007-06-26 17:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
