(3837331, 541712, 811, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but not very compelling/interesting either.  Technically, it is a well done picture, but there isn''t a lot in it to make it stand out amongst the crowd.</td>', 'Not bad, but not very compelling/interesting either.  Technically, it is a well done picture, but there isn''t a lot in it to make it stand out amongst the crowd.', '2007-06-26 17:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
