(3837433, 542608, 43073, '<td valign="top">I love the way the pipes look like centipedes; lovely image, great lines, and good choice to meet the challenge. The greens here against the silver and gray pipes work really well. Nicely composed. Well done. 8.</td>', 'I love the way the pipes look like centipedes; lovely image, great lines, and good choice to meet the challenge. The greens here against the silver and gray pipes work really well. Nicely composed. Well done. 8.', '2007-06-26 17:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
