(3837456, 542031, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition, and I like the bw, though the dark grey sky makes it feel a bit gray overall.</td>', 'Good composition, and I like the bw, though the dark grey sky makes it feel a bit gray overall.', '2007-06-26 17:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
