(3837462, 542858, 811, '<td valign="top">A sharper focus and a bit brighter on the silo and graffiti would make this shot more effective, I think.</td>', 'A sharper focus and a bit brighter on the silo and graffiti would make this shot more effective, I think.', '2007-06-26 17:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837463, 541878, 811, '<td valign="top">Very spooky and eerie looking, perhaps due to the slight reddish cast.</td>', 'Very spooky and eerie looking, perhaps due to the slight reddish cast.', '2007-06-26 17:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837467, 541772, 811, '<td valign="top">Having the horizon cut this in half really weakens the composition, in my opinion.  I think either using less sky , or having more at the bottom so that we can see more than just his head would help it.</td>', 'Having the horizon cut this in half really weakens the composition, in my opinion.  I think either using less sky , or having more at the bottom so that we can see more than just his head would help it.', '2007-06-26 17:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837469, 542260, 811, '<td valign="top">Hidden well.  Missed it on the first time around.  :)</td>', 'Hidden well.  Missed it on the first time around.  :)', '2007-06-26 17:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837474, 542768, 811, '<td valign="top">Great color contrast!  The only minor nit -- the eye "whites" look really blue.  was that intentional.  I can''t vote on this one, but if I could, I would give it a 7 or so.</td>', 'Great color contrast!  The only minor nit -- the eye "whites" look really blue.  was that intentional.  I can''t vote on this one, but if I could, I would give it a 7 or so.', '2007-06-26 17:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837497, 542078, 43073, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Such wonderful shades of green, such a blue, blue sky, monument almost in complete shadow, but with details working to show through. Composition is spot on, makes me want to run up the road to "Waldo" and ask what''s over the hill. Delightful. 8.</td>', 'Lovely. Such wonderful shades of green, such a blue, blue sky, monument almost in complete shadow, but with details working to show through. Composition is spot on, makes me want to run up the road to "Waldo" and ask what''s over the hill. Delightful. 8.', '2007-06-26 17:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837638, 542221, 76941, '<td valign="top">interesting image. might have been harder to find if you had put the real eye off-center.</td>', 'interesting image. might have been harder to find if you had put the real eye off-center.', '2007-06-26 18:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837770, 542828, 79242, '<td valign="top">Well, I am gonna have to go ahead and give this a 10 and say that it is my favorite image in the Challenge. The bird really pulls it together.</td>', 'Well, I am gonna have to go ahead and give this a 10 and say that it is my favorite image in the Challenge. The bird really pulls it together.', '2007-06-26 18:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837780, 541744, 79242, '<td valign="top">What a cool building. I like this photo a lot. Probably my second favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'What a cool building. I like this photo a lot. Probably my second favorite in the challenge.', '2007-06-26 18:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837784, 542720, 79242, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Makes me wish I was there. I love the colors.</td>', 'Very nice capture. Makes me wish I was there. I love the colors.', '2007-06-26 18:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837816, 539518, 93927, '<td valign="top">i found her!</td>', 'i found her!', '2007-06-26 19:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837902, 538679, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well I keep thinking I have spotted Waldo and then I look again and I am not so sure.  Is it that speck in the ocean?  Who cares this is a wonderful shot of a beautiful beach</td>', 'Well I keep thinking I have spotted Waldo and then I look again and I am not so sure.  Is it that speck in the ocean?  Who cares this is a wonderful shot of a beautiful beach', '2007-06-26 19:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837907, 541033, 68035, '<td valign="top">Gee what a great piece of architecture, yup I can spot Waldo in the shorts but in truth who cares I am way more interested in the excellent capture which is superbly set off by that great shy!</td>', 'Gee what a great piece of architecture, yup I can spot Waldo in the shorts but in truth who cares I am way more interested in the excellent capture which is superbly set off by that great shy!', '2007-06-26 19:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837912, 542602, 68035, '<td valign="top">OK its a little bit noisy but I truly love this shot.  A wonderful and very clever take on the competition, you may suffer in the hands of some voters but as an idea I give this a solid 7 - super</td>', 'OK its a little bit noisy but I truly love this shot.  A wonderful and very clever take on the competition, you may suffer in the hands of some voters but as an idea I give this a solid 7 - super', '2007-06-26 19:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837916, 542478, 68035, '<td valign="top">Love the distant detached expression on ''Waldo'' here which really compliments a wonderful setting and shot</td>', 'Love the distant detached expression on ''Waldo'' here which really compliments a wonderful setting and shot', '2007-06-26 19:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837922, 542078, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great landscape, are there two Waldos on that road?  Beautiful colouring and you have got the blues and the greens really complimenting each other</td>', 'Great landscape, are there two Waldos on that road?  Beautiful colouring and you have got the blues and the greens really complimenting each other', '2007-06-26 19:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837924, 542492, 68035, '<td valign="top">Why?</td>', 'Why?', '2007-06-26 19:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837930, 542720, 68035, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, if this was in a holiday brochure then I would want to go here, yes I can see Waldo and I bet they are enjoying the wonderful warmth of the setting sun that you have captured so well</td>', 'Beautiful, if this was in a holiday brochure then I would want to go here, yes I can see Waldo and I bet they are enjoying the wonderful warmth of the setting sun that you have captured so well', '2007-06-26 19:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837937, 542260, 68035, '<td valign="top">We''ve got fun and games<br/> <br/>Nice foliage shot and yes I can spot waldo, good strong greens in this image which can easily be lost when you are shooting against a solid background of plants</td>', 'We''ve got fun and games Nice foliage shot and yes I can spot waldo, good strong greens in this image which can easily be lost when you are shooting against a solid background of plants', '2007-06-26 19:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837940, 539064, 68035, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ethereal feel to this, kinda almost feels like IR but then waldo doesnt appear to be.  Nice shot</td>', 'Beautiful ethereal feel to this, kinda almost feels like IR but then waldo doesnt appear to be.  Nice shot', '2007-06-26 19:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837944, 542607, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot if slightly spooky, great capture of the persons expression and well blended in without being too obscure</td>', 'Lovely shot if slightly spooky, great capture of the persons expression and well blended in without being too obscure', '2007-06-26 19:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837946, 539399, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, yes I can see Waldo on the pathbut congrats on making him/her big enough to be recognisable without feeling intrusive in the shot</td>', 'Very nice image, yes I can see Waldo on the pathbut congrats on making him/her big enough to be recognisable without feeling intrusive in the shot', '2007-06-26 19:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837948, 541676, 68035, '<td valign="top">Not sure whether waldo looks to happy being seemingly behind bars, nice simple and very crisp image</td>', 'Not sure whether waldo looks to happy being seemingly behind bars, nice simple and very crisp image', '2007-06-26 19:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837954, 541982, 68035, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image and certainly one were if you were not looking for Waldo you would think that there was no one in the frame, love the water capture, although for me its a little dark in places (the shot not the water).  Very nice though</td>', 'Beautiful image and certainly one were if you were not looking for Waldo you would think that there was no one in the frame, love the water capture, although for me its a little dark in places (the shot not the water).  Very nice though', '2007-06-26 19:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837958, 542858, 68035, '<td valign="top">LOL one of those where you really have to scan around to find waldo.  I think it meets the challenge very well although IMO there is something about the shot in its entirety that does not really grab the viewer.</td>', 'LOL one of those where you really have to scan around to find waldo.  I think it meets the challenge very well although IMO there is something about the shot in its entirety that does not really grab the viewer.', '2007-06-26 19:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837962, 542852, 68035, '<td valign="top">LOL waldo almost looks like a scarecrow.  Nice B&amp;W conversion although perhaps could have done with a shade more contrast to bring the trees out a touch more</td>', 'LOL waldo almost looks like a scarecrow.  Nice B&W conversion although perhaps could have done with a shade more contrast to bring the trees out a touch more', '2007-06-26 19:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837968, 542230, 68035, '<td valign="top">Having looked through the Thumbs there seems to be a few of this structure would I be right in guessing this comes from the Washington GTG.  Regardless of this I think I have spotted Waldo tucked away and I really like the way the area behind the ampitheatre almost looks like a fairytale backdrop.  A very nice 7</td>', 'Having looked through the Thumbs there seems to be a few of this structure would I be right in guessing this comes from the Washington GTG.  Regardless of this I think I have spotted Waldo tucked away and I really like the way the area behind the ampitheatre almost looks like a fairytale backdrop.  A very nice 7', '2007-06-26 19:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837973, 542198, 68035, '<td valign="top">Strange, obviously I can spot Waldo but in terms of the image in its entirety I am not sure whether the really soft contrasts work or not.  I do love the double framing effect though</td>', 'Strange, obviously I can spot Waldo but in terms of the image in its entirety I am not sure whether the really soft contrasts work or not.  I do love the double framing effect though', '2007-06-26 19:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837975, 541891, 68035, '<td valign="top">ooooo quite a tricky Waldo to spot, though excellent because once you have you think ''how could I have missed him before''  Beautifully composed shot although the colours seem a little flat to me</td>', 'ooooo quite a tricky Waldo to spot, though excellent because once you have you think ''how could I have missed him before''  Beautifully composed shot although the colours seem a little flat to me', '2007-06-26 19:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837976, 542775, 68035, '<td valign="top">You may suffer because your Waldo is quite ''easy'' to spot, strangely enough whilst I like the composition and the perspective I may have prefered it if young waldo was slightly sharper</td>', 'You may suffer because your Waldo is quite ''easy'' to spot, strangely enough whilst I like the composition and the perspective I may have prefered it if young waldo was slightly sharper', '2007-06-26 19:57:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3837987, 541023, 68035, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image fantastically composed.  I get the feeling that if I wasnt looking for Waldo I would not have noticed him until a lot later whenI would have thought ''wow there is someone there'' and that would have given the picture a whole new dimension.  Like this image 7</td>', 'Beautiful image fantastically composed.  I get the feeling that if I wasnt looking for Waldo I would not have noticed him until a lot later whenI would have thought ''wow there is someone there'' and that would have given the picture a whole new dimension.  Like this image 7', '2007-06-26 19:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837993, 538547, 68035, '<td valign="top">I think I have spotted Waldo on the floor, very well hidden but it almost feels like there is a touch of shake on the camera which is blurring the overall image.  I think this is great for this particulat challenge but is not necessarily a shot that would be appealing outside of it</td>', 'I think I have spotted Waldo on the floor, very well hidden but it almost feels like there is a touch of shake on the camera which is blurring the overall image.  I think this is great for this particulat challenge but is not necessarily a shot that would be appealing outside of it', '2007-06-26 20:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838003, 542309, 68035, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  In terms of the challenge the eyes are drawn straight to the overturned boat expecting to find Waldo beneath it and it is only after a while your eyes go up the the pier to find him.  A very good shot that works well as both an entry for the challenge and an image in its own right 7</td>', 'Excellent.  In terms of the challenge the eyes are drawn straight to the overturned boat expecting to find Waldo beneath it and it is only after a while your eyes go up the the pier to find him.  A very good shot that works well as both an entry for the challenge and an image in its own right 7', '2007-06-26 20:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838010, 541397, 68035, '<td valign="top">OK so Waldo is hardly well hidden but to answer your question...Yes I do.  Magnificent and enchanting sky.  I love the framing (although perversely would prefer it without Waldo...Ohh and please tell me he wasnt using a mobile phone whilst he was surrounded by so much beauty) Overall a 7</td>', 'OK so Waldo is hardly well hidden but to answer your question...Yes I do.  Magnificent and enchanting sky.  I love the framing (although perversely would prefer it without Waldo...Ohh and please tell me he wasnt using a mobile phone whilst he was surrounded by so much beauty) Overall a 7', '2007-06-26 20:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838014, 541489, 68035, '<td valign="top">Yaaay two waldos for the price of one.  Very interesting strcture well captured</td>', 'Yaaay two waldos for the price of one.  Very interesting strcture well captured', '2007-06-26 20:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838025, 542329, 68035, '<td valign="top">Super, a hidden Waldo which is in full view, a charming shot which stands well either in or out of this competition</td>', 'Super, a hidden Waldo which is in full view, a charming shot which stands well either in or out of this competition', '2007-06-26 20:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838097, 542874, 68035, '<td valign="top">A real dichotomy with this picture.  I love the image but find Waldo (waldina) a bit of a distraction...Of course if you exclude her then you dont have an entry for the challenge.  I want to marvel at the beautiful array of colours and the sharpness of the shot yet find myself distracted by the person on the right.  I like the shot but would have really loved it if you had cropped out waldo and entered it into the free study.  Still scoring a 7</td>', 'A real dichotomy with this picture.  I love the image but find Waldo (waldina) a bit of a distraction...Of course if you exclude her then you dont have an entry for the challenge.  I want to marvel at the beautiful array of colours and the sharpness of the shot yet find myself distracted by the person on the right.  I like the shot but would have really loved it if you had cropped out waldo and entered it into the free study.  Still scoring a 7', '2007-06-26 20:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838108, 541460, 68035, '<td valign="top">Bleak but striking image.  Very clever title</td>', 'Bleak but striking image.  Very clever title', '2007-06-26 20:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838109, 542628, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very good hiding and nice composition</td>', 'Very good hiding and nice composition', '2007-06-26 20:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838129, 542609, 68035, '<td valign="top">This is so weird.  I looked at this image before and remember I definitely ''found'' waldo, but on returning to it I am damned if I can find him again.  Brilliant in that I am so sure I saw Waldo before but now you have me doubting myself.  For that reason alone I think it meets the challenge very well and I am scoring it a 9 (lose one for the slightly blown out sky).  The use of the canister is outstanding as it keeps drawing the eye, even though I know Waldo is not near it</td>', 'This is so weird.  I looked at this image before and remember I definitely ''found'' waldo, but on returning to it I am damned if I can find him again.  Brilliant in that I am so sure I saw Waldo before but now you have me doubting myself.  For that reason alone I think it meets the challenge very well and I am scoring it a 9 (lose one for the slightly blown out sky).  The use of the canister is outstanding as it keeps drawing the eye, even though I know Waldo is not near it', '2007-06-26 20:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838136, 542873, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very clever take on the competition.  Ive got the milk and newspaper waldo but am wondering whether waldo no 3 is the photo or not<br/> <br/>Very intriguing</td>', 'Very clever take on the competition.  Ive got the milk and newspaper waldo but am wondering whether waldo no 3 is the photo or not Very intriguing', '2007-06-26 20:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838138, 542420, 68035, '<td valign="top">Bizarre and slightly disturbing shot....I like it!!!</td>', 'Bizarre and slightly disturbing shot....I like it!!!', '2007-06-26 20:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838143, 541772, 68035, '<td valign="top">Ooooo wow I was just thinking theres no waldo in this shot and then I spotted her in the turquoise.  Very well done considering the amount of ''dead space'' there is in the image</td>', 'Ooooo wow I was just thinking theres no waldo in this shot and then I spotted her in the turquoise.  Very well done considering the amount of ''dead space'' there is in the image', '2007-06-26 20:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838145, 541837, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely perspective and beautiful scenrey.  Well done for making waldo obvious but not conspicuous</td>', 'Lovely perspective and beautiful scenrey.  Well done for making waldo obvious but not conspicuous', '2007-06-26 20:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838155, 542855, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice image but for me it kinda falls between two stools, Waldo is big enough not to be challenging to find yet not quite big enough to really get a feel for the person</td>', 'Nice image but for me it kinda falls between two stools, Waldo is big enough not to be challenging to find yet not quite big enough to really get a feel for the person', '2007-06-26 20:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838156, 540929, 79167, '<td valign="top">wow, ultra-creative!!! definitely a favorite!</td>', 'wow, ultra-creative!!! definitely a favorite!', '2007-06-26 20:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838158, 542787, 68035, '<td valign="top">Yes, I can find Waldo.  I think overall theframing and the dof makes for a fascinating shot.  Interesting and effective shallow dof</td>', 'Yes, I can find Waldo.  I think overall theframing and the dof makes for a fascinating shot.  Interesting and effective shallow dof', '2007-06-26 20:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838161, 542365, 68035, '<td valign="top">Excellent and owerful image, maybe if I hadnt been actively looking for waldo it would have been one i missed&gt;  Beautiful red tones really make this shot</td>', 'Excellent and owerful image, maybe if I hadnt been actively looking for waldo it would have been one i missed>  Beautiful red tones really make this shot', '2007-06-26 20:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838162, 541397, 79167, '<td valign="top">wow, this is a really beautiful shot!</td>', 'wow, this is a really beautiful shot!', '2007-06-26 20:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838166, 541744, 68035, '<td valign="top">Brilliant I love the way the little feller is subsumed by the mural<br/> <br/>Nice B&amp;W conversion and a very appealing shot</td>', 'Brilliant I love the way the little feller is subsumed by the mural Nice B&W conversion and a very appealing shot', '2007-06-26 20:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838172, 541722, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wow, now there is a Waldo you have to search for, very well done and congrats on waldo not impinging on what is a wonderful vista with great dark rich colours</td>', 'Wow, now there is a Waldo you have to search for, very well done and congrats on waldo not impinging on what is a wonderful vista with great dark rich colours', '2007-06-26 20:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838181, 541723, 68035, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC!!!!!!  Just excellent for this challenge, Waldo is so hard to find till you spot him and then you think how did I miss him.  SCoring 9 for the challenge (lose one for the slightly blown out green on the frog).  Good luck</td>', 'FANTASTIC!!!!!!  Just excellent for this challenge, Waldo is so hard to find till you spot him and then you think how did I miss him.  SCoring 9 for the challenge (lose one for the slightly blown out green on the frog).  Good luck', '2007-06-26 20:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838183, 542598, 68035, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge, the duotone works well in terms of providing some concealment</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge, the duotone works well in terms of providing some concealment', '2007-06-26 20:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838212, 541506, 79167, '<td valign="top">wow, nice job hiding the person!!!! great photo, too!</td>', 'wow, nice job hiding the person!!!! great photo, too!', '2007-06-26 20:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838342, 542787, 45475, '<td valign="top">Cool. Really busy, makes you want to look out into the field for Waldo/Waldina :D I think you''ve over-darkened the shadows though. But overall, an interesting entry to the challenge.</td>', 'Cool. Really busy, makes you want to look out into the field for Waldo/Waldina :D I think you''ve over-darkened the shadows though. But overall, an interesting entry to the challenge.', '2007-06-26 21:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838345, 540902, 45475, '<td valign="top">Spotted! Well done :) The subject matter is a little depressing, but a thoughtful entry nonetheless.</td>', 'Spotted! Well done :) The subject matter is a little depressing, but a thoughtful entry nonetheless.', '2007-06-26 21:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838349, 542105, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. Could do with a bit more light, but still a wonderful mess of lines to keep my interest here.</td>', 'Great perspective. Could do with a bit more light, but still a wonderful mess of lines to keep my interest here.', '2007-06-26 21:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838351, 542781, 45475, '<td valign="top">Yes it has. And a glorious one at that. Stunning capture, well done!</td>', 'Yes it has. And a glorious one at that. Stunning capture, well done!', '2007-06-26 21:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838353, 542633, 45475, '<td valign="top">Clever take on the challenge. Nice work!</td>', 'Clever take on the challenge. Nice work!', '2007-06-26 21:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838357, 541736, 45475, '<td valign="top">Got him! On the first landing at the back there? I hope so, otherwise, you have me stumped :D Great shot too, wonderful strong lines.</td>', 'Got him! On the first landing at the back there? I hope so, otherwise, you have me stumped :D Great shot too, wonderful strong lines.', '2007-06-26 21:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
