(3838394, 542598, 45475, '<td valign="top">Heh, Waldo''s are all the same when it comes to this....</td>', 'Heh, Waldo''s are all the same when it comes to this....', '2007-06-26 21:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838398, 538889, 45475, '<td valign="top">Hanging on the tree? Great set up! The b&amp;w conversion looks a little flat and grey. If you have photoshop, maybe try the channel mixer - monochrome, or even a b&amp;w gradient map. Works much better than desat or greyscale.</td>', 'Hanging on the tree? Great set up! The b&w conversion looks a little flat and grey. If you have photoshop, maybe try the channel mixer - monochrome, or even a b&w gradient map. Works much better than desat or greyscale.', '2007-06-26 21:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838402, 541794, 45475, '<td valign="top">A splendid scene. Unfortunately a little over exposed and flat, but you''re on the right track.</td>', 'A splendid scene. Unfortunately a little over exposed and flat, but you''re on the right track.', '2007-06-26 21:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838407, 542875, 45475, '<td valign="top">Cool scene but the sepia is not working for me on this one. Too flat maybe? More contrast? Not sure, but fix that and you have a whopper of a marketable print on your hands :)</td>', 'Cool scene but the sepia is not working for me on this one. Too flat maybe? More contrast? Not sure, but fix that and you have a whopper of a marketable print on your hands :)', '2007-06-26 21:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838467, 540929, 73250, '<td valign="top">This is incredible...it''s creative and well done.</td>', 'This is incredible...it''s creative and well done.', '2007-06-26 22:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838532, 542875, 36102, '<td valign="top">Good color for this shot</td>', 'Good color for this shot', '2007-06-26 22:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838539, 540517, 36102, '<td valign="top">This could be an amazing shot but the colors don''t pop for me.</td>', 'This could be an amazing shot but the colors don''t pop for me.', '2007-06-26 22:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838546, 541744, 36102, '<td valign="top">aww, I didn''t even see that little one the first time.  Great job.</td>', 'aww, I didn''t even see that little one the first time.  Great job.', '2007-06-26 22:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838555, 542329, 55199, '<td valign="top">What a pretty scene.  I like your composition.  Its too bad that the highlights on the water are blown out and the focus is a bit off.</td>', 'What a pretty scene.  I like your composition.  Its too bad that the highlights on the water are blown out and the focus is a bit off.', '2007-06-26 22:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838565, 542813, 55199, '<td valign="top">Looks like a peaceful place.  Is the white speck at the end of the lane Waldo?</td>', 'Looks like a peaceful place.  Is the white speck at the end of the lane Waldo?', '2007-06-26 22:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838582, 540902, 55199, '<td valign="top">I like your perspective here.  highlights are a bit blown, but I think you may have done that on purpose.  I wish Waldo were doing something a little more meaningful which would add to the theme of your photo.</td>', 'I like your perspective here.  highlights are a bit blown, but I think you may have done that on purpose.  I wish Waldo were doing something a little more meaningful which would add to the theme of your photo.', '2007-06-26 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838601, 542658, 55199, '<td valign="top">The palm frond on the left is just hanging out of nowhere.  It would be nice if you either included the tree or changed your angle to not include the palm at all.</td>', 'The palm frond on the left is just hanging out of nowhere.  It would be nice if you either included the tree or changed your angle to not include the palm at all.', '2007-06-26 22:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838615, 542452, 55199, '<td valign="top">Cool!  I saw this butt on the right and though it was a statue of a horse or cow on a rooftop, then I realized it was Waldo!  What a realistic looking model town.</td>', 'Cool!  I saw this butt on the right and though it was a statue of a horse or cow on a rooftop, then I realized it was Waldo!  What a realistic looking model town.', '2007-06-26 22:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838622, 542049, 55199, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like this better in color.</td>', 'I think I''d like this better in color.', '2007-06-26 22:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838643, 540833, 55199, '<td valign="top">I have a painting that looks almost exactly like this; except, your photo is far better than the painting I picked up for a few bucks with a bunch of other paintings at an auction. Anyway, I like your photo and its nicely done.</td>', 'I have a painting that looks almost exactly like this; except, your photo is far better than the painting I picked up for a few bucks with a bunch of other paintings at an auction. Anyway, I like your photo and its nicely done.', '2007-06-26 23:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838651, 540929, 6519, '<td valign="top">I commend you for your effort, what a tremendous job! 9 <br/>The following is by no means criticism, just "thinking out loud" :<br/>I wonder how it would have looked with a shallower DOF? It would hide "Waldo" even more, but perhaps too much? Hmmmmm....</td>', 'I commend you for your effort, what a tremendous job! 9 The following is by no means criticism, just "thinking out loud" :I wonder how it would have looked with a shallower DOF? It would hide "Waldo" even more, but perhaps too much? Hmmmmm....', '2007-06-26 23:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838667, 542741, 6519, '<td valign="top">Thank goodness for the red shirt (that IS him, right? LOL) - he would have been impossible to find if camouflaged.<br/>I''m glad to see that person in there, helping me to get a grip on the sheer scale of that cliff!</td>', 'Thank goodness for the red shirt (that IS him, right? LOL) - he would have been impossible to find if camouflaged.I''m glad to see that person in there, helping me to get a grip on the sheer scale of that cliff!', '2007-06-26 23:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838669, 541506, 6519, '<td valign="top">Brilliant way to hide him, brilliant clue! 8</td>', 'Brilliant way to hide him, brilliant clue! 8', '2007-06-26 23:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838701, 541994, 6519, '<td valign="top">If you really DO have a person hidden in that photo, you have hidden him a little bit too well. All I can see is the bear.</td>', 'If you really DO have a person hidden in that photo, you have hidden him a little bit too well. All I can see is the bear.', '2007-06-26 23:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838748, 542071, 6519, '<td valign="top">Not a bad try at all. I like the way he continues the pattern of the posts. Now if only he was on the other side of that hedge!</td>', 'Not a bad try at all. I like the way he continues the pattern of the posts. Now if only he was on the other side of that hedge!', '2007-06-26 23:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838753, 541506, 45475, '<td valign="top">Very very clever, disguised as a rock! Excellent :)</td>', 'Very very clever, disguised as a rock! Excellent :)', '2007-06-26 23:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838782, 542111, 45475, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, great thinking!</td>', 'Excellent idea, great thinking!', '2007-06-26 23:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838787, 541117, 45475, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh out loud for real! Very very good, love it!</td>', 'This made me laugh out loud for real! Very very good, love it!', '2007-06-26 23:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838797, 541033, 45475, '<td valign="top">What a cool building. The exaggerated perspective is awesome. Well done!</td>', 'What a cool building. The exaggerated perspective is awesome. Well done!', '2007-06-26 23:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838807, 542862, 45475, '<td valign="top">Classic Waldo, sans beanie and glasses though. Well spotted!</td>', 'Classic Waldo, sans beanie and glasses though. Well spotted!', '2007-06-26 23:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
