(3838927, 542078, 45475, '<td valign="top">Man, you were lucky (or very patient). Every time I try to get a shot of the hill, there''s a squillion fitness fanatics and tourists in cars getting in the way. Great job on the colour and light.</td>', 'Man, you were lucky (or very patient). Every time I try to get a shot of the hill, there''s a squillion fitness fanatics and tourists in cars getting in the way. Great job on the colour and light.', '2007-06-26 23:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
