(3839264, 542878, 28172, '<td valign="top">Funny!</td>', 'Funny!', '2007-06-27 00:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3839522, 542633, 15204, '<td valign="top">I really like the motion in the flag.  Then, you notice the motion of the people second.  A cool effect.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I really like the motion in the flag.  Then, you notice the motion of the people second.  A cool effect.  Nicely done.', '2007-06-27 01:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3839765, 540915, 55199, '<td valign="top">I like the golden tones against the dark blue sky.  The motion blurred Waldo is an interesting idea that adds movement to an otherwise still scene.</td>', 'I like the golden tones against the dark blue sky.  The motion blurred Waldo is an interesting idea that adds movement to an otherwise still scene.', '2007-06-27 01:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3839809, 540458, 55199, '<td valign="top">Psychodellic dude!  Far out! :)  I wish I could seem more above where you framed the top of your photo, I feel like the top part is missing.  Really is a cool effect though.</td>', 'Psychodellic dude!  Far out! :)  I wish I could seem more above where you framed the top of your photo, I feel like the top part is missing.  Really is a cool effect though.', '2007-06-27 01:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840014, 541506, 50034, '<td valign="top">Or like the motto at my gym, "We leave no stern untoned!"  :}</td>', 'Or like the motto at my gym, "We leave no stern untoned!"  :}', '2007-06-27 02:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840073, 541506, 25355, '<td valign="top">Good blending in of the person, but I get the feeling the photo is crooked.</td>', 'Good blending in of the person, but I get the feeling the photo is crooked.', '2007-06-27 02:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840077, 542865, 25355, '<td valign="top">Well, that''s hardly hidden, but a striking photo nonetheless.</td>', 'Well, that''s hardly hidden, but a striking photo nonetheless.', '2007-06-27 02:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840079, 542628, 25355, '<td valign="top">That must be one really difficult golf course. ;-)</td>', 'That must be one really difficult golf course. ;-)', '2007-06-27 02:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840082, 542741, 25355, '<td valign="top">If he wasn''t wearing red, he''d be really hard to find. That certainly shows the scaled of the rock face, though.</td>', 'If he wasn''t wearing red, he''d be really hard to find. That certainly shows the scaled of the rock face, though.', '2007-06-27 03:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840103, 542658, 25355, '<td valign="top">I can see about four people, and a lot of sharpening artefacts.</td>', 'I can see about four people, and a lot of sharpening artefacts.', '2007-06-27 03:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840107, 538889, 25355, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling the person was wearing some bright coloured clothing that made it too obvious, so you converted to black and white to make it nearly impossible.... but I think I''ve found someone about to moon you. ;-)</td>', 'I have a feeling the person was wearing some bright coloured clothing that made it too obvious, so you converted to black and white to make it nearly impossible.... but I think I''ve found someone about to moon you. ;-)', '2007-06-27 03:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840113, 542456, 25355, '<td valign="top">Two potential Wallies; I guess it''s the one in the doorway on the left.</td>', 'Two potential Wallies; I guess it''s the one in the doorway on the left.', '2007-06-27 03:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840118, 542865, 20324, '<td valign="top">Too obvious for this challenge, it would be great for negative space challenge.</td>', 'Too obvious for this challenge, it would be great for negative space challenge.', '2007-06-27 03:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840119, 542232, 25355, '<td valign="top">Okay, he''s there, but the photo is just a jumble of plants that doesn''t bring to mind my image of an English Country Garden.</td>', 'Okay, he''s there, but the photo is just a jumble of plants that doesn''t bring to mind my image of an English Country Garden.', '2007-06-27 03:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840122, 540929, 20324, '<td valign="top">Cool idea! Nice execution!</td>', 'Cool idea! Nice execution!', '2007-06-27 03:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840125, 539064, 20324, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors, nice composition.</td>', 'Interesting colors, nice composition.', '2007-06-27 03:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840126, 542621, 43073, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective here, with the curve of the road adding interest to the shot; the greens are a bit bright for me at points, but the soft focus makes it feel dreamy and light, almost as if I''m already drawn in and meandering down the road looking for Waldo.</td>', 'Neat perspective here, with the curve of the road adding interest to the shot; the greens are a bit bright for me at points, but the soft focus makes it feel dreamy and light, almost as if I''m already drawn in and meandering down the road looking for Waldo.', '2007-06-27 03:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840128, 538547, 25355, '<td valign="top">He''s not hard to find, really. I''m just saddened by the camera shake... ;-)</td>', 'He''s not hard to find, really. I''m just saddened by the camera shake... ;-)', '2007-06-27 03:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840129, 541505, 43073, '<td valign="top">An image that stands on its own, with great textures and colors in the trees (especially on the right); nicely composed, with soft colors in the sky that don''t overpower the rest of the scene. Good placement for Waldo as part of the image, and not letting it drive all the creative decisions. Bumping this up to 8.</td>', 'An image that stands on its own, with great textures and colors in the trees (especially on the right); nicely composed, with soft colors in the sky that don''t overpower the rest of the scene. Good placement for Waldo as part of the image, and not letting it drive all the creative decisions. Bumping this up to 8.', '2007-06-27 03:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840131, 542870, 25355, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is some mausoleum...</td>', 'I''m guessing this is some mausoleum...', '2007-06-27 03:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840134, 539518, 43073, '<td valign="top">Really neat idea, well executed; finding colors that would at least mimic what was in the graffiti works well, and you obviously had a very cooperative and helpful (not to mention cute) model. Processing here seems to fit with the image, though I wonder what it would have looked like if you had saturated the colors a bit more (it might have looked horrible, though!). Nicely done.</td>', 'Really neat idea, well executed; finding colors that would at least mimic what was in the graffiti works well, and you obviously had a very cooperative and helpful (not to mention cute) model. Processing here seems to fit with the image, though I wonder what it would have looked like if you had saturated the colors a bit more (it might have looked horrible, though!). Nicely done.', '2007-06-27 03:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840138, 542871, 20324, '<td valign="top">Cool place to be! Mysterious atmosphere, nice composition and colors.</td>', 'Cool place to be! Mysterious atmosphere, nice composition and colors.', '2007-06-27 03:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840142, 542105, 43073, '<td valign="top">I looked really hard but couldn''t find . . . <br/> <br/>. . . a single over-sharpened rope :) That''s a testament to restrained processing that serves the image well. The colors here are warm and fit nicely with the image, which holds the interest well. Waldo was easily found, but with an image with as much visual interest as this one, that''s okay with me. Well done.</td>', 'I looked really hard but couldn''t find . . .  . . . a single over-sharpened rope :) That''s a testament to restrained processing that serves the image well. The colors here are warm and fit nicely with the image, which holds the interest well. Waldo was easily found, but with an image with as much visual interest as this one, that''s okay with me. Well done.', '2007-06-27 03:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840148, 542874, 20324, '<td valign="top">Great composition, beautiful colors, interesting architecture. Well done!</td>', 'Great composition, beautiful colors, interesting architecture. Well done!', '2007-06-27 03:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840152, 541784, 25355, '<td valign="top">Yeah, going the monochrome route will make it more difficult, but the white socks give it away.  ;-)</td>', 'Yeah, going the monochrome route will make it more difficult, but the white socks give it away.  ;-)', '2007-06-27 03:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840159, 541108, 25355, '<td valign="top">It''s kind of freaky. I''d like to see it in colour.</td>', 'It''s kind of freaky. I''d like to see it in colour.', '2007-06-27 03:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840160, 542646, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like this; fire is an excellent subject, though it doesn''t always behave, does it? Here the colors make the shot for me. I almost want to reach in and feel the purple ones, whether they''re hotter than the rest or cooler (I know, hotter, but still), or at least poke it a bit, or maybe roast some marshmallows. I hope Waldo survives . . .</td>', 'I like this; fire is an excellent subject, though it doesn''t always behave, does it? Here the colors make the shot for me. I almost want to reach in and feel the purple ones, whether they''re hotter than the rest or cooler (I know, hotter, but still), or at least poke it a bit, or maybe roast some marshmallows. I hope Waldo survives . . .', '2007-06-27 03:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840182, 542878, 43073, '<td valign="top">Neat idea and good execution here. The idea works, and Waldo is nicely concealed if not quite hidden. As an image that seems primarily driven by the theme, it suits the purpose well.</td>', 'Neat idea and good execution here. The idea works, and Waldo is nicely concealed if not quite hidden. As an image that seems primarily driven by the theme, it suits the purpose well.', '2007-06-27 03:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840186, 540458, 43073, '<td valign="top">Very cool image; I have no idea what''s going on here, which made me look more closely. The colors are unique, and the shapes and lines keep driving my eye around the shot, looking and searching. I am often drawn to the thing that looks like a golf flag, but I always move on. Excellent abstract and wonderful entry.</td>', 'Very cool image; I have no idea what''s going on here, which made me look more closely. The colors are unique, and the shapes and lines keep driving my eye around the shot, looking and searching. I am often drawn to the thing that looks like a golf flag, but I always move on. Excellent abstract and wonderful entry.', '2007-06-27 03:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840216, 542816, 43073, '<td valign="top">Neat concept and nicely carried out. I wondered who would enter a nude in the challenge :) As an image, there is some interest here, and it''s nicely composed for a stream scene. The lighting is not entirely flattering to my eye, as some fo the brights are a little, well, bright, but overall the image works well.</td>', 'Neat concept and nicely carried out. I wondered who would enter a nude in the challenge :) As an image, there is some interest here, and it''s nicely composed for a stream scene. The lighting is not entirely flattering to my eye, as some fo the brights are a little, well, bright, but overall the image works well.', '2007-06-27 03:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840220, 541460, 43073, '<td valign="top">Cool image, well captured. The starkness of it, with the lovely washed out appearance of the building, and the tones in the windows that lead into the tones in the dark sky are all very effective. Nicely shot. Had this at a 7, bumping it up to an 8.</td>', 'Cool image, well captured. The starkness of it, with the lovely washed out appearance of the building, and the tones in the windows that lead into the tones in the dark sky are all very effective. Nicely shot. Had this at a 7, bumping it up to an 8.', '2007-06-27 03:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840222, 542875, 43073, '<td valign="top">Well shot, the kind of image that''s hard to present well on DPC because of the size of the allowed images (it''s hard to show good detail at this distance in a 640 sized image). Your shot is a lovely b&amp;w, with nice tons and textures throughout; I can almost hear the person calling out for a car to come back, or  see him/her getting ready to put out their thumb to catch a ride. Nice feeling to this, well captured.</td>', 'Well shot, the kind of image that''s hard to present well on DPC because of the size of the allowed images (it''s hard to show good detail at this distance in a 640 sized image). Your shot is a lovely b&w, with nice tons and textures throughout; I can almost hear the person calling out for a car to come back, or  see him/her getting ready to put out their thumb to catch a ride. Nice feeling to this, well captured.', '2007-06-27 03:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840225, 542781, 43073, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot, and excellent handling of the lighting issues (I can never reasonably capture sun rays like this); the range of tones from dark to light is really nice, and the glasslike appearance of the water is appealing. The mist in the back works well to emphasize that this is a morning shot. Nicely presented image.</td>', 'Very pretty shot, and excellent handling of the lighting issues (I can never reasonably capture sun rays like this); the range of tones from dark to light is really nice, and the glasslike appearance of the water is appealing. The mist in the back works well to emphasize that this is a morning shot. Nicely presented image.', '2007-06-27 03:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840248, 542848, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge, and fun title to give it a bit of edge. It seems the image is primarily driven by the challenge, though, but for this purpose it works well. I might have moved the horizon up a bit so there was less empty sky (which doesn''t do much for me), but whether that would improve the image is a guess. The soft focus on Waldo''s head does work for me, though, given the context.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge, and fun title to give it a bit of edge. It seems the image is primarily driven by the challenge, though, but for this purpose it works well. I might have moved the horizon up a bit so there was less empty sky (which doesn''t do much for me), but whether that would improve the image is a guess. The soft focus on Waldo''s head does work for me, though, given the context.', '2007-06-27 03:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840258, 542106, 43073, '<td valign="top">Such a confluence and convergence of lines, shapes and colors here make this a difficult image for me to get to grips with. I was somewhat overwhelmed each time I looked at it, searching for a focus, but if I accept that that is the purpose -- to overwhelm the viewer with conflicts within the image, perhaps with a view to hiding Waldo -- then I must admit it does this very well. All the pieces are there, nicely exposed, with good use of depth of field, and composed to achieve this end.</td>', 'Such a confluence and convergence of lines, shapes and colors here make this a difficult image for me to get to grips with. I was somewhat overwhelmed each time I looked at it, searching for a focus, but if I accept that that is the purpose -- to overwhelm the viewer with conflicts within the image, perhaps with a view to hiding Waldo -- then I must admit it does this very well. All the pieces are there, nicely exposed, with good use of depth of field, and composed to achieve this end.', '2007-06-27 04:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840262, 542607, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot for the challenge, and I like that you put extra effort into the theme (by coloring the child''s face). As an image alone, aside from the challenge, it doesn''t hold much interest for me, though it does present a unique perspective that I haven''t seen before. Moving "Waldo" out of the center might have helped to my eye, not to hide him, but to place him on a natural focal point while hiding him with color and the corn. Overall an effective image for the challenge, well conceived and shot.</td>', 'Nicely shot for the challenge, and I like that you put extra effort into the theme (by coloring the child''s face). As an image alone, aside from the challenge, it doesn''t hold much interest for me, though it does present a unique perspective that I haven''t seen before. Moving "Waldo" out of the center might have helped to my eye, not to hide him, but to place him on a natural focal point while hiding him with color and the corn. Overall an effective image for the challenge, well conceived and shot.', '2007-06-27 04:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840265, 542071, 43073, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot; the muted tones, matching both on the lower wall and on the upper columns, give the image a sense of cohesiveness for me, one that seems to fit with my idea of China''s communist theology. I love that you''ve chosen a person who almost could have been one of the white pots (or whatever they are), and whose appearance comes close to those things. I might have tried this with the person offset a bit (making Mao a bit offset, as well), but that might not have worked. Interesting image, well presented.</td>', 'I really like this shot; the muted tones, matching both on the lower wall and on the upper columns, give the image a sense of cohesiveness for me, one that seems to fit with my idea of China''s communist theology. I love that you''ve chosen a person who almost could have been one of the white pots (or whatever they are), and whose appearance comes close to those things. I might have tried this with the person offset a bit (making Mao a bit offset, as well), but that might not have worked. Interesting image, well presented.', '2007-06-27 04:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840269, 542598, 43073, '<td valign="top">What a cluttered workshop, and the image captures that feel perfectly. Delightful tones and shades in this, and the beer is the perfect touch. Excellent choice on how much of Waldo to show us, though I might have shifted the feer a bit to the left (maybe, maybe not - how''s that for definite advice?). Nice shot.</td>', 'What a cluttered workshop, and the image captures that feel perfectly. Delightful tones and shades in this, and the beer is the perfect touch. Excellent choice on how much of Waldo to show us, though I might have shifted the feer a bit to the left (maybe, maybe not - how''s that for definite advice?). Nice shot.', '2007-06-27 04:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840271, 541744, 68467, '<td valign="top">Very fun capture, the boy is pretty hard to see, exelent job</td>', 'Very fun capture, the boy is pretty hard to see, exelent job', '2007-06-27 04:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840275, 539518, 68467, '<td valign="top">Very creative and nice colors, I like the way her clothes matches the colors on the wall</td>', 'Very creative and nice colors, I like the way her clothes matches the colors on the wall', '2007-06-27 04:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840277, 541397, 68467, '<td valign="top">Amazing image, wish the horizon were horizontal</td>', 'Amazing image, wish the horizon were horizontal', '2007-06-27 04:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840278, 542865, 68467, '<td valign="top">I found her !!!</td>', 'I found her !!!', '2007-06-27 04:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840279, 538547, 68467, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit blurry</td>', 'Looks a bit blurry', '2007-06-27 04:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840280, 542609, 68467, '<td valign="top">I can´t find any persons here</td>', 'I can´t find any persons here', '2007-06-27 04:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840281, 542857, 68467, '<td valign="top">Good job, I like that the title gives me a hint</td>', 'Good job, I like that the title gives me a hint', '2007-06-27 04:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840284, 542625, 68467, '<td valign="top">I miss a bit contrast here, good image though</td>', 'I miss a bit contrast here, good image though', '2007-06-27 04:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840286, 540274, 68467, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see the sky</td>', 'I wish I could see the sky', '2007-06-27 04:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840288, 542812, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nicely hidden Waldo and I love the composition of the shot in itself</td>', 'Nicely hidden Waldo and I love the composition of the shot in itself', '2007-06-27 04:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840289, 542781, 68467, '<td valign="top">Stunning sky, great capture</td>', 'Stunning sky, great capture', '2007-06-27 04:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840290, 540567, 68035, '<td valign="top">Cool, I like this a lot Waldo is not hidden but is certainly small enough not to dominate this wonderful image (yet still add something to the overall picture)<br/> <br/>Like the B&amp;W conversion and even the vignetting is growing on me - 7</td>', 'Cool, I like this a lot Waldo is not hidden but is certainly small enough not to dominate this wonderful image (yet still add something to the overall picture) Like the B&W conversion and even the vignetting is growing on me - 7', '2007-06-27 04:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840294, 542057, 68035, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge, like the way that you have got waldos top half reflected but only his legs showing (now all I need to do is find his feet)</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge, like the way that you have got waldos top half reflected but only his legs showing (now all I need to do is find his feet)', '2007-06-27 04:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840295, 542230, 68467, '<td valign="top">I like the tone of this, even though I´m not a big fan of these IR filtered images</td>', 'I like the tone of this, even though I´m not a big fan of these IR filtered images', '2007-06-27 04:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840298, 542092, 68035, '<td valign="top">I am sure there is a waldo in there, but I cant find him, so well hidden you!  Nice streetscape although iys a bit unfortunate that your positioning means that the street light is a bit of a distraction as it hits a rule of third point</td>', 'I am sure there is a waldo in there, but I cant find him, so well hidden you!  Nice streetscape although iys a bit unfortunate that your positioning means that the street light is a bit of a distraction as it hits a rule of third point', '2007-06-27 04:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840302, 541994, 43073, '<td valign="top">I imagine you''re getting killed for this (everyone wondering where Waldo is and focused on the bear), but it''s such a great capture. I hope Waldo is out of sight and inching slowly away, mama bear is sure to be nearby! Great capture and presentation here, though the brightness of the bark is a bit distracting when I look for too long (which I keep doing because the bear is so cute!).</td>', 'I imagine you''re getting killed for this (everyone wondering where Waldo is and focused on the bear), but it''s such a great capture. I hope Waldo is out of sight and inching slowly away, mama bear is sure to be nearby! Great capture and presentation here, though the brightness of the bark is a bit distracting when I look for too long (which I keep doing because the bear is so cute!).', '2007-06-27 04:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840303, 542721, 68035, '<td valign="top">Unique take on the challenge, I really like the concept though I am not too sure how much favour it will find with others, for some reason on my monitor the skin tones seem a little blown out</td>', 'Unique take on the challenge, I really like the concept though I am not too sure how much favour it will find with others, for some reason on my monitor the skin tones seem a little blown out', '2007-06-27 04:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840304, 540932, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice seascape with a nice mix of colours, I am guessing Waldo is the darkish spot just behind the waves.</td>', 'Very nice seascape with a nice mix of colours, I am guessing Waldo is the darkish spot just behind the waves.', '2007-06-27 04:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840305, 542741, 43073, '<td valign="top">Cool image that makes for a nice abstract, with the tones and subtle colors dominating the appearance. The lighting isn''t always flattering, especially toward the top, but given the harshness of rocks like these, and the hardness of those who climb them, seems an appropriate choice of processing to me. Nicely shot.</td>', 'Cool image that makes for a nice abstract, with the tones and subtle colors dominating the appearance. The lighting isn''t always flattering, especially toward the top, but given the harshness of rocks like these, and the hardness of those who climb them, seems an appropriate choice of processing to me. Nicely shot.', '2007-06-27 04:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840308, 542633, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the slow shutter here to capture so many Waldos but to not really capture any of them; the effect with the flag is excellent, as well. The ghostly people around a monument like this, in soft, night lighting, works really well. Nicely shot.</td>', 'I like the use of the slow shutter here to capture so many Waldos but to not really capture any of them; the effect with the flag is excellent, as well. The ghostly people around a monument like this, in soft, night lighting, works really well. Nicely shot.', '2007-06-27 04:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840310, 542853, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well any picture that quotes one of my favourite poems has got to be OK, although (a bit unfairly) I cant help thinking of the poems title which is stopping by woods on a SNOWY evening. One of a few very nice forest shots in the challenge and yes I did spot Waldo in their black and white wtriped top<br/> <br/>Good shot</td>', 'Well any picture that quotes one of my favourite poems has got to be OK, although (a bit unfairly) I cant help thinking of the poems title which is stopping by woods on a SNOWY evening. One of a few very nice forest shots in the challenge and yes I did spot Waldo in their black and white wtriped top Good shot', '2007-06-27 04:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840313, 541891, 43073, '<td valign="top">Something about the colors here really draws me in; they''re soft, almost desaturated, but a bit harsh and yellowish. I like the contrast that brings to me, and the feel that where I am behind these trees is cool and shady and the other side of the river is hot and sunny. Definitely brings to mind a lazy summer day. I might have moved the trees out of the center of teh image, but given the purpose I think it works okay here.</td>', 'Something about the colors here really draws me in; they''re soft, almost desaturated, but a bit harsh and yellowish. I like the contrast that brings to me, and the feel that where I am behind these trees is cool and shady and the other side of the river is hot and sunny. Definitely brings to mind a lazy summer day. I might have moved the trees out of the center of teh image, but given the purpose I think it works okay here.', '2007-06-27 04:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840314, 542602, 43073, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and I think the final result works well with the subject. Inside, in a kitchen, just the eyes showing. I like it. I might have put the other two hats in the same line as the Waldo hat (maybe putting them on your hands?), but otherwise I think the whole look of this serves it well.</td>', 'Great idea, and I think the final result works well with the subject. Inside, in a kitchen, just the eyes showing. I like it. I might have put the other two hats in the same line as the Waldo hat (maybe putting them on your hands?), but otherwise I think the whole look of this serves it well.', '2007-06-27 04:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840315, 542768, 43073, '<td valign="top">This is a neat take on the challenge, and I like the use of the bright hat to emphasize that you know we see your "Waldo" here. Cute expression, and some nice plays of light across the green leaves. The appearance of the blue flowers toward the back adds a nice touch.</td>', 'This is a neat take on the challenge, and I like the use of the bright hat to emphasize that you know we see your "Waldo" here. Cute expression, and some nice plays of light across the green leaves. The appearance of the blue flowers toward the back adds a nice touch.', '2007-06-27 04:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840316, 540915, 43073, '<td valign="top">Really interesting image, well shot; good take on the challenge, and wonderful use of long exposure here to make the image. The star bursts on the building lights are wonderful, and the overall impressiveness of the building allows the image to stand on its own. Nicely seen and shot.</td>', 'Really interesting image, well shot; good take on the challenge, and wonderful use of long exposure here to make the image. The star bursts on the building lights are wonderful, and the overall impressiveness of the building allows the image to stand on its own. Nicely seen and shot.', '2007-06-27 04:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840341, 542634, 79065, '<td valign="top">Just too soft I''m afraid</td>', 'Just too soft I''m afraid', '2007-06-27 04:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840369, 538889, 43073, '<td valign="top">Great choice of locations, with lots of stuff going on visually. The slowish shutter speed gives some motion (flow?) to the water, which is appealing. I wonder if a bit more contrast might strengthen this a bit; as is it seems a bit flat to my eye, though this perhaps helps in hiding Waldo by blending the shades together.</td>', 'Great choice of locations, with lots of stuff going on visually. The slowish shutter speed gives some motion (flow?) to the water, which is appealing. I wonder if a bit more contrast might strengthen this a bit; as is it seems a bit flat to my eye, though this perhaps helps in hiding Waldo by blending the shades together.', '2007-06-27 05:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840371, 542420, 43073, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge, with an interesting (to put it mildly) image, from the images on the wall, to the person at the desk, to the imposters. Lighting is a bit flat -- probably explained by the indoor location -- but composition works well. A solid entry.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge, with an interesting (to put it mildly) image, from the images on the wall, to the person at the desk, to the imposters. Lighting is a bit flat -- probably explained by the indoor location -- but composition works well. A solid entry.', '2007-06-27 05:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840378, 541103, 43073, '<td valign="top">There are pieces of this that really appeal to me, like the roof line juxtaposed against such a blue sky. Losing Waldo through soft focus doesn''t work as well for me, though, and the shades don''t improve that. The ripples on the water are also a bit distracting in the way they reflect the building colors -- couldn''t you have stopped the wind blowing? :) I generally do like the shot, though, and composition fits with the purpose of the shot.</td>', 'There are pieces of this that really appeal to me, like the roof line juxtaposed against such a blue sky. Losing Waldo through soft focus doesn''t work as well for me, though, and the shades don''t improve that. The ripples on the water are also a bit distracting in the way they reflect the building colors -- couldn''t you have stopped the wind blowing? :) I generally do like the shot, though, and composition fits with the purpose of the shot.', '2007-06-27 05:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840381, 541405, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting and colors on the building at the end of the water, with nice reflections and colors in that section, as well. The sky distracts me a bit, given its lightness in relation to the darkness of the rest of the scene. On the whole the lighting hides Waldo, but might have been more attractive with more attention paid to the darker areas. Composition works well, though, and I do find the overall coloring appealing.</td>', 'Interesting lighting and colors on the building at the end of the water, with nice reflections and colors in that section, as well. The sky distracts me a bit, given its lightness in relation to the darkness of the rest of the scene. On the whole the lighting hides Waldo, but might have been more attractive with more attention paid to the darker areas. Composition works well, though, and I do find the overall coloring appealing.', '2007-06-27 05:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840384, 540553, 43073, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition here, and good choice to have "Waldo" as an extra and not the focus of the image. The use of the church spires to complement the composition of Atlas works well, though having Atlas completely in silhouette is a bit distracting for me (I generally don''t care for full silhouettes -- my own personal preference). I still think this is a strong image, made stronger by excellent choices in composition. Well done.</td>', 'Excellent composition here, and good choice to have "Waldo" as an extra and not the focus of the image. The use of the church spires to complement the composition of Atlas works well, though having Atlas completely in silhouette is a bit distracting for me (I generally don''t care for full silhouettes -- my own personal preference). I still think this is a strong image, made stronger by excellent choices in composition. Well done.', '2007-06-27 05:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840386, 542329, 43073, '<td valign="top">Very gentle, subtle image. I waffle between finding the softness appropriate given the lighting and shades to wanting just a bit more sharpness to all that white (in the building, the sails). I like the squarish crop, and the choice of subject is excellent.</td>', 'Very gentle, subtle image. I waffle between finding the softness appropriate given the lighting and shades to wanting just a bit more sharpness to all that white (in the building, the sails). I like the squarish crop, and the choice of subject is excellent.', '2007-06-27 06:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840393, 542818, 43073, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject, nicely meeting the challenge but not making all the choices based on Waldo. I might have preferred the house a bit less centered, but depending on the shot (ie, what''s left or right of the house) that may or may not have worked. The subdued tones throughout this are delightful, and the overall feel is one of abandonment and loss, which is quite strong throughout the image. Nicely done.</td>', 'Great choice of subject, nicely meeting the challenge but not making all the choices based on Waldo. I might have preferred the house a bit less centered, but depending on the shot (ie, what''s left or right of the house) that may or may not have worked. The subdued tones throughout this are delightful, and the overall feel is one of abandonment and loss, which is quite strong throughout the image. Nicely done.', '2007-06-27 06:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840398, 541986, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice for the challenge, with nice lines and light tones throughout. Seems like a great place to go walkabout, with things to see everywhere you look. I might have liked to have seen a bit more contrast here, and perhaps some taming of the highlights, but it seems to me to reflect well what I might feel if I was there (ie, bright sun that I wish I could tame). Nicely shot.</td>', 'Interesting choice for the challenge, with nice lines and light tones throughout. Seems like a great place to go walkabout, with things to see everywhere you look. I might have liked to have seen a bit more contrast here, and perhaps some taming of the highlights, but it seems to me to reflect well what I might feel if I was there (ie, bright sun that I wish I could tame). Nicely shot.', '2007-06-27 06:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840401, 542852, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like the tones in this a lot, especially in the field, which looks almost painted (I can almost see brush strokes!!); the silvery-ness (yes, a made up word) works well for me, and the composition is strong as well. Interesting and unique in the challenge. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the tones in this a lot, especially in the field, which looks almost painted (I can almost see brush strokes!!); the silvery-ness (yes, a made up word) works well for me, and the composition is strong as well. Interesting and unique in the challenge. Nicely done.', '2007-06-27 06:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840403, 540932, 43073, '<td valign="top">Good approach to the challenge, with great colors juxtaposed here to good effect. The sea green is delightful, and the exposure speed works well with the subject. Absent the challenge theme, there''s not necessarily a lot to see here, but it meets its objective well enough for these purposes.</td>', 'Good approach to the challenge, with great colors juxtaposed here to good effect. The sea green is delightful, and the exposure speed works well with the subject. Absent the challenge theme, there''s not necessarily a lot to see here, but it meets its objective well enough for these purposes.', '2007-06-27 06:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840406, 541542, 73570, '<td valign="top">I like this one. Although I''d almost feel like saying "come out of there" its how it should be, if thats waldo.</td>', 'I like this one. Although I''d almost feel like saying "come out of there" its how it should be, if thats waldo.', '2007-06-27 06:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840411, 540567, 43073, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge, with some interesting elements to support it and good composition. Overall the size of the elements in the DPC image causes them to lose something (not sharpness, something else), which for me makes it a bit more difficult to get into. The water highlights are nicely handled, though, as were the waves themselves (nice movement in the water while not being too blurred).</td>', 'Good take on the challenge, with some interesting elements to support it and good composition. Overall the size of the elements in the DPC image causes them to lose something (not sharpness, something else), which for me makes it a bit more difficult to get into. The water highlights are nicely handled, though, as were the waves themselves (nice movement in the water while not being too blurred).', '2007-06-27 06:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840417, 542874, 43073, '<td valign="top">Some interesting colors in the sky here, and definitely an interesting building. I might have liked to have seen a slightly longer exposure to allow the building to come out more in the shot (along with the rest of the foreground), but as is it''s a interesting image.</td>', 'Some interesting colors in the sky here, and definitely an interesting building. I might have liked to have seen a slightly longer exposure to allow the building to come out more in the shot (along with the rest of the foreground), but as is it''s a interesting image.', '2007-06-27 06:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840433, 540468, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge, and an obviously very cooperative and helpful model. The colors here work well for their purpose, though the lighting on the leaves is a bit bright for my liking, and the background trees are a bit flat for me, as well. I might have tried not having "Waldo" so close to center, but I''m not sure which direction I might have gone with him.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge, and an obviously very cooperative and helpful model. The colors here work well for their purpose, though the lighting on the leaves is a bit bright for my liking, and the background trees are a bit flat for me, as well. I might have tried not having "Waldo" so close to center, but I''m not sure which direction I might have gone with him.', '2007-06-27 06:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840442, 541712, 43073, '<td valign="top">Part of me is drawn to this as a reflection of what we see each day, roads, curbs, grass, but at the same time I feel it holds more promise; why does "Waldo" sit against the tree; is he reading? writing? thinking? I can''t really tell because of his size (which contributes to hiding Waldo, but for me weakens the image a bit); I also would have liked to see a bit more contrast in the image, as the lighting on the grass is a bit flat to my eyes.</td>', 'Part of me is drawn to this as a reflection of what we see each day, roads, curbs, grass, but at the same time I feel it holds more promise; why does "Waldo" sit against the tree; is he reading? writing? thinking? I can''t really tell because of his size (which contributes to hiding Waldo, but for me weakens the image a bit); I also would have liked to see a bit more contrast in the image, as the lighting on the grass is a bit flat to my eyes.', '2007-06-27 06:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840446, 542721, 43073, '<td valign="top">This is a really nicely conceived and executed image; it is spot on for the challenge, and the use of the white background serves well to draw focus to the suitcases and Waldo. That said, it doesn''t really speak to me, but this is a personal reaction rather than a reflection on the technical merit or the art of the shot.</td>', 'This is a really nicely conceived and executed image; it is spot on for the challenge, and the use of the white background serves well to draw focus to the suitcases and Waldo. That said, it doesn''t really speak to me, but this is a personal reaction rather than a reflection on the technical merit or the art of the shot.', '2007-06-27 06:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840468, 542456, 43073, '<td valign="top">This location seems to keep appearing in the challenge, but each shot has taken a different approach. The perspective for me here is different from the others, with the rows of benches looking like they almost don''t match up. It gives it a somewhat chaotic feeling, but imbued with white throughout. The contradictions in what I see are a bit difficult to set aside, but I do like the image on the whole.</td>', 'This location seems to keep appearing in the challenge, but each shot has taken a different approach. The perspective for me here is different from the others, with the rows of benches looking like they almost don''t match up. It gives it a somewhat chaotic feeling, but imbued with white throughout. The contradictions in what I see are a bit difficult to set aside, but I do like the image on the whole.', '2007-06-27 06:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840473, 542092, 43073, '<td valign="top">I really like the subtle colors in this shot, all of them pale, nothing too bright. To catch a street at this time of day (which looks mid-morningish or early afternoon) with no people on it is a great catch, and the composition works well for me. I might have tried to use perspective correction to get the buildings on the right straight, as the leaning is a bit troublesome to me (but I might have botched that if I had tried, I don''t do that very well).</td>', 'I really like the subtle colors in this shot, all of them pale, nothing too bright. To catch a street at this time of day (which looks mid-morningish or early afternoon) with no people on it is a great catch, and the composition works well for me. I might have tried to use perspective correction to get the buildings on the right straight, as the leaning is a bit troublesome to me (but I might have botched that if I had tried, I don''t do that very well).', '2007-06-27 06:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840478, 540274, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, with lots going on, and good choice on the shutter speed to give some flow to the image. The fading in the background is a bit disappointing, as I would have liked to have seen a bit more tone there, but overall it meets the challenge well and provides interesting things to see.</td>', 'Interesting image, with lots going on, and good choice on the shutter speed to give some flow to the image. The fading in the background is a bit disappointing, as I would have liked to have seen a bit more tone there, but overall it meets the challenge well and provides interesting things to see.', '2007-06-27 06:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840481, 542880, 43073, '<td valign="top">I hate having to do this kind of thing, so seeing the image presented as it is here, with the faded colors blending into one another and no real plays or light or dark, and it makes me feel like I would if I was out there doing it (wishing for more excitement but not finding it, I guess). I might have moved the fence and "Waldo" up a bit, to strengthen the composition, but I''m not sure.</td>', 'I hate having to do this kind of thing, so seeing the image presented as it is here, with the faded colors blending into one another and no real plays or light or dark, and it makes me feel like I would if I was out there doing it (wishing for more excitement but not finding it, I guess). I might have moved the fence and "Waldo" up a bit, to strengthen the composition, but I''m not sure.', '2007-06-27 06:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840485, 542111, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, with nice lines, though I might have started the lower line from a bit more to the right. I like that your model is in focus, and that the "hiding" effect comes not from making her small, but from her blending in in terms of color and shade. Nicely shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot, with nice lines, though I might have started the lower line from a bit more to the right. I like that your model is in focus, and that the "hiding" effect comes not from making her small, but from her blending in in terms of color and shade. Nicely shot.', '2007-06-27 06:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840489, 539399, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting, almost painted colors here, with nice plays of light across the path and the trees. Not much going on beyond the challenge theme (searching for Waldo), and I may have tried a lower angle or something closer to the path to give some flow to the image, but that may not have worked in the circumstances of the shot.</td>', 'Interesting, almost painted colors here, with nice plays of light across the path and the trees. Not much going on beyond the challenge theme (searching for Waldo), and I may have tried a lower angle or something closer to the path to give some flow to the image, but that may not have worked in the circumstances of the shot.', '2007-06-27 06:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840491, 541982, 43073, '<td valign="top">I had this at a 6, and came back to comment. I''m not sure what I was thinking. There are delightful elements to this, and the composition works really well, both in terms of general strength but also in terms of meeting the challenge. The choice of shutter speed provides wonderful results in terms of flow of the water, and the light throughout is quite nice. Definitely not a 6 (it''s an 8).</td>', 'I had this at a 6, and came back to comment. I''m not sure what I was thinking. There are delightful elements to this, and the composition works really well, both in terms of general strength but also in terms of meeting the challenge. The choice of shutter speed provides wonderful results in terms of flow of the water, and the light throughout is quite nice. Definitely not a 6 (it''s an 8).', '2007-06-27 06:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840512, 541722, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nice lines in this; makes me want to walk along the sidewalk and look into the water. The dark shades of blue suit it well, and though the lights distract me a bit in their blurriness, the overall appearance is generally good.</td>', 'Nice lines in this; makes me want to walk along the sidewalk and look into the water. The dark shades of blue suit it well, and though the lights distract me a bit in their blurriness, the overall appearance is generally good.', '2007-06-27 07:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840516, 541723, 43373, '<td valign="top">this is great , 8</td>', 'this is great , 8', '2007-06-27 07:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840538, 542727, 43073, '<td valign="top">Mid-day lighting throws this off a bit, I think, as everything is uniform in lighting with stark shadows. The image is well composed, and the reflection in the water serves it well. The stick in the water is unfortunate, as are those on the shore, but on the whole it serves its challenge purpose suitably.</td>', 'Mid-day lighting throws this off a bit, I think, as everything is uniform in lighting with stark shadows. The image is well composed, and the reflection in the water serves it well. The stick in the water is unfortunate, as are those on the shore, but on the whole it serves its challenge purpose suitably.', '2007-06-27 07:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840545, 541794, 43073, '<td valign="top">A generally nice image, but one that doesn''t pull me in for some reason; could be the lighting, which seems flat rather than shadowy (perhaps to help hide "Waldo" a bit more?), though composition works well for what is being accomplished here.</td>', 'A generally nice image, but one that doesn''t pull me in for some reason; could be the lighting, which seems flat rather than shadowy (perhaps to help hide "Waldo" a bit more?), though composition works well for what is being accomplished here.', '2007-06-27 07:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840549, 542611, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting choices made here, especially the narrow depth of field focused on the far end of the bridge. It''s a neat idea, and is generally suitably executed, but I think for me the DoF doesn''t work so well (though the more I look the more I feel it driving me to the person, which I like), and I would liked to have seen more contrast in tones throughout the image.</td>', 'Interesting choices made here, especially the narrow depth of field focused on the far end of the bridge. It''s a neat idea, and is generally suitably executed, but I think for me the DoF doesn''t work so well (though the more I look the more I feel it driving me to the person, which I like), and I would liked to have seen more contrast in tones throughout the image.', '2007-06-27 07:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840649, 542721, 80354, '<td valign="top">Hahaha. I totally understand that. You never know what they''re going to do in your suitcase. =]</td>', 'Hahaha. I totally understand that. You never know what they''re going to do in your suitcase. =]', '2007-06-27 08:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840858, 540929, 40386, '<td valign="top">Team mate no vote.  <br/> <br/>This is fabulous Gaby I really hope it does well!!!!</td>', 'Team mate no vote.   This is fabulous Gaby I really hope it does well!!!!', '2007-06-27 09:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840983, 542609, 25355, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure....</td>', 'I''m not sure....', '2007-06-27 10:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3840991, 542652, 25355, '<td valign="top">That''s the third I''ve seen at the same place - I''m guessing this was a dpc GTG.</td>', 'That''s the third I''ve seen at the same place - I''m guessing this was a dpc GTG.', '2007-06-27 10:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841001, 542828, 25355, '<td valign="top">Almost surreal. The horizon almost looks like it''s a painted backdrop. Well done compostition, good luck.</td>', 'Almost surreal. The horizon almost looks like it''s a painted backdrop. Well done compostition, good luck.', '2007-06-27 10:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841099, 542858, 80435, '<td valign="top">great picture true graffiti is such an art form this pictures capture 2 for one</td>', 'great picture true graffiti is such an art form this pictures capture 2 for one', '2007-06-27 10:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841352, 538785, 43073, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the challenge, and the person''s face (reflection? through the bottom?) works well here for that purpose. As an image, it doesn''t really reach me beyond being a sort of puzzle. Not really my thing visually, but well done and definitely in keeping with the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'Very interesting take on the challenge, and the person''s face (reflection? through the bottom?) works well here for that purpose. As an image, it doesn''t really reach me beyond being a sort of puzzle. Not really my thing visually, but well done and definitely in keeping with the spirit of the challenge.', '2007-06-27 11:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841386, 540902, 43073, '<td valign="top">I thought there would be a lot of selective desaturation in this challenge, but didn''t expect one that would use it so subtly or creatively. Just the tiniest splash of color, hidden behind shades of gray. I generally like the image, with an interesting perspective and good choices for the lines (running front right to rear right and rear left). Composition is good, though the brightness in the back headstones is a bit distracting to my eyes (though perhaps you were using that to draw attention away from Waldo?). Well done.</td>', 'I thought there would be a lot of selective desaturation in this challenge, but didn''t expect one that would use it so subtly or creatively. Just the tiniest splash of color, hidden behind shades of gray. I generally like the image, with an interesting perspective and good choices for the lines (running front right to rear right and rear left). Composition is good, though the brightness in the back headstones is a bit distracting to my eyes (though perhaps you were using that to draw attention away from Waldo?). Well done.', '2007-06-27 11:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841398, 542594, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting space, well captured and presented. Waldo was easy to find, but that doesn''t really matter to me (I''m looking for interesting images here, not Waldo). This looks like the kind of place someone goes to get away from things, but it looks very purposeful, planted, planned, with all the trees in nice rows. I might have tried to eek a bit more contrast out of this image, to the brights were a bit brighter and the darks a bit darker, but generally it works well for me.</td>', 'Interesting space, well captured and presented. Waldo was easy to find, but that doesn''t really matter to me (I''m looking for interesting images here, not Waldo). This looks like the kind of place someone goes to get away from things, but it looks very purposeful, planted, planned, with all the trees in nice rows. I might have tried to eek a bit more contrast out of this image, to the brights were a bit brighter and the darks a bit darker, but generally it works well for me.', '2007-06-27 11:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841400, 542743, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing here in a nice woodland scene; the processing and composition work well to draw attention away from Waldo, and it take some time to find hims. The shades and colors are really cool, and I half expected to find Waldo as an elf or a king or something. Lovely shot.</td>', 'Interesting processing here in a nice woodland scene; the processing and composition work well to draw attention away from Waldo, and it take some time to find hims. The shades and colors are really cool, and I half expected to find Waldo as an elf or a king or something. Lovely shot.', '2007-06-27 11:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841402, 542459, 68467, '<td valign="top">Very nice sky and you have hidden Waldo very well</td>', 'Very nice sky and you have hidden Waldo very well', '2007-06-27 11:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841408, 542652, 68467, '<td valign="top">Even though several photos in this challenge were taken at this location, it´s still a good capture</td>', 'Even though several photos in this challenge were taken at this location, it´s still a good capture', '2007-06-27 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841415, 542452, 68467, '<td valign="top">Waldo´s a giant !</td>', 'Waldo´s a giant !', '2007-06-27 11:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841421, 542198, 68467, '<td valign="top">The light seems a bit too harsh at the floor. Yes - I know it isn´t that easy</td>', 'The light seems a bit too harsh at the floor. Yes - I know it isn´t that easy', '2007-06-27 11:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841432, 542720, 68467, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset</td>', 'Beautiful sunset', '2007-06-27 11:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841440, 541033, 68467, '<td valign="top">Do anyone wants to borrow a plumb bob</td>', 'Do anyone wants to borrow a plumb bob', '2007-06-27 11:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841447, 541266, 43073, '<td valign="top">Pleasant image here, with nice blues in the sky and reflected in the water. Looks like a nice calm place to just sit and relax. I''m not finding a lot to look at here, though, and the only thing that seems to grab my attention is looking for (and finding) Waldo (thus, meeting the challenge well).</td>', 'Pleasant image here, with nice blues in the sky and reflected in the water. Looks like a nice calm place to just sit and relax. I''m not finding a lot to look at here, though, and the only thing that seems to grab my attention is looking for (and finding) Waldo (thus, meeting the challenge well).', '2007-06-27 11:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841453, 538547, 43073, '<td valign="top">I had to look at this a few times, each time wondering why the focus was soft. Was it an intentional attempt to keep us from finding Waldo? Was it done intentionally to reflect what we often feel when we see this view (for me, it''s that I''m late somewhere, or for something, and never really stop to look beyond just finding my place)? In any event, it made me stop and think, and look some more, at something I don''t often look at. And that''s a good thing!</td>', 'I had to look at this a few times, each time wondering why the focus was soft. Was it an intentional attempt to keep us from finding Waldo? Was it done intentionally to reflect what we often feel when we see this view (for me, it''s that I''m late somewhere, or for something, and never really stop to look beyond just finding my place)? In any event, it made me stop and think, and look some more, at something I don''t often look at. And that''s a good thing!', '2007-06-27 11:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841457, 542785, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, with so few colors throughout but not b&amp;w; I like the perspective and there are interesting things to see, but for some reason I keep finding my eyes drawn to the brightness of the lights, lingering there and not looking down the path. Maybe that''s what would happen if I was there, and I would trip and fall because I was looking up at the lights. Interesting shot.</td>', 'Interesting image, with so few colors throughout but not b&w; I like the perspective and there are interesting things to see, but for some reason I keep finding my eyes drawn to the brightness of the lights, lingering there and not looking down the path. Maybe that''s what would happen if I was there, and I would trip and fall because I was looking up at the lights. Interesting shot.', '2007-06-27 11:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841473, 542512, 43073, '<td valign="top">Good choice here for the challenge; the colors blend together well, and the scene has lots of interesting things to look at. Some of the little distractions seem to be drawing me away from this image, though, such as some of the things you can see through the trees on the left, or the house (or something colored) above the woman''s head. Nice textures in the trees, though, and a good overall effort here.</td>', 'Good choice here for the challenge; the colors blend together well, and the scene has lots of interesting things to look at. Some of the little distractions seem to be drawing me away from this image, though, such as some of the things you can see through the trees on the left, or the house (or something colored) above the woman''s head. Nice textures in the trees, though, and a good overall effort here.', '2007-06-27 11:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841479, 542628, 43073, '<td valign="top">Intrigues me for its take on the challenge, but beyond finding Waldo, I can''t find much else going on here. The greens are okay, but a bit more contrast and perhaps even more saturation, might have made this call more to me.</td>', 'Intrigues me for its take on the challenge, but beyond finding Waldo, I can''t find much else going on here. The greens are okay, but a bit more contrast and perhaps even more saturation, might have made this call more to me.', '2007-06-27 11:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841652, 539518, 70000, '<td valign="top">thats really cute how her clothes blend in, she probably could have used a darker shirt, although it looks like it was already burned in a bit. centered composition here really doesn''t work though because shes right there and its very obvious, this would be even more clever if she was placed on the side somewhere and maybe some green shoes? :)</td>', 'thats really cute how her clothes blend in, she probably could have used a darker shirt, although it looks like it was already burned in a bit. centered composition here really doesn''t work though because shes right there and its very obvious, this would be even more clever if she was placed on the side somewhere and maybe some green shoes? :)', '2007-06-27 12:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841654, 542743, 70000, '<td valign="top">woah what strange processing. cool, you hid waldo well</td>', 'woah what strange processing. cool, you hid waldo well', '2007-06-27 12:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841663, 540929, 70000, '<td valign="top">AWESOME...this definitely screams ribbon to me. The composition of the flowers and the face is just wonderful! It makes you want to look at the flower but then its like WOAH...a PERSON there. this must have been very time consuming. FANTASTIC SHOT!</td>', 'AWESOME...this definitely screams ribbon to me. The composition of the flowers and the face is just wonderful! It makes you want to look at the flower but then its like WOAH...a PERSON there. this must have been very time consuming. FANTASTIC SHOT!', '2007-06-27 12:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841671, 542426, 70000, '<td valign="top">oh this is a really neat perspective!!! I love how it blends in and the color scheme has a strange brown tint that even blends into the sky, which really ties the whole photoraph together. great unique shot. the only suggestion i would have is maybe a  shallower depth of field so that the rocks in the front are less prominent, OR a much deeper depth of field so that the rocks in the front are VERY sharp so that you look there first instead of the gate where waldo is</td>', 'oh this is a really neat perspective!!! I love how it blends in and the color scheme has a strange brown tint that even blends into the sky, which really ties the whole photoraph together. great unique shot. the only suggestion i would have is maybe a  shallower depth of field so that the rocks in the front are less prominent, OR a much deeper depth of field so that the rocks in the front are VERY sharp so that you look there first instead of the gate where waldo is', '2007-06-27 12:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841673, 542632, 70000, '<td valign="top">This definitely needs much deeper shaddow</td>', 'This definitely needs much deeper shaddow', '2007-06-27 12:53:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3841676, 542608, 70000, '<td valign="top">what a strange location, great use of line and cool processing</td>', 'what a strange location, great use of line and cool processing', '2007-06-27 12:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841679, 542870, 70000, '<td valign="top">nice use of texture here</td>', 'nice use of texture here', '2007-06-27 12:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841707, 542870, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice bright contrasts - good shot!</td>', 'Nice bright contrasts - good shot!', '2007-06-27 13:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841714, 542853, 63269, '<td valign="top"><i>very</i> well hidden! The colors and the lighting are not very interesting though... It might have been neat either to see this in black and white, or possibly at a different time of day, when the shadows weren''t quite as harsh... although the shadows do help camaflauge the Waldo better. GOod shot! :)</td>', 'very well hidden! The colors and the lighting are not very interesting though... It might have been neat either to see this in black and white, or possibly at a different time of day, when the shadows weren''t quite as harsh... although the shadows do help camaflauge the Waldo better. GOod shot! :)', '2007-06-27 13:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841717, 542349, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the POV and the cropping - nicely done!</td>', 'I love the POV and the cropping - nicely done!', '2007-06-27 13:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841721, 542874, 63269, '<td valign="top">Lovely, <i>lovely</i> colors!!</td>', 'Lovely, lovely colors!!', '2007-06-27 13:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841726, 542634, 63269, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot - somehow, this is exactly how I would picture Mr. "Waldo" would look like... I also like the colors - did you desaturated a little to get that sort of dusy effect? I like this!</td>', 'Excellent shot - somehow, this is exactly how I would picture Mr. "Waldo" would look like... I also like the colors - did you desaturated a little to get that sort of dusy effect? I like this!', '2007-06-27 13:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841738, 541542, 63269, '<td valign="top">Way too cool! In many of the waldo pictures so far, it seems like they are so hard to find that it may as well not even be a waldo picture at all; as though someone was trying to take a nature shot and way off into the distance someone walked into the background. But this... the waldo is truely <i>hidden.</i> I love it!</td>', 'Way too cool! In many of the waldo pictures so far, it seems like they are so hard to find that it may as well not even be a waldo picture at all; as though someone was trying to take a nature shot and way off into the distance someone walked into the background. But this... the waldo is truely hidden. I love it!', '2007-06-27 13:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841739, 540932, 63269, '<td valign="top">The colors are unbelievably fantastic. I love it!</td>', 'The colors are unbelievably fantastic. I love it!', '2007-06-27 13:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841740, 541505, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very well hidden waldo - good job!</td>', 'Very well hidden waldo - good job!', '2007-06-27 13:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841744, 541108, 63269, '<td valign="top">i love your use of sepia, and the tones, contrasts, lighting, and shadows are hauntingly classic. Superb shot.</td>', 'i love your use of sepia, and the tones, contrasts, lighting, and shadows are hauntingly classic. Superb shot.', '2007-06-27 13:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841748, 542741, 63269, '<td valign="top">The little red speck in the left bottom corner... that''s waldo right? :)  Neat. Good shot!</td>', 'The little red speck in the left bottom corner... that''s waldo right? :)  Neat. Good shot!', '2007-06-27 13:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841912, 542873, 43073, '<td valign="top">I''ve had a good look at and think about this shot. It''s a definitely interesting approach to the shot, and some of what could be seen as technical defects actually add to the character of it for me. There is clutter in the background (on the shelf); well, there is clutter in real life. There is food on the table; yep, breakfast time. The whites aren''t white and the blacks aren''t black (there isn''t really very strong contrast in the shot); well, I don''t always have great, beautiful, perfect light when I''m eating breakfast, why would you? My initial take on this missed some of its subtle character. I''m glad I took another look, it''s a really interesting shot.</td>', 'I''ve had a good look at and think about this shot. It''s a definitely interesting approach to the shot, and some of what could be seen as technical defects actually add to the character of it for me. There is clutter in the background (on the shelf); well, there is clutter in real life. There is food on the table; yep, breakfast time. The whites aren''t white and the blacks aren''t black (there isn''t really very strong contrast in the shot); well, I don''t always have great, beautiful, perfect light when I''m eating breakfast, why would you? My initial take on this missed some of its subtle character. I''m glad I took another look, it''s a really interesting shot.', '2007-06-27 13:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841915, 542781, 68586, '<td valign="top">Surely this must be England '' . .land of mist and mellow fruitfullness . .''<br/>Lovely subtle tones and pastel colours.</td>', 'Surely this must be England '' . .land of mist and mellow fruitfullness . .''Lovely subtle tones and pastel colours.', '2007-06-27 13:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841921, 541744, 68586, '<td valign="top">Very good shot. Ideal in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Very good shot. Ideal in B&W.', '2007-06-27 13:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841922, 541722, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great shot. So far the only effective ''ghosting '' shot for me -  and there are a few in this challenge :  )<br/> <br/>Very nice colours and crop.</td>', 'Great shot. So far the only effective ''ghosting '' shot for me -  and there are a few in this challenge :  ) Very nice colours and crop.', '2007-06-27 13:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841925, 542828, 68586, '<td valign="top">Really good conversion and crop.</td>', 'Really good conversion and crop.', '2007-06-27 13:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841932, 542365, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, delightful colours. <br/> <br/>For me a delicate black border would have probably just finished it off, but that is obviously personal taste  :  )</td>', 'Nice shot, delightful colours.  For me a delicate black border would have probably just finished it off, but that is obviously personal taste  :  )', '2007-06-27 13:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841934, 541505, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice picture - nice blending in  :  )</td>', 'Nice picture - nice blending in  :  )', '2007-06-27 13:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841937, 540929, 68586, '<td valign="top">Very good</td>', 'Very good', '2007-06-27 13:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841938, 542106, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. A wonderful riot of colour and good placement of Waldo.</td>', 'Nice shot. A wonderful riot of colour and good placement of Waldo.', '2007-06-27 13:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841939, 541405, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - love the lighting and crop.</td>', 'Nice shot - love the lighting and crop.', '2007-06-27 13:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841943, 542459, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great landscape great sky !<br/> <br/>I''m not sure why you would need an underground bunker there . .  there doesn''t seem much to bomb  :  )</td>', 'Great landscape great sky ! I''m not sure why you would need an underground bunker there . .  there doesn''t seem much to bomb  :  )', '2007-06-27 13:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841944, 541033, 68586, '<td valign="top">Fabulous buildings, and good placement of Waldo  :  )</td>', 'Fabulous buildings, and good placement of Waldo  :  )', '2007-06-27 13:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841979, 539518, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very unusual take on the challenge and I hope you wont get hammered for your originality by the voters.  Think in terms of natural blending this generally works very well although the socks are a little distracting/discordant.<br/> <br/>I like the originality here</td>', 'Very unusual take on the challenge and I hope you wont get hammered for your originality by the voters.  Think in terms of natural blending this generally works very well although the socks are a little distracting/discordant. I like the originality here', '2007-06-27 14:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841987, 542428, 68035, '<td valign="top">OK<br/> <br/>I get the feeling that either<br/> <br/>1.  Waldo is hiding by one of the trees (I think I see him but I am not quite sure)<br/>2.  Waldo is somehwere else and really obvious and I am being plain unobservant<br/>3.  There is no Waldo and I have just wasted 5 minutes looking for him<br/> <br/>I like the soft tones here and the feeling that is just a fraction OOF (never usually a big scorer here but for me in this instance it works well).  Also I love the fact that I seem to be able to see hundreds of things that could be Waldo but still feel a trick could be played on me<br/> <br/>I really like this and hope there is a Waldo, I am scoring 8, but be warned, if ther is not Waldo then the Trolls are gonna get ya</td>', 'OK I get the feeling that either 1.  Waldo is hiding by one of the trees (I think I see him but I am not quite sure)2.  Waldo is somehwere else and really obvious and I am being plain unobservant3.  There is no Waldo and I have just wasted 5 minutes looking for him I like the soft tones here and the feeling that is just a fraction OOF (never usually a big scorer here but for me in this instance it works well).  Also I love the fact that I seem to be able to see hundreds of things that could be Waldo but still feel a trick could be played on me I really like this and hope there is a Waldo, I am scoring 8, but be warned, if ther is not Waldo then the Trolls are gonna get ya', '2007-06-27 14:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841993, 542374, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape and the fact that Waldo appears to be topless (as well as top right) makes him blend in nicely colourwise.  Nice shot in itself and works well for the challenge</td>', 'Nice landscape and the fact that Waldo appears to be topless (as well as top right) makes him blend in nicely colourwise.  Nice shot in itself and works well for the challenge', '2007-06-27 14:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841997, 542860, 68035, '<td valign="top">Yaaay a true Waldo, I so hope that this was someone who just happened to be wearing the outfit but I cant believe life is that good to DPCers.  Really like the way you have brought out the red and the white on Waldo<br/> <br/>Made me laugh and thats never a bad thing</td>', 'Yaaay a true Waldo, I so hope that this was someone who just happened to be wearing the outfit but I cant believe life is that good to DPCers.  Really like the way you have brought out the red and the white on Waldo Made me laugh and thats never a bad thing', '2007-06-27 14:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842000, 542349, 43073, '<td valign="top">There are some interesting elements to this image, and some interesting compositional choices made. I generally like the tones, though the blacks aren''t quite black, and the whites aren''t quite white. I think the image might reach me more if there was a touch more contrast, and if the middle section wasn''t so busy (between the trees and the pergola beams). Waldo is there, but I think the distance this was shot at to hide him makes it harder for me to appreciate.</td>', 'There are some interesting elements to this image, and some interesting compositional choices made. I generally like the tones, though the blacks aren''t quite black, and the whites aren''t quite white. I think the image might reach me more if there was a touch more contrast, and if the middle section wasn''t so busy (between the trees and the pergola beams). Waldo is there, but I think the distance this was shot at to hide him makes it harder for me to appreciate.', '2007-06-27 14:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842005, 542071, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very clever, waldo almost but not quite could be taken for one of those white pillars.  Amazing how he is poitioned so as not to break the symettry of the pillars<br/> <br/>Good job, though possibly a tad dark in the top third</td>', 'Very clever, waldo almost but not quite could be taken for one of those white pillars.  Amazing how he is poitioned so as not to break the symettry of the pillars Good job, though possibly a tad dark in the top third', '2007-06-27 14:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842010, 542111, 68035, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling someone was told to put on a green dress specially for the competition.  Super shot, though maybe even better without the handbag which  rather grabs the attention.  Nice shot</td>', 'I get the feeling someone was told to put on a green dress specially for the competition.  Super shot, though maybe even better without the handbag which  rather grabs the attention.  Nice shot', '2007-06-27 14:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842013, 541273, 43073, '<td valign="top">Directly related to the challenge, but it doesn''t really reach me as an image. The lighting is harsh, and the colors overpowered by the light at times. I like many of the elements of the composition, with the vertical lines of the railings all running parallel, and sort of driving the eye up toward the tower in the middle, but with this cut off, even that is hard for me to get to grips with. Suits the challenge, but I think there''s room here to bring it together as an image, too.</td>', 'Directly related to the challenge, but it doesn''t really reach me as an image. The lighting is harsh, and the colors overpowered by the light at times. I like many of the elements of the composition, with the vertical lines of the railings all running parallel, and sort of driving the eye up toward the tower in the middle, but with this cut off, even that is hard for me to get to grips with. Suits the challenge, but I think there''s room here to bring it together as an image, too.', '2007-06-27 14:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842017, 542658, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely, is that two Waldos I spy in the shade.  Nice shot, good for the competition, simple but very well executed</td>', 'Lovely, is that two Waldos I spy in the shade.  Nice shot, good for the competition, simple but very well executed', '2007-06-27 14:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842019, 540746, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling of this; I see many days like this, and you''ve captured it well, with the background so misty and gray. Obviously not great lighting, but what is here is well composed and well presented, and I like the line that runs past the tree. Interesting shot.</td>', 'I like the feeling of this; I see many days like this, and you''ve captured it well, with the background so misty and gray. Obviously not great lighting, but what is here is well composed and well presented, and I like the line that runs past the tree. Interesting shot.', '2007-06-27 14:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842021, 540993, 75328, '<td valign="top">loving these shadows!<br/>very cool.</td>', 'loving these shadows!very cool.', '2007-06-27 14:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842031, 542634, 68035, '<td valign="top">Woah...Makes me think of the film Deliverance great shot in that it has almost an ominous nature about it yet at the same time (dont ask me why/how) there seems to be a touch of vunerability about the hidden person.  Some people may think the foliage is a touch flat but for me it just adds to the ambiance of the picture the way it is</td>', 'Woah...Makes me think of the film Deliverance great shot in that it has almost an ominous nature about it yet at the same time (dont ask me why/how) there seems to be a touch of vunerability about the hidden person.  Some people may think the foliage is a touch flat but for me it just adds to the ambiance of the picture the way it is', '2007-06-27 14:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842038, 542632, 68035, '<td valign="top">That is soooooo weird (and weird is always good).  Have to say it was my 10 year old daughter rather than me who pointed out that his head would be just tucked in under his shirt collar (what a spoilsport she is).<br/> <br/>The black and white works well and because the tones are a bit muted you get the feeling of having walked into a side show at a Victorian fairground <br/> <br/>Do I get extra points for spotting the other Waldos reflected in the (distinctly non Victorian) glasses</td>', 'That is soooooo weird (and weird is always good).  Have to say it was my 10 year old daughter rather than me who pointed out that his head would be just tucked in under his shirt collar (what a spoilsport she is). The black and white works well and because the tones are a bit muted you get the feeling of having walked into a side show at a Victorian fairground  Do I get extra points for spotting the other Waldos reflected in the (distinctly non Victorian) glasses', '2007-06-27 14:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842052, 542372, 68035, '<td valign="top">Yes of course its easy to spot Waldo, but IMO far better to have him here and looking so contemplative (and thus really enhancing the overall effect) than stuck away in a corner just to be a little better hidden.  What a wonderful piece of natural archtiecture this is and the blue contrast between the water and the sky is fantastic.<br/> <br/>Feel this might do very well and I think it deserves to</td>', 'Yes of course its easy to spot Waldo, but IMO far better to have him here and looking so contemplative (and thus really enhancing the overall effect) than stuck away in a corner just to be a little better hidden.  What a wonderful piece of natural archtiecture this is and the blue contrast between the water and the sky is fantastic. Feel this might do very well and I think it deserves to', '2007-06-27 14:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842054, 542828, 75328, '<td valign="top">oh that bird.<br/>aren''t you lucky.</td>', 'oh that bird.aren''t you lucky.', '2007-06-27 14:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842055, 542383, 43073, '<td valign="top">Some great colors and feeling to this, with delightful clouds and cool green/gray water. I''m not thrilled with the composition, which might be stronger with the bridge and clouds a bit higher and a bit more of the water showing, but I suppose this way deemphasizes Waldo a bit.</td>', 'Some great colors and feeling to this, with delightful clouds and cool green/gray water. I''m not thrilled with the composition, which might be stronger with the bridge and clouds a bit higher and a bit more of the water showing, but I suppose this way deemphasizes Waldo a bit.', '2007-06-27 14:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842056, 542850, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like that there''s more here than meets the eye; the hand lower down gives it a bit of punch, and the idea here is a good one for the challenge. The lighting here, which seems to be a flash, is a bit harsh for my eyes, and perhaps using natural light with a slower shutter speed might have made it appear more natural to me and a bit more subdued. To me, the person is hiding behind the tree, perhaps hoping not to be seen, and the harsh light detracts from that impression. Still, interesting elements throughout.</td>', 'I like that there''s more here than meets the eye; the hand lower down gives it a bit of punch, and the idea here is a good one for the challenge. The lighting here, which seems to be a flash, is a bit harsh for my eyes, and perhaps using natural light with a slower shutter speed might have made it appear more natural to me and a bit more subdued. To me, the person is hiding behind the tree, perhaps hoping not to be seen, and the harsh light detracts from that impression. Still, interesting elements throughout.', '2007-06-27 14:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842058, 542869, 68035, '<td valign="top">A shot that gets you thinking, is this a down and out with his cardboard home or someone working on the firehydrant who just happens to have cardboard by they<br/> <br/>Very sympathetically taken which the soft tones really enhance</td>', 'A shot that gets you thinking, is this a down and out with his cardboard home or someone working on the firehydrant who just happens to have cardboard by they Very sympathetically taken which the soft tones really enhance', '2007-06-27 14:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842065, 541506, 68035, '<td valign="top">Oh that is a really super image for the challenge, beautiful to look at in itself and a Waldo that, because of the colours of his clothes truely blends in to the shot whilst being big enough to make you think doh how did I miss him before after you have found him.  The glare (sunshine on water is (imo) just a touch harsh but other than that perfection - 9</td>', 'Oh that is a really super image for the challenge, beautiful to look at in itself and a Waldo that, because of the colours of his clothes truely blends in to the shot whilst being big enough to make you think doh how did I miss him before after you have found him.  The glare (sunshine on water is (imo) just a touch harsh but other than that perfection - 9', '2007-06-27 14:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842068, 540833, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice crisp clean image (I can almost taste the fresh air) I can see Waldo but glad that he (or is it a she) is nicely integrated into the shot rather than being a hidden add-on</td>', 'Very nice crisp clean image (I can almost taste the fresh air) I can see Waldo but glad that he (or is it a she) is nicely integrated into the shot rather than being a hidden add-on', '2007-06-27 14:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842071, 542625, 68035, '<td valign="top">LOl fantatsic, lots of my favourite things here interesting architecture a lovely black and white and an (albeit small) candid.  I laughed and laughed when I spotted Waldo their head is about a foot lower than you would expect it to be which really adds to the hidden nature of the subject</td>', 'LOl fantatsic, lots of my favourite things here interesting architecture a lovely black and white and an (albeit small) candid.  I laughed and laughed when I spotted Waldo their head is about a foot lower than you would expect it to be which really adds to the hidden nature of the subject', '2007-06-27 14:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842081, 542608, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wow, what are those structures?  oil pipes???  They are beautiful in a non traditional way and give your shot such a beautiful set of leading lines, love the colour contrast between the silver of the pipes and the greenery around.<br/> <br/>Oh BTW I did spot Waldo but I think this shot is about so much more than just a hidden person<br/> <br/>Lovely</td>', 'Wow, what are those structures?  oil pipes???  They are beautiful in a non traditional way and give your shot such a beautiful set of leading lines, love the colour contrast between the silver of the pipes and the greenery around. Oh BTW I did spot Waldo but I think this shot is about so much more than just a hidden person Lovely', '2007-06-27 14:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842087, 542776, 43073, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually a fan of very long water exposures, but here the effect is surreal, and I find it draws me in; it looks like light pouring down the hill, not water. I want to go and play in the light. Nice shot.</td>', 'I''m not usually a fan of very long water exposures, but here the effect is surreal, and I find it draws me in; it looks like light pouring down the hill, not water. I want to go and play in the light. Nice shot.', '2007-06-27 14:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842094, 540458, 68035, '<td valign="top">Goodness when I saw the thumbnail for this I thought tschhh someone pratting around in search of the brown but then once its open and you get to realise there is that wonderful translucent person in the frame is a real treat<br/> <br/>Perhaps my only thought would have been to crop it slightly higher to lose a bit of the drak floor pmaybe (if it was possible) seeing some more of the lava lamp mural as the black of the floor is a bit incongruous with the rest of the image<br/> <br/>Lovely and I am glad I did not let my perception put me off looking at this</td>', 'Goodness when I saw the thumbnail for this I thought tschhh someone pratting around in search of the brown but then once its open and you get to realise there is that wonderful translucent person in the frame is a real treat Perhaps my only thought would have been to crop it slightly higher to lose a bit of the drak floor pmaybe (if it was possible) seeing some more of the lava lamp mural as the black of the floor is a bit incongruous with the rest of the image Lovely and I am glad I did not let my perception put me off looking at this', '2007-06-27 14:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842106, 542828, 68035, '<td valign="top">If I could ever produce a black and white conversion that was a s technically strong as this I would be a VERY happy person.  I cannot find a single point of criticism.  Not normally a big fan of ''through windows'' shots but it work very well here in that it gives the boys features a slight lonliness and disconnect (almost melancholia) that you sometimes get in quiet seaside towns<br/> <br/>Beautiful</td>', 'If I could ever produce a black and white conversion that was a s technically strong as this I would be a VERY happy person.  I cannot find a single point of criticism.  Not normally a big fan of ''through windows'' shots but it work very well here in that it gives the boys features a slight lonliness and disconnect (almost melancholia) that you sometimes get in quiet seaside towns Beautiful', '2007-06-27 14:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842114, 541712, 68035, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that that is them by the tree.  In terms of technical delivery generally strong and it meets the challenge well (possible crop at the bottom to lose the little shadow in the bottom corner?)</td>', 'I''m guessing that that is them by the tree.  In terms of technical delivery generally strong and it meets the challenge well (possible crop at the bottom to lose the little shadow in the bottom corner?)', '2007-06-27 14:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842120, 541337, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice image and framing with Waldo actually complimenting the shot, seems that the is a slight slant on the shot which is a little distracting (though looking to the right of the house that seems oK so it may be the structure itself.  Beautiful sky colouration</td>', 'Very nice image and framing with Waldo actually complimenting the shot, seems that the is a slight slant on the shot which is a little distracting (though looking to the right of the house that seems oK so it may be the structure itself.  Beautiful sky colouration', '2007-06-27 14:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842189, 541108, 74496, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, and the mood of this picture.</td>', 'I like the composition, and the mood of this picture.', '2007-06-27 15:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842193, 542512, 74496, '<td valign="top">Waldo is a too obvious, and the trees in the foreground not very sharp.  Also the hot spots on the left are distracting</td>', 'Waldo is a too obvious, and the trees in the foreground not very sharp.  Also the hot spots on the left are distracting', '2007-06-27 15:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842198, 542428, 74496, '<td valign="top">Top/center right??!</td>', 'Top/center right??!', '2007-06-27 15:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842203, 541405, 74496, '<td valign="top">Beautiful time of day.  Center/left?</td>', 'Beautiful time of day.  Center/left?', '2007-06-27 15:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842206, 542500, 74496, '<td valign="top">Great composition!</td>', 'Great composition!', '2007-06-27 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842209, 540929, 78196, '<td valign="top">Haha, you really went to far too much effort on this!! Really nice work.</td>', 'Haha, you really went to far too much effort on this!! Really nice work.', '2007-06-27 15:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842212, 542727, 74496, '<td valign="top">THREE?</td>', 'THREE?', '2007-06-27 15:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842213, 542242, 43073, '<td valign="top">Neat image with some nice touches, though completely disaturated except for the flowers would have appealed to me more, I think. I like the concept a lot, and composition is good (though moving Waldo down and in just a bit might have improved it for me just a tad, but would have thrown more focus on him), along with an almost abstract appearance because of your choice of location. Good shot.</td>', 'Neat image with some nice touches, though completely disaturated except for the flowers would have appealed to me more, I think. I like the concept a lot, and composition is good (though moving Waldo down and in just a bit might have improved it for me just a tad, but would have thrown more focus on him), along with an almost abstract appearance because of your choice of location. Good shot.', '2007-06-27 15:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842215, 542602, 74496, '<td valign="top">Great idea, not so nice location/backdrop</td>', 'Great idea, not so nice location/backdrop', '2007-06-27 15:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842218, 542031, 43073, '<td valign="top">A great tree, which to me is the focal point of the image, nicely framed and set out for us. The tree is a bit dark to my eyes, though; I might have liked to see a bit more texture in the tree itself. The sky does have a nice gradient appearance to it.</td>', 'A great tree, which to me is the focal point of the image, nicely framed and set out for us. The tree is a bit dark to my eyes, though; I might have liked to see a bit more texture in the tree itself. The sky does have a nice gradient appearance to it.', '2007-06-27 15:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842223, 542828, 78196, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot and superb conversion and PS work. My favourite so far.</td>', 'A wonderful shot and superb conversion and PS work. My favourite so far.', '2007-06-27 15:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842226, 542854, 78196, '<td valign="top">The light and colours here are exceptional. One of my favourite shots so far.</td>', 'The light and colours here are exceptional. One of my favourite shots so far.', '2007-06-27 15:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842233, 538679, 43073, '<td valign="top">Good beach shot, though it is largely without a solid focal point to my eye (I know, Waldo is the focal point, but not really in visual terms); even the lines here seem to run contrary to each other to a bit (the log points to a point on the shore that doesn''t quite yet turn a corner, for example). Lighting is sufficient, and it suits the purpose of providing a puzzle in finding Waldo, but it does not reach me as an image on its own.</td>', 'Good beach shot, though it is largely without a solid focal point to my eye (I know, Waldo is the focal point, but not really in visual terms); even the lines here seem to run contrary to each other to a bit (the log points to a point on the shore that doesn''t quite yet turn a corner, for example). Lighting is sufficient, and it suits the purpose of providing a puzzle in finding Waldo, but it does not reach me as an image on its own.', '2007-06-27 15:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842236, 542260, 43073, '<td valign="top">A good attempt at the "hiding in the greens" tack for this challenge, though a green shirt on Waldo might have been more effective. Lighting on the greens is pleasant, but there is not much to do here other than find Waldo.</td>', 'A good attempt at the "hiding in the greens" tack for this challenge, though a green shirt on Waldo might have been more effective. Lighting on the greens is pleasant, but there is not much to do here other than find Waldo.', '2007-06-27 15:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842251, 541676, 43073, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors captured here, and the lighting plays nicely with the what''s there. I wonder, though, if Waldo gets out of that window, can he even go anywhere? Looks to me like he''s fenced in. Good capture of an interesting location.</td>', 'I really like the colors captured here, and the lighting plays nicely with the what''s there. I wonder, though, if Waldo gets out of that window, can he even go anywhere? Looks to me like he''s fenced in. Good capture of an interesting location.', '2007-06-27 15:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842260, 542764, 43073, '<td valign="top">Lighting here works well, but I''m not sure where the focal point is for the image. It could be Waldo, who is easily found, but from a compositional standpoint, that doesn''t seem right. I''m wondering whether one of the gravestones mentions Skipo, and if that''s where we should be looking, but I don''t see one that does. I''m a bit mystified by this, I guess.</td>', 'Lighting here works well, but I''m not sure where the focal point is for the image. It could be Waldo, who is easily found, but from a compositional standpoint, that doesn''t seem right. I''m wondering whether one of the gravestones mentions Skipo, and if that''s where we should be looking, but I don''t see one that does. I''m a bit mystified by this, I guess.', '2007-06-27 15:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842263, 542720, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture; another image that I initially set at 6 and now, writing comments, I have no idea why. Excellent, interesting colors, brilliant capture directly into the sun, strong composition and choices made. I must have been grumpy first time around. 8.</td>', 'Interesting capture; another image that I initially set at 6 and now, writing comments, I have no idea why. Excellent, interesting colors, brilliant capture directly into the sun, strong composition and choices made. I must have been grumpy first time around. 8.', '2007-06-27 15:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842266, 542374, 43073, '<td valign="top">Wow, such a great place to be; so easy to get lost (as Waldo seems to have gotten); lovely, subtle colors, from reds to pale yellows, to greens and soft whites. I wish I could visit here, if only for a few minutes. Nicely shot.</td>', 'Wow, such a great place to be; so easy to get lost (as Waldo seems to have gotten); lovely, subtle colors, from reds to pale yellows, to greens and soft whites. I wish I could visit here, if only for a few minutes. Nicely shot.', '2007-06-27 15:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842268, 542401, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting choices here, and good use of available light inside the window. Good way to deemphasize where Waldo is.</td>', 'Interesting choices here, and good use of available light inside the window. Good way to deemphasize where Waldo is.', '2007-06-27 15:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842274, 541878, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, good for a night shot, especially. Interesting, intriguing building, and good capture to not let the lights overwhelm the image. I might have tried some perspective correction on this (given advanced editing), as the left/right lines throw me a bit.</td>', 'Interesting shot, good for a night shot, especially. Interesting, intriguing building, and good capture to not let the lights overwhelm the image. I might have tried some perspective correction on this (given advanced editing), as the left/right lines throw me a bit.', '2007-06-27 15:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842330, 542609, 77683, '<td valign="top">i cannot find the person and its causing some frustration<br/> <br/>haha nice capture.</td>', 'i cannot find the person and its causing some frustration haha nice capture.', '2007-06-27 16:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842358, 542387, 43073, '<td valign="top">Good approach for the challenge, with Waldo nicely deemphasized by both size and placement in the image. The image itself is interesting, but it seems the primary focal point is looking for Waldo, so it meets the challenge in that respect.</td>', 'Good approach for the challenge, with Waldo nicely deemphasized by both size and placement in the image. The image itself is interesting, but it seems the primary focal point is looking for Waldo, so it meets the challenge in that respect.', '2007-06-27 16:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842363, 542812, 43073, '<td valign="top">Cool forest shot, with excellent subtle colors. Nice grain on the trees, and nice textures. Very good approach to the challenge.</td>', 'Cool forest shot, with excellent subtle colors. Nice grain on the trees, and nice textures. Very good approach to the challenge.', '2007-06-27 16:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842370, 541505, 65234, '<td valign="top">Well-hidden; clothing blends in nicely with the trees.</td>', 'Well-hidden; clothing blends in nicely with the trees.', '2007-06-27 16:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842374, 542626, 65234, '<td valign="top">Don''t see anything I''m 100% sure is Waldo; he''s too well-hidden for me.  Pic looks a little too bright and sky is very dull.</td>', 'Don''t see anything I''m 100% sure is Waldo; he''s too well-hidden for me.  Pic looks a little too bright and sky is very dull.', '2007-06-27 16:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842381, 542874, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty building and nice sky behind it.  Looks like a Waldo off to the left.  Horizon feels tilted but that may be the sidewalk in relation to the horizon.</td>', 'Pretty building and nice sky behind it.  Looks like a Waldo off to the left.  Horizon feels tilted but that may be the sidewalk in relation to the horizon.', '2007-06-27 16:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842390, 542848, 65234, '<td valign="top">Hoping Waldo can tread water.  Sea looks too green in comparison to sky for some reason.</td>', 'Hoping Waldo can tread water.  Sea looks too green in comparison to sky for some reason.', '2007-06-27 16:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842391, 540993, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yep, there is.  Kind of spooky composition.</td>', 'Yep, there is.  Kind of spooky composition.', '2007-06-27 16:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842396, 542608, 65234, '<td valign="top">Good of Waldo to wear his red hat for easy identification.  Seems like he should have some help out there in the middle of nowhere!</td>', 'Good of Waldo to wear his red hat for easy identification.  Seems like he should have some help out there in the middle of nowhere!', '2007-06-27 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842398, 542383, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and texture in the clouds.  Water looks a little too green in comparison to the blue of the sky.  Walso is suitably subtle.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and texture in the clouds.  Water looks a little too green in comparison to the blue of the sky.  Walso is suitably subtle.', '2007-06-27 16:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842407, 542764, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yep, that''s him all right!  You should have asked him to kneel down so he blended in better with the smaller gravestones ;-)  And I see you got one of the robins perched on a gravestone, with rather nice lighting on the bird.</td>', 'Yep, that''s him all right!  You should have asked him to kneel down so he blended in better with the smaller gravestones ;-)  And I see you got one of the robins perched on a gravestone, with rather nice lighting on the bird.', '2007-06-27 16:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842412, 542092, 65234, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a definitive Waldo but maybe I''m not looking in the right places.  There are certainly lots of possible hiding spots.  Interesting POV; would like a bit more color/definition in the sky and clouds.</td>', 'I don''t see a definitive Waldo but maybe I''m not looking in the right places.  There are certainly lots of possible hiding spots.  Interesting POV; would like a bit more color/definition in the sky and clouds.', '2007-06-27 16:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842418, 542720, 65234, '<td valign="top">Now I''m humming Otis Redding ;-)  Pretty scene; that unused chair looks very inviting!</td>', 'Now I''m humming Otis Redding ;-)  Pretty scene; that unused chair looks very inviting!', '2007-06-27 16:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842424, 539064, 43073, '<td valign="top">Really interesting image here, with neat shades and shadows throughout. Placement of Waldo works well, and blue shades complement the white nicely. The path works well to draw the viewer into the image (and right past Waldo).</td>', 'Really interesting image here, with neat shades and shadows throughout. Placement of Waldo works well, and blue shades complement the white nicely. The path works well to draw the viewer into the image (and right past Waldo).', '2007-06-27 16:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842425, 542478, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty primitive.  You''d think Waldo could afford something better after leasing his image to all those puzzle companies!  Looks like he prefers serious solitude in his private time.</td>', 'Pretty primitive.  You''d think Waldo could afford something better after leasing his image to all those puzzle companies!  Looks like he prefers serious solitude in his private time.', '2007-06-27 16:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842431, 542775, 43073, '<td valign="top">Good choices in terms of color of shirt to match the background, but the image as is leaves me little more to do than search for Waldo; for meeting the challenge, this works, but it doesn''t really reach me as an image.</td>', 'Good choices in terms of color of shirt to match the background, but the image as is leaves me little more to do than search for Waldo; for meeting the challenge, this works, but it doesn''t really reach me as an image.', '2007-06-27 16:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842436, 541723, 43073, '<td valign="top">Bumping this up as I come by; straight forward, well executed, and while there isn''t much to it other than Waldo, for that it does one of the better jobs I''ve seen.</td>', 'Bumping this up as I come by; straight forward, well executed, and while there isn''t much to it other than Waldo, for that it does one of the better jobs I''ve seen.', '2007-06-27 16:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842437, 542492, 65234, '<td valign="top">There may be a person in there somewhere but I can''t see one.  I don''t think the surreal processing does justice to a beautiful animal as well as more realistic processing would have.  Sorry; just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'There may be a person in there somewhere but I can''t see one.  I don''t think the surreal processing does justice to a beautiful animal as well as more realistic processing would have.  Sorry; just doesn''t work for me.', '2007-06-27 16:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842438, 542260, 65234, '<td valign="top">Hope there wasn''t any poison ivy in that jungle!</td>', 'Hope there wasn''t any poison ivy in that jungle!', '2007-06-27 16:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842440, 542049, 43073, '<td valign="top">Waldo is nicely deemphasized in color and placement, and the image itself has some good points aside from this (interesting textures), though it is a bit bright at some points (especially what''s lying on the water, which -- especially in the lower right corner -- is quite distracting to me).</td>', 'Waldo is nicely deemphasized in color and placement, and the image itself has some good points aside from this (interesting textures), though it is a bit bright at some points (especially what''s lying on the water, which -- especially in the lower right corner -- is quite distracting to me).', '2007-06-27 16:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842451, 542862, 43073, '<td valign="top">A good shot at meeting the challenge, with interesting lines to follow throughout the image.</td>', 'A good shot at meeting the challenge, with interesting lines to follow throughout the image.', '2007-06-27 16:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842453, 542634, 43073, '<td valign="top">Well shot for the challenge, with good composition and a bit of subtlety to the colors which fits nicely with it. I''m actually a bit scared of what happens when Waldo comes out of the bushes . . .</td>', 'Well shot for the challenge, with good composition and a bit of subtlety to the colors which fits nicely with it. I''m actually a bit scared of what happens when Waldo comes out of the bushes . . .', '2007-06-27 16:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842455, 540553, 65234, '<td valign="top">Almost missed that person on the left (is that Persephone or Waldo?  I don''t usually think of them as easy to confuse!).  The sky is lovely and I like the perspective on the cathedral.  Feel like the darker parts of the image should be all silhouette or all have detail; the buildings to the right and left, for instance, seem about the same distance from the camera but one has detail and one doesn''t, which just feels odd to me with a centered composition.</td>', 'Almost missed that person on the left (is that Persephone or Waldo?  I don''t usually think of them as easy to confuse!).  The sky is lovely and I like the perspective on the cathedral.  Feel like the darker parts of the image should be all silhouette or all have detail; the buildings to the right and left, for instance, seem about the same distance from the camera but one has detail and one doesn''t, which just feels odd to me with a centered composition.', '2007-06-27 16:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842462, 542625, 43073, '<td valign="top">Good job at meeting the challenge, with excellent sharpness to the lines and deep shadows to keep Waldo hidden.</td>', 'Good job at meeting the challenge, with excellent sharpness to the lines and deep shadows to keep Waldo hidden.', '2007-06-27 16:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842466, 542349, 65234, '<td valign="top">There could easily be someone hidden in any number of places but I don''t see anyone.  Think I would probably like this better in color as those big mounded bushes look very odd to me in B&amp;W.</td>', 'There could easily be someone hidden in any number of places but I don''t see anyone.  Think I would probably like this better in color as those big mounded bushes look very odd to me in B&W.', '2007-06-27 16:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842469, 541916, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting, with good plays of light and playful color throughout. Lots of dark spaces (who''s hiding in <i>those</i> places). Nice shot.</td>', 'Interesting, with good plays of light and playful color throughout. Lots of dark spaces (who''s hiding in those places). Nice shot.', '2007-06-27 16:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842480, 540746, 65234, '<td valign="top">I do see a person; not sure the rest of the picture is doing much for me, but it is aptly titled.  That''s tough weather to get an interesting picture in since it doesn''t have the lights and darks that would give it depth.</td>', 'I do see a person; not sure the rest of the picture is doing much for me, but it is aptly titled.  That''s tough weather to get an interesting picture in since it doesn''t have the lights and darks that would give it depth.', '2007-06-27 16:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842482, 542865, 43073, '<td valign="top">Very cool image, wonderfully conceived and executed. I imagine you''re getting killed because "Waldo" is so easy to find, so I hope it does well for you in the end.</td>', 'Very cool image, wonderfully conceived and executed. I imagine you''re getting killed because "Waldo" is so easy to find, so I hope it does well for you in the end.', '2007-06-27 16:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842489, 541837, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, meeting the challenge well. A bit dark for me, but generally quite good.</td>', 'Interesting shot, meeting the challenge well. A bit dark for me, but generally quite good.', '2007-06-27 16:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842492, 542787, 43073, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, with good tones throughout the image. The clear division of the image into left and right had an interesting effect on how I saw the image (in the end, I like it, it''s quite effective).</td>', 'Meets the challenge, with good tones throughout the image. The clear division of the image into left and right had an interesting effect on how I saw the image (in the end, I like it, it''s quite effective).', '2007-06-27 16:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842493, 542870, 65234, '<td valign="top">Seems rather creepy to have some of those whaddyacallem (storage areas for urns) appear open, never mind that old door :::shudder:::  I think Waldo should turn around and leave before his name gets carved on one of those blank stones!</td>', 'Seems rather creepy to have some of those whaddyacallem (storage areas for urns) appear open, never mind that old door :::shudder:::  I think Waldo should turn around and leave before his name gets carved on one of those blank stones!', '2007-06-27 16:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842496, 542745, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, well captured and presented, meeting the challenge, as well.</td>', 'Interesting subject, well captured and presented, meeting the challenge, as well.', '2007-06-27 16:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842499, 542781, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s a lovely, peaceful scene!  Waldo didn''t even make a ripple in it.</td>', 'That''s a lovely, peaceful scene!  Waldo didn''t even make a ripple in it.', '2007-06-27 16:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842508, 542459, 65234, '<td valign="top">Is that a bomb shelter or something?  I don''t think I''d step in even as far as Waldo is!  Nicec colors and tones in this.</td>', 'Is that a bomb shelter or something?  I don''t think I''d step in even as far as Waldo is!  Nicec colors and tones in this.', '2007-06-27 16:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842512, 542498, 65234, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the hint :-)  Lighting is a little harsh but architecture looks intertesting.</td>', 'Thank you for the hint :-)  Lighting is a little harsh but architecture looks intertesting.', '2007-06-27 16:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842518, 542609, 43073, '<td valign="top">Cool image, with great tones and interesting things to see. Nicely done.</td>', 'Cool image, with great tones and interesting things to see. Nicely done.', '2007-06-27 16:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842519, 542456, 65234, '<td valign="top">Fabulous place to play hide and seek :-)  This is a nice angle.</td>', 'Fabulous place to play hide and seek :-)  This is a nice angle.', '2007-06-27 16:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842525, 541548, 43073, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge, and for that it serves its purpose!</td>', 'Good take on the challenge, and for that it serves its purpose!', '2007-06-27 16:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842527, 542828, 65234, '<td valign="top">Really like the tones and composition.  The seagull and face are nicely placed and really strengthen the image.</td>', 'Really like the tones and composition.  The seagull and face are nicely placed and really strengthen the image.', '2007-06-27 16:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842528, 542658, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting building, but the image suffers from some brightness that detracts from it to my eye.</td>', 'Interesting building, but the image suffers from some brightness that detracts from it to my eye.', '2007-06-27 16:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842531, 542721, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not the most subtle placement of Waldo I''ve seen.  Interesting picture, though.</td>', 'Not the most subtle placement of Waldo I''ve seen.  Interesting picture, though.', '2007-06-27 16:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842532, 542860, 43073, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe you''re getting anything other than beaten up with this image; directly contrary to the challenge description -- people are everywhere in this image. That said, I think it''s delightful. Waldo was always in amongst people, and here it''s so clear who "Waldo" is that it works well for me. The subdued tones in the rest of the image and the super bright colors in Waldo are just perfect. Nicely shot!</td>', 'I can''t believe you''re getting anything other than beaten up with this image; directly contrary to the challenge description -- people are everywhere in this image. That said, I think it''s delightful. Waldo was always in amongst people, and here it''s so clear who "Waldo" is that it works well for me. The subdued tones in the rest of the image and the super bright colors in Waldo are just perfect. Nicely shot!', '2007-06-27 16:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842533, 542741, 65234, '<td valign="top">Waldo has lost his little mind!  Hope he made it home in one piece.</td>', 'Waldo has lost his little mind!  Hope he made it home in one piece.', '2007-06-27 16:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842538, 542230, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oooh, I recognize this place!  Nice perspective.</td>', 'Oooh, I recognize this place!  Nice perspective.', '2007-06-27 16:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842546, 542818, 65234, '<td valign="top">How depressing for Waldo :-(  I might like the composition less centered but I think the processing works well for the subject.</td>', 'How depressing for Waldo :-(  I might like the composition less centered but I think the processing works well for the subject.', '2007-06-27 17:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842550, 541108, 65234, '<td valign="top">I can only imagine how many bugs and critters call that car home!  Waldo MUST be a guy to climb in there with them!</td>', 'I can only imagine how many bugs and critters call that car home!  Waldo MUST be a guy to climb in there with them!', '2007-06-27 17:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842553, 542309, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors in the sky and water; not overdone IMO, so thanks for that!  Nice subtle placement of Waldo.</td>', 'Very nice colors in the sky and water; not overdone IMO, so thanks for that!  Nice subtle placement of Waldo.', '2007-06-27 17:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842557, 542198, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting image; I love it when photographers shoot other photographers! Cool image with nice tones and plenty of interest.</td>', 'Interesting image; I love it when photographers shoot other photographers! Cool image with nice tones and plenty of interest.', '2007-06-27 17:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842565, 542452, 43073, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but I''m trying to understand the oversaturation here. The greens are brightly green, the whites are very bright. I feel like I''m missing something here, though the way it''s exposed it almost looks like a model town, which is a really cool effect.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but I''m trying to understand the oversaturation here. The greens are brightly green, the whites are very bright. I feel like I''m missing something here, though the way it''s exposed it almost looks like a model town, which is a really cool effect.', '2007-06-27 17:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842568, 542813, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nice place, I think I''d like to visit there. I like the line the curve of the path makes across the field; my eye keeps following it all the way to the top.</td>', 'Nice place, I think I''d like to visit there. I like the line the curve of the path makes across the field; my eye keeps following it all the way to the top.', '2007-06-27 17:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842574, 542309, 43073, '<td valign="top">Some really nice tones, shades and plays of light here, especially on the sand. Well exposed, which can be especially tough with a white hull in direct sunlight. There does seem to be a bit of a reddish cast to the boat, though, but it doesn''t really detract too much for me.</td>', 'Some really nice tones, shades and plays of light here, especially on the sand. Well exposed, which can be especially tough with a white hull in direct sunlight. There does seem to be a bit of a reddish cast to the boat, though, but it doesn''t really detract too much for me.', '2007-06-27 17:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842575, 542626, 43073, '<td valign="top">A bleak image; Waldo, lost somewhere in the hills. It''s warm now, but night is coming. How will he get home? Will he get home? Interesting choices here to bring a story to the challenge.</td>', 'A bleak image; Waldo, lost somewhere in the hills. It''s warm now, but night is coming. How will he get home? Will he get home? Interesting choices here to bring a story to the challenge.', '2007-06-27 17:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842591, 542232, 43073, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, and actually looks not unlike what my English garden looked like until I pulled out everything that didn''t look like a tree that belonged there.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, and actually looks not unlike what my English garden looked like until I pulled out everything that didn''t look like a tree that belonged there.', '2007-06-27 17:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842594, 542853, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting, and the harsh light and shadows help keep Waldo hidden. I would love to go for a walk through these woods (good title, by the way).</td>', 'Interesting, and the harsh light and shadows help keep Waldo hidden. I would love to go for a walk through these woods (good title, by the way).', '2007-06-27 17:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842597, 540517, 43073, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective here, looking down on the walker heading for the cliffs. I can almost hear it telling a story, of a person who just needs some time along, looking over the lake, to think over love lost or love passed. Nice capture.</td>', 'Love the perspective here, looking down on the walker heading for the cliffs. I can almost hear it telling a story, of a person who just needs some time along, looking over the lake, to think over love lost or love passed. Nice capture.', '2007-06-27 17:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842598, 542633, 68035, '<td valign="top">LOL this feels like another one from the DC GTG.  Strangely enough I have been to the Iwo Jima Memorial when visiting the states and never realised (or never taken in that the flag was a a real one).  Very nice ethereal image and the motion blur of the flag really adds to the shot<br/> <br/>Good job</td>', 'LOL this feels like another one from the DC GTG.  Strangely enough I have been to the Iwo Jima Memorial when visiting the states and never realised (or never taken in that the flag was a a real one).  Very nice ethereal image and the motion blur of the flag really adds to the shot Good job', '2007-06-27 17:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842600, 542857, 43073, '<td valign="top">Great title, and the image here works well for the challenge, the bend starting on the right lower corner and returning to the right at the top, just out of view. Well captured.</td>', 'Great title, and the image here works well for the challenge, the bend starting on the right lower corner and returning to the right at the top, just out of view. Well captured.', '2007-06-27 17:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842605, 542601, 43073, '<td valign="top">Great waterfall, and good capture of the sky (which to me is better than the waterfall by far). Good job meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Great waterfall, and good capture of the sky (which to me is better than the waterfall by far). Good job meeting the challenge.', '2007-06-27 17:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842608, 541337, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, with beautiful blues in the sky, and good job meeting the challenge. I might have tried to stand the little lighthouse up right with a slight rotation counter-clockwise, and the leaning throws me off a bit.</td>', 'Interesting shot, with beautiful blues in the sky, and good job meeting the challenge. I might have tried to stand the little lighthouse up right with a slight rotation counter-clockwise, and the leaning throws me off a bit.', '2007-06-27 17:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842609, 541542, 68035, '<td valign="top">Strange, the strong leading line of the tree takes you straight to Waldo (Waldoina?) so there isnt much of a challenge to find her, but somehow I just find this shot entrancing, not sure whether it is the soft tons or the expression on Waldo (which is clear enough to be able to take in but not so domanant as to answer all your questions about the person)<br/> <br/>I could look at this shot for hours, if I was to make one very small suggestion it would be to crop a bit of the sky in order to heighten the intimacy of the shot<br/> <br/>Really super though</td>', 'Strange, the strong leading line of the tree takes you straight to Waldo (Waldoina?) so there isnt much of a challenge to find her, but somehow I just find this shot entrancing, not sure whether it is the soft tons or the expression on Waldo (which is clear enough to be able to take in but not so domanant as to answer all your questions about the person) I could look at this shot for hours, if I was to make one very small suggestion it would be to crop a bit of the sky in order to heighten the intimacy of the shot Really super though', '2007-06-27 17:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842613, 542855, 43073, '<td valign="top">It''s funny how people can be hidden in plain view, just there, lying on the sidewalk. Step over them, walk past, don''t look at them, they aren''t really there. Delightful capture, good use of light and shadow to actually highlight your Waldo (avoiding the temptation to underplay the point by hiding them in the shadows). The juxtaposition with a mobile phone store is perfect. Well done. 8.</td>', 'It''s funny how people can be hidden in plain view, just there, lying on the sidewalk. Step over them, walk past, don''t look at them, they aren''t really there. Delightful capture, good use of light and shadow to actually highlight your Waldo (avoiding the temptation to underplay the point by hiding them in the shadows). The juxtaposition with a mobile phone store is perfect. Well done. 8.', '2007-06-27 17:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842614, 542785, 68035, '<td valign="top">MMM archways and repetitive patterns...I just love them, Not to hard to spot Waldo but he also feels like he belongs in the shot which really enhances the overall effect<br/> <br/>Lovely duotone</td>', 'MMM archways and repetitive patterns...I just love them, Not to hard to spot Waldo but he also feels like he belongs in the shot which really enhances the overall effect Lovely duotone', '2007-06-27 17:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842623, 542870, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice grain and noise which adds to the subject of the image without overpowering it, theres a good sense of decay and looking at the picture I want to know more about it and what lies both on the wall and beyond the pillars (and the inward looking Waldo of course)</td>', 'Very nice grain and noise which adds to the subject of the image without overpowering it, theres a good sense of decay and looking at the picture I want to know more about it and what lies both on the wall and beyond the pillars (and the inward looking Waldo of course)', '2007-06-27 17:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842634, 542401, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lots of nice elements to this shot, the cluster of champagne bottles on a rule of third line, the obelisk just by the left pane of glass, the steeple in the distance and the old looking buildings (not to forget the yellow shirted Waldo).  One minor issue, the window handle is horrible (which i appreciate there is not much you can do about although because it somehow dominates a lovely shot it may have been worth opening it and seeing if you could pull it back out of shot)</td>', 'Lots of nice elements to this shot, the cluster of champagne bottles on a rule of third line, the obelisk just by the left pane of glass, the steeple in the distance and the old looking buildings (not to forget the yellow shirted Waldo).  One minor issue, the window handle is horrible (which i appreciate there is not much you can do about although because it somehow dominates a lovely shot it may have been worth opening it and seeing if you could pull it back out of shot)', '2007-06-27 17:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842639, 541505, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, it was the finishing net that gave it away, once I saw that I knew the owner would not be too far from it.  Very nice job in that the Waldo seems naturally hidden and therefore compliments the image rather than artificially hidden or in the frame, love the focus and textures on the right hand trees</td>', 'Nice shot, it was the finishing net that gave it away, once I saw that I knew the owner would not be too far from it.  Very nice job in that the Waldo seems naturally hidden and therefore compliments the image rather than artificially hidden or in the frame, love the focus and textures on the right hand trees', '2007-06-27 17:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842645, 540514, 68035, '<td valign="top">Terrific POV and the leading diagonals make for a great shot.  On first site it feels as if you are looking up a lift shaft (especially as the black rectangle near the vanishing point could be the lift heading towards you) which means that when you do spot ''Waldo'' she seem copletely anomalous with the perspective you think you have<br/> <br/>Very nice graiy feel which compliments the shot well<br/> <br/>Strangely appealing and disturbing almost like a snapshot from a half forgotten bad dream</td>', 'Terrific POV and the leading diagonals make for a great shot.  On first site it feels as if you are looking up a lift shaft (especially as the black rectangle near the vanishing point could be the lift heading towards you) which means that when you do spot ''Waldo'' she seem copletely anomalous with the perspective you think you have Very nice graiy feel which compliments the shot well Strangely appealing and disturbing almost like a snapshot from a half forgotten bad dream', '2007-06-27 17:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842656, 542452, 68035, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot which has grown on me.  When I first saw it I thought ''oh empty street, nice but no real wow'' Spent ages looking at various mini blobs wondering ''is that Waldo'' then looked beyong the tall building and realised it was a model village (which makes the tap springing out of the bush more understandable...I was wondering what the hell it was)<br/> <br/>Hopefully I am right about it being a model village aren I, if not run for your life a giant is attacking<br/> <br/>Possibly could have been a touch sharper but in terms of this challenge a true little marvel 8</td>', 'A wonderful shot which has grown on me.  When I first saw it I thought ''oh empty street, nice but no real wow'' Spent ages looking at various mini blobs wondering ''is that Waldo'' then looked beyong the tall building and realised it was a model village (which makes the tap springing out of the bush more understandable...I was wondering what the hell it was) Hopefully I am right about it being a model village aren I, if not run for your life a giant is attacking Possibly could have been a touch sharper but in terms of this challenge a true little marvel 8', '2007-06-27 17:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842661, 542875, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wow, Waldo looks to be a long way from everywhere as he heads down the track.  Glorious landscape which just looking at makes me feel hot and thirsty, love the softer tones and the border works very well</td>', 'Wow, Waldo looks to be a long way from everywhere as he heads down the track.  Glorious landscape which just looking at makes me feel hot and thirsty, love the softer tones and the border works very well', '2007-06-27 17:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842665, 541794, 68035, '<td valign="top">No not to hard to find but a nice composition none the less.  Like the framing</td>', 'No not to hard to find but a nice composition none the less.  Like the framing', '2007-06-27 17:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842666, 540929, 75898, '<td valign="top">This totally reminds me of Keith Haring''s self portrait (but I have a feeling this is inspired by that photo).  Very well done!</td>', 'This totally reminds me of Keith Haring''s self portrait (but I have a feeling this is inspired by that photo).  Very well done!', '2007-06-27 17:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842676, 541986, 68035, '<td valign="top">OK can I make a confession...I think this picture is absolutely stunning, and I mean truely glorious!!! Wonderful colours and just excellent dof, but (gasp) to me waldo actually spoils it a bit.  If you ever reshot this and entered it into a free study (without Waldo) I would be hitting the 10 button without a moments hesitation (and I reckon you would be easily able to sell it as a print).  Still very nice as it is (and I do appreciated that without Waldo then there was no challenge entry)</td>', 'OK can I make a confession...I think this picture is absolutely stunning, and I mean truely glorious!!! Wonderful colours and just excellent dof, but (gasp) to me waldo actually spoils it a bit.  If you ever reshot this and entered it into a free study (without Waldo) I would be hitting the 10 button without a moments hesitation (and I reckon you would be easily able to sell it as a print).  Still very nice as it is (and I do appreciated that without Waldo then there was no challenge entry)', '2007-06-27 17:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842681, 542242, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice composition in terms of waldos head hitting a rule of third line and the desatting of waldo and the flower in the foregrond provide a great counterpoint to the field</td>', 'Nice composition in terms of waldos head hitting a rule of third line and the desatting of waldo and the flower in the foregrond provide a great counterpoint to the field', '2007-06-27 17:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842703, 542854, 68035, '<td valign="top">Possibly the only time I have felt slightly menaced by a Waldo.  Nice lighting and starburst, the shot kind off transcends waldo and goes into a terrific urban scene</td>', 'Possibly the only time I have felt slightly menaced by a Waldo.  Nice lighting and starburst, the shot kind off transcends waldo and goes into a terrific urban scene', '2007-06-27 17:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
