(3842711, 540746, 10665, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, however I find that the hard lines of the fence in the background distracts from the soft feel.  Perhaps a slightly different angle would have been better.</td>', 'Nice photo, however I find that the hard lines of the fence in the background distracts from the soft feel.  Perhaps a slightly different angle would have been better.', '2007-06-27 17:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842727, 542261, 68035, '<td valign="top">I love derelict houses like this and the fact that you cant tell whether waldo is hiding or preparing to jump out a scare the living daylights out of you<br/> <br/>Great tones (though I might have cropped just beneath the guttering on the house in the foreground as it seems to be casting quite a weird light<br/> <br/>Good shot!!!!!!</td>', 'I love derelict houses like this and the fact that you cant tell whether waldo is hiding or preparing to jump out a scare the living daylights out of you Great tones (though I might have cropped just beneath the guttering on the house in the foreground as it seems to be casting quite a weird light Good shot!!!!!!', '2007-06-27 18:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842730, 540929, 68035, '<td valign="top">I see images like this on DPC and I realise just how far I have to travel in terms of concepts and delivery of these ideas. Unique in the challenge and I couldnt even guess how you could improve this technically.  My only possible comment would be I wonder whether with the eye shut rather than open whether you could have created an even more hidden person.  Got a feeling I may well be seeing you on the front page in the next few days<br/> <br/>Congratulations on producing such an awesome image</td>', 'I see images like this on DPC and I realise just how far I have to travel in terms of concepts and delivery of these ideas. Unique in the challenge and I couldnt even guess how you could improve this technically.  My only possible comment would be I wonder whether with the eye shut rather than open whether you could have created an even more hidden person.  Got a feeling I may well be seeing you on the front page in the next few days Congratulations on producing such an awesome image', '2007-06-27 18:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3842737, 541784, 68035, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I am just having to retype this message because for ages I though Waldo was behind the fence under the thatched roof in the background (although I was going to ask you why she was wearing what appeared to be a wedding dress and then I saw the head popping up from behind the gravestone.  Many congratualtions, an excellent image in its own right, nice technicals and a brilliantly hidden Waldo.  I hope people are more observant than me and you dont get criticsed for ''not having a waldo'' Very clever and very well done</td>', 'Cool shot, I am just having to retype this message because for ages I though Waldo was behind the fence under the thatched roof in the background (although I was going to ask you why she was wearing what appeared to be a wedding dress and then I saw the head popping up from behind the gravestone.  Many congratualtions, an excellent image in its own right, nice technicals and a brilliantly hidden Waldo.  I hope people are more observant than me and you dont get criticsed for ''not having a waldo'' Very clever and very well done', '2007-06-27 18:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
