(3844440, 541744, 66398, '<td valign="top">What a cute little Waldo near the bike front tire. You probably chose b/w to hide waldo better and I think it looks good this way but I''d like to see that painting in color after the challenge. This is a great shot of some very cool art.</td>', 'What a cute little Waldo near the bike front tire. You probably chose b/w to hide waldo better and I think it looks good this way but I''d like to see that painting in color after the challenge. This is a great shot of some very cool art.', '2007-06-28 03:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3844446, 541891, 66398, '<td valign="top">Waldo is on the opposite shore on the right side of the left tree. This looks like a straight from the camera shot and it looks very good imo.</td>', 'Waldo is on the opposite shore on the right side of the left tree. This looks like a straight from the camera shot and it looks very good imo.', '2007-06-28 03:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
