(3844467, 542768, 66398, '<td valign="top">Near the top of the shot wearing something blueish purple.... just kidding. the red hat makes it a little too obvious imo but hey I guess he doesn''t have to be hidden right?</td>', 'Near the top of the shot wearing something blueish purple.... just kidding. the red hat makes it a little too obvious imo but hey I guess he doesn''t have to be hidden right?', '2007-06-28 03:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3844471, 540929, 66398, '<td valign="top">The eye closed would have made it harder but I didn''t see him right away either. This is very cool and imaginative. I like it alot.... except you had to go and ruin it with flowers... just kidding.</td>', 'The eye closed would have made it harder but I didn''t see him right away either. This is very cool and imaginative. I like it alot.... except you had to go and ruin it with flowers... just kidding.', '2007-06-28 03:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
