(3844478, 542871, 66398, '<td valign="top">standing next to the furthest um.... thingy just off to the left of it. What and where is this? It looks like a great place with a lot of history and character.</td>', 'standing next to the furthest um.... thingy just off to the left of it. What and where is this? It looks like a great place with a lot of history and character.', '2007-06-28 03:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
