(3844489, 541460, 66398, '<td valign="top">Well he''s somewhere in Nevada near a warehouse that''s for sale. And it looks like he''s been lost for a little while and can''t find his home.</td>', 'Well he''s somewhere in Nevada near a warehouse that''s for sale. And it looks like he''s been lost for a little while and can''t find his home.', '2007-06-28 03:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
