(3844532, 542478, 69121, '<td valign="top">It looks to me like you saved this image at a low quality because the transition from light blue to dark blue in the sky isn''t very smooth. I love the picture though. Out of the twelve I have voted on so far yours is my favorite.</td>', 'It looks to me like you saved this image at a low quality because the transition from light blue to dark blue in the sky isn''t very smooth. I love the picture though. Out of the twelve I have voted on so far yours is my favorite.', '2007-06-28 04:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3844723, 542221, 25355, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get it the first time I looked. Now I wish that the beads were more in focus, i.e. you needed a greater depth of field.</td>', 'I didn''t get it the first time I looked. Now I wish that the beads were more in focus, i.e. you needed a greater depth of field.', '2007-06-28 09:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
