(3845046, 540929, 70484, '<td valign="top">I love this! However it looks like the front flower is oof. But I can''t tell if it is that or if I''m just getting old and my eyes are giving way (especially with the design in back) :-) Anyway, for creativity and pure genius, you get a 10 from me. Very nicely done and great make-up. 10</td>', 'I love this! However it looks like the front flower is oof. But I can''t tell if it is that or if I''m just getting old and my eyes are giving way (especially with the design in back) :-) Anyway, for creativity and pure genius, you get a 10 from me. Very nicely done and great make-up. 10', '2007-06-28 11:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3845051, 542365, 70484, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what else to say, except, Beautiful!!!! Amazing, breath-taking. I love the colors. I want to be there! Great capture! 10</td>', 'I don''t know what else to say, except, Beautiful!!!! Amazing, breath-taking. I love the colors. I want to be there! Great capture! 10', '2007-06-28 11:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3845162, 540275, 79363, '<td valign="top">love the angle of this. The black and white really suits this image</td>', 'love the angle of this. The black and white really suits this image', '2007-06-28 12:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3845170, 541744, 79363, '<td valign="top">took me a good while to find!</td>', 'took me a good while to find!', '2007-06-28 12:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
