(3845277, 541548, 63269, '<td valign="top">I can''t find the waldo - well hidden! The composition of this photo is a little hap-hazard, but the focus and exposure is good. Good shot!</td>', 'I can''t find the waldo - well hidden! The composition of this photo is a little hap-hazard, but the focus and exposure is good. Good shot!', '2007-06-28 13:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
