(3847137, 542747, 55199, '<td valign="top">While this shot effectively speaks of timidity or partial imprisonment, I think it would have done better in a different challenge. I feel for this challenge that the photo should be able to stand on its own without Waldo, and that Waldo should be a more subtle (but complimentary) part of the photo.</td>', 'While this shot effectively speaks of timidity or partial imprisonment, I think it would have done better in a different challenge. I feel for this challenge that the photo should be able to stand on its own without Waldo, and that Waldo should be a more subtle (but complimentary) part of the photo.', '2007-06-29 00:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3847144, 541489, 62187, '<td valign="top">At first I thought - ''Hmmm? Looks like a 7-ish photo to me. I didn''t know what a ''doppelganger'' was - so, I Googled it. Now your photo make perfect sense. Great job! 10</td>', 'At first I thought - ''Hmmm? Looks like a 7-ish photo to me. I didn''t know what a ''doppelganger'' was - so, I Googled it. Now your photo make perfect sense. Great job! 10', '2007-06-29 00:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
