(3848597, 542873, 63269, '<td valign="top">Here''s my two cents. :) There''s nothing really white in the photo - highlights that should be white are more of a gray. I have had this problem a lot too, and discoverd that either adjusting the levels, or adding some more contrast really helps. Neat idea though, and the focus is perfect!</td>', 'Here''s my two cents. :) There''s nothing really white in the photo - highlights that should be white are more of a gray. I have had this problem a lot too, and discoverd that either adjusting the levels, or adding some more contrast really helps. Neat idea though, and the focus is perfect!', '2007-06-29 12:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848599, 542420, 23098, '<td valign="top">Interesting,the placement of Waldo makes the eyes cover the whole photo.</td>', 'Interesting,the placement of Waldo makes the eyes cover the whole photo.', '2007-06-29 12:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848601, 542598, 23098, '<td valign="top">Waldo really blends in.  Took me a minute to see him.</td>', 'Waldo really blends in.  Took me a minute to see him.', '2007-06-29 12:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848602, 542875, 63269, '<td valign="top">I almost want to say this needs more contrast or something and that the border should be either black or white... but it actually creates a neat, very dusty desert-like atmospehre. Great job!</td>', 'I almost want to say this needs more contrast or something and that the border should be either black or white... but it actually creates a neat, very dusty desert-like atmospehre. Great job!', '2007-06-29 12:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848604, 542747, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the tones and textures - excellent job!</td>', 'I love the tones and textures - excellent job!', '2007-06-29 12:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848607, 542646, 63269, '<td valign="top">AWESOME colors! This is amazing! Very cool post-editing.</td>', 'AWESOME colors! This is amazing! Very cool post-editing.', '2007-06-29 12:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848608, 539399, 23098, '<td valign="top">Very nice, Waldo is ''hidden'' with the clothes coloring being the same as the trees.</td>', 'Very nice, Waldo is ''hidden'' with the clothes coloring being the same as the trees.', '2007-06-29 12:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848612, 542111, 23098, '<td valign="top">I really like the way Waldo is hidden due to the vertical stance and especially the clothing being near the colors of the greenery.  Out in the open but hidden.  Nice work.</td>', 'I really like the way Waldo is hidden due to the vertical stance and especially the clothing being near the colors of the greenery.  Out in the open but hidden.  Nice work.', '2007-06-29 12:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848613, 542401, 23098, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Very old world and artsy.</td>', 'I like it.  Very old world and artsy.', '2007-06-29 12:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848614, 542365, 63269, '<td valign="top">The flaming colors of the sky, fading to a deep, rich burgundy... glorious. I love this. The shilouettes are awesome too, I love that tree and the way it''s branches seem to sprawl all over the place. Excellent.</td>', 'The flaming colors of the sky, fading to a deep, rich burgundy... glorious. I love this. The shilouettes are awesome too, I love that tree and the way it''s branches seem to sprawl all over the place. Excellent.', '2007-06-29 12:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848615, 542105, 63269, '<td valign="top">This might look nice with some more contrast, and perhaps in black and white? Neat shot though!</td>', 'This might look nice with some more contrast, and perhaps in black and white? Neat shot though!', '2007-06-29 12:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848618, 541986, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat idea! The POV is great!</td>', 'Neat idea! The POV is great!', '2007-06-29 12:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848620, 542721, 63269, '<td valign="top">absolutely great! Love it! The lighting and the crystal clear focus is fantastic!!</td>', 'absolutely great! Love it! The lighting and the crystal clear focus is fantastic!!', '2007-06-29 12:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848622, 542658, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition feels a little cluttered - there are too many distracting elements and my eyes wander a lot... but other than that, this is a fairly good shot. :)</td>', 'The composition feels a little cluttered - there are too many distracting elements and my eyes wander a lot... but other than that, this is a fairly good shot. :)', '2007-06-29 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848625, 540275, 23098, '<td valign="top">Nice angle for the shot of a complex buildnig. I think it would do very well shot straight on and I may have liked it even more. 8</td>', 'Nice angle for the shot of a complex buildnig. I think it would do very well shot straight on and I may have liked it even more. 8', '2007-06-29 12:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848627, 542812, 63269, '<td valign="top">You have created a very interesting atmosphere... I think it has something to do with the buring over the top of the photo. Almost as though a storm was coming. Very interesting!</td>', 'You have created a very interesting atmosphere... I think it has something to do with the buring over the top of the photo. Almost as though a storm was coming. Very interesting!', '2007-06-29 12:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848628, 541103, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice! I like the vibrant color harmony - the blue of the sky, and then the blue of the boat.</td>', 'Nice! I like the vibrant color harmony - the blue of the sky, and then the blue of the boat.', '2007-06-29 12:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848631, 542478, 63269, '<td valign="top">The burning around the edges creates very dramataic contrasts - really neat shot!</td>', 'The burning around the edges creates very dramataic contrasts - really neat shot!', '2007-06-29 12:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848636, 542057, 63269, '<td valign="top">realy creative, neat take on the challenge - I like this! I know the clutter helps hide the waldo, but might be interesting and beautiful if you cropped out all concrete and rusty metal surrounding the blue and the green water. Just a thought. Another thing I also think is really awesome is the way the real waldo is cut in half by the crop, and the reflection is the same part that was off. :) Interesting photo.</td>', 'realy creative, neat take on the challenge - I like this! I know the clutter helps hide the waldo, but might be interesting and beautiful if you cropped out all concrete and rusty metal surrounding the blue and the green water. Just a thought. Another thing I also think is really awesome is the way the real waldo is cut in half by the crop, and the reflection is the same part that was off. :) Interesting photo.', '2007-06-29 12:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848637, 541784, 63269, '<td valign="top">Could perhaps use a little more contrast, but the sepia tones and all the textures and details are awesome!</td>', 'Could perhaps use a little more contrast, but the sepia tones and all the textures and details are awesome!', '2007-06-29 12:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848639, 542071, 63269, '<td valign="top">Wow...PERFECT placing of the waldo!</td>', 'Wow...PERFECT placing of the waldo!', '2007-06-29 12:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848829, 542865, 80676, '<td valign="top">Very creative 8/10</td>', 'Very creative 8/10', '2007-06-29 13:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848854, 541736, 66952, '<td valign="top">I never did find Waldo, I''ll have to trust that he''s there...but the shot was interesting enough that I kept looking for a long time. Good job!</td>', 'I never did find Waldo, I''ll have to trust that he''s there...but the shot was interesting enough that I kept looking for a long time. Good job!', '2007-06-29 14:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848872, 542853, 66952, '<td valign="top">I haven''t found Waldo yet, but I''m sure he''s there...a nice shot of the woods. Nice and sharp, good colors. The light is pretty harsh, though, and the focus point seems to be the bright patch of dirt in the lower center.</td>', 'I haven''t found Waldo yet, but I''m sure he''s there...a nice shot of the woods. Nice and sharp, good colors. The light is pretty harsh, though, and the focus point seems to be the bright patch of dirt in the lower center.', '2007-06-29 14:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848884, 542498, 66952, '<td valign="top">It took me awhile to find Waldo, he''s really hidden in the shadows. Nice graphic image, but I think overall, the shadows might be a bit too dark. I''m guessing there''s probably some nice detail in the shadows that I''m not seeing (besides Waldo).</td>', 'It took me awhile to find Waldo, he''s really hidden in the shadows. Nice graphic image, but I think overall, the shadows might be a bit too dark. I''m guessing there''s probably some nice detail in the shadows that I''m not seeing (besides Waldo).', '2007-06-29 14:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848885, 542865, 46832, '<td valign="top">HIDE a person...</td>', 'HIDE a person...', '2007-06-29 14:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848896, 542420, 66952, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Nice, even lighting, good and sharp. The composition seems pretty well balanced, too. It seems a bit snapshot-ish, using the woman working at the desk as your Waldo. It might have worked better to have a real person, possibly in costume, interacting with one of the mannequins.</td>', 'Great idea! Nice, even lighting, good and sharp. The composition seems pretty well balanced, too. It seems a bit snapshot-ish, using the woman working at the desk as your Waldo. It might have worked better to have a real person, possibly in costume, interacting with one of the mannequins.', '2007-06-29 14:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848913, 541712, 66952, '<td valign="top">Clean and sharp. The bottom half of the image seems a bit dark, but it would be hard to do anything about that without either using a GND filter, or adjusting the top and bottom separately in photoshop.</td>', 'Clean and sharp. The bottom half of the image seems a bit dark, but it would be hard to do anything about that without either using a GND filter, or adjusting the top and bottom separately in photoshop.', '2007-06-29 14:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848916, 542862, 66952, '<td valign="top">Yep, there''s Waldo! Nice b&amp;w conversion. The lighting and contrast are great. The scene seems a bit busy, especially with the sign on the left side, and the extra pole right in the middle.</td>', 'Yep, there''s Waldo! Nice b&w conversion. The lighting and contrast are great. The scene seems a bit busy, especially with the sign on the left side, and the extra pole right in the middle.', '2007-06-29 14:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848917, 540275, 66398, '<td valign="top">Waldo is about midway through the skywalk. The tilted angle makes this interesting.... I like it. I also like the leading lines and the patterns in this. Maybe just a little adjustment in midtones might make the whites of the floor and walls a little whiter but it could also blow out the highlights outside the window so I''m not sure.</td>', 'Waldo is about midway through the skywalk. The tilted angle makes this interesting.... I like it. I also like the leading lines and the patterns in this. Maybe just a little adjustment in midtones might make the whites of the floor and walls a little whiter but it could also blow out the highlights outside the window so I''m not sure.', '2007-06-29 14:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848919, 541548, 66952, '<td valign="top">Oh, there''s Waldo! Peeking out from behind the bush. Nice, even lighting, nice and sharp. I''m just not sure the scene is that interesting.</td>', 'Oh, there''s Waldo! Peeking out from behind the bush. Nice, even lighting, nice and sharp. I''m just not sure the scene is that interesting.', '2007-06-29 14:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848921, 542057, 66952, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, the legs at the top of the frame, and head and shoulders in the lower half. The scummy pond is kind of yucky, though.</td>', 'I like the idea, the legs at the top of the frame, and head and shoulders in the lower half. The scummy pond is kind of yucky, though.', '2007-06-29 14:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848930, 541023, 66952, '<td valign="top">Excellent. My blue ribbon for this challenge. I really like how "waldo" is both a part of the composition and hidden at the same time.</td>', 'Excellent. My blue ribbon for this challenge. I really like how "waldo" is both a part of the composition and hidden at the same time.', '2007-06-29 14:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848932, 542862, 66398, '<td valign="top">Waldo is on the far right of the shot iin front of the door.  The sign in the top left is a bit distracting for me and I don''t see anything on the left of the shot that is necesarily worth keeping so maybe if you cropped out the left side to the edge of that sign and a little less crop on top? Might look good with the angle you chose on that building and draw the viewers eyes toward the left side of the shot with the lines (kind of away from your Waldo).</td>', 'Waldo is on the far right of the shot iin front of the door.  The sign in the top left is a bit distracting for me and I don''t see anything on the left of the shot that is necesarily worth keeping so maybe if you cropped out the left side to the edge of that sign and a little less crop on top? Might look good with the angle you chose on that building and draw the viewers eyes toward the left side of the shot with the lines (kind of away from your Waldo).', '2007-06-29 14:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848936, 540929, 66952, '<td valign="top">Great! One of my top 3. The makeup artist gets an award for this one. Awesome job matching the makeup to the background.</td>', 'Great! One of my top 3. The makeup artist gets an award for this one. Awesome job matching the makeup to the background.', '2007-06-29 14:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848939, 541405, 66952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful treatment of the subject.</td>', 'Beautiful treatment of the subject.', '2007-06-29 14:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848946, 542828, 66952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Good job both hiding waldo, and making waldo the subject of the image. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Beautiful. Good job both hiding waldo, and making waldo the subject of the image. One of my top picks.', '2007-06-29 14:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848947, 539399, 66952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and colors. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and colors. One of my top picks.', '2007-06-29 14:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848951, 542875, 66952, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I like how the person really gives a sense of scale to the whole thing.</td>', 'Gorgeous. I like how the person really gives a sense of scale to the whole thing.', '2007-06-29 14:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848955, 541489, 66398, '<td valign="top">Looks like two Waldos at first but I''m thinking the one on top of the building is actually a vent or something that you are hoping people see first and guess that its Waldo when Waldo is actually on the lower side of the shot right between the color change in the wall. Your choice of exposure is quite good getting the right amount of light in the right areas. The sky colors are very good as well.</td>', 'Looks like two Waldos at first but I''m thinking the one on top of the building is actually a vent or something that you are hoping people see first and guess that its Waldo when Waldo is actually on the lower side of the shot right between the color change in the wall. Your choice of exposure is quite good getting the right amount of light in the right areas. The sky colors are very good as well.', '2007-06-29 14:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848958, 542329, 66952, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene. 8</td>', 'A beautiful scene. 8', '2007-06-29 14:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848960, 542365, 66952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, detailed silhouette.</td>', 'Beautiful, detailed silhouette.', '2007-06-29 14:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848965, 541397, 66952, '<td valign="top">I think I would have given this another point if waldo had not been looking at the ground, but the shot is beautiful anyway.</td>', 'I think I would have given this another point if waldo had not been looking at the ground, but the shot is beautiful anyway.', '2007-06-29 14:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848968, 542785, 66952, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The eye is drawn straight down the hall to waldo.</td>', 'Nicely done. The eye is drawn straight down the hall to waldo.', '2007-06-29 14:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848972, 542607, 66952, '<td valign="top">heh...Gotta love the makeup. 7</td>', 'heh...Gotta love the makeup. 7', '2007-06-29 14:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848976, 542741, 66952, '<td valign="top">That''s huge! Without the person, this would just be a rock. With the person, it has scale and emotion. Great job!</td>', 'That''s huge! Without the person, this would just be a rock. With the person, it has scale and emotion. Great job!', '2007-06-29 14:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848978, 542853, 49865, '<td valign="top">Behind the tree!</td>', 'Behind the tree!', '2007-06-29 14:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848979, 541837, 66952, '<td valign="top">Beautifully detailed.</td>', 'Beautifully detailed.', '2007-06-29 14:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848980, 542818, 66398, '<td valign="top">Someones dreamhouse broken down and abandoned. I love old buildings they have so much character. Even the overcast sky adds to this shot in some strange way. I''m not really sure on Waldo here. I''m gonna make two guesses. He''s either somehow part of that orange blob on the left side of the silo thingy or he''s the silhouette in the door. Not sure which.</td>', 'Someones dreamhouse broken down and abandoned. I love old buildings they have so much character. Even the overcast sky adds to this shot in some strange way. I''m not really sure on Waldo here. I''m gonna make two guesses. He''s either somehow part of that orange blob on the left side of the silo thingy or he''s the silhouette in the door. Not sure which.', '2007-06-29 14:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848982, 542720, 66952, '<td valign="top">This makes me want to go there. Nice job.</td>', 'This makes me want to go there. Nice job.', '2007-06-29 14:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848984, 540567, 49865, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image. The oil rig (if that''s what it is...) in the background captures the viewer''s attention solidly, I really had to look for the guy in the photo.</td>', 'This is a lovely image. The oil rig (if that''s what it is...) in the background captures the viewer''s attention solidly, I really had to look for the guy in the photo.', '2007-06-29 14:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848985, 542818, 49865, '<td valign="top">Leaning against the doorway?</td>', 'Leaning against the doorway?', '2007-06-29 14:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848991, 542401, 66398, '<td valign="top">He''s wearing yellow and looks like he''s jogging outside the window. Nice lighting and composition here. I love the brick building outside the window.</td>', 'He''s wearing yellow and looks like he''s jogging outside the window. Nice lighting and composition here. I love the brick building outside the window.', '2007-06-29 14:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848992, 541744, 49865, '<td valign="top">This works surprisingly well. Interesting wall mural here too.</td>', 'This works surprisingly well. Interesting wall mural here too.', '2007-06-29 14:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848995, 542078, 49865, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture.</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture.', '2007-06-29 14:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3848996, 542372, 49865, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful location.</td>', 'What a beautiful location.', '2007-06-29 14:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849000, 542634, 49865, '<td valign="top">Pretty obvious, but I really like this picture for some reason. It would be nier if it was in sharper focus but otherwise the concept and execution is nice.</td>', 'Pretty obvious, but I really like this picture for some reason. It would be nier if it was in sharper focus but otherwise the concept and execution is nice.', '2007-06-29 14:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849004, 542720, 66398, '<td valign="top">He''s sitting at the end of the pier. What a beautiful shot. I love how you''ve captured the sun so well. You even got "rays" on the piers roof. Maybe that was done in pp but either way it works for me. Looks like a perfect morning. (I suppose it could be a sunset and evening but I get the feel of morning). 8</td>', 'He''s sitting at the end of the pier. What a beautiful shot. I love how you''ve captured the sun so well. You even got "rays" on the piers roof. Maybe that was done in pp but either way it works for me. Looks like a perfect morning. (I suppose it could be a sunset and evening but I get the feel of morning). 8', '2007-06-29 14:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849007, 542874, 66398, '<td valign="top">Oh how pretty. What a cool building. Excellent exposure! Waldo is on the far left of the shot walking on the sidewalk.</td>', 'Oh how pretty. What a cool building. Excellent exposure! Waldo is on the far left of the shot walking on the sidewalk.', '2007-06-29 14:56:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3849013, 542420, 66398, '<td valign="top">The lady on the phone at the desk is Waldo. Very cool idea though. I''d like more on the right and top though to see the lady in the chair and the Painter.</td>', 'The lady on the phone at the desk is Waldo. Very cool idea though. I''d like more on the right and top though to see the lady in the chair and the Painter.', '2007-06-29 14:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849019, 541542, 66398, '<td valign="top">Dead center of the shot under the log.</td>', 'Dead center of the shot under the log.', '2007-06-29 15:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849028, 541033, 66398, '<td valign="top">Wow what a cool piece of architecture. With all that reflective material you''ve captured it with minimal reflection of other scenery and I like that. Very nice!! Oh and Waldo is on the bottom right of the shot in the crevace of the building. Very neat.</td>', 'Wow what a cool piece of architecture. With all that reflective material you''ve captured it with minimal reflection of other scenery and I like that. Very nice!! Oh and Waldo is on the bottom right of the shot in the crevace of the building. Very neat.', '2007-06-29 15:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849031, 539064, 68887, '<td valign="top">ir filter?</td>', 'ir filter?', '2007-06-29 15:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849038, 541736, 66398, '<td valign="top">Is he sitting down on the far end of the second level kind of on the left side? He''s hidden very well here good job.</td>', 'Is he sitting down on the far end of the second level kind of on the left side? He''s hidden very well here good job.', '2007-06-29 15:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849055, 542230, 66398, '<td valign="top">There are several small dark objects that could be him but, I''m going to guess the far right sitting down in sort of a stretching position. I like the lines in this. Looks like Roman architecture. I think I''d have cropped just a tiny bit more off the bottom to get rid of the top of that sign?</td>', 'There are several small dark objects that could be him but, I''m going to guess the far right sitting down in sort of a stretching position. I like the lines in this. Looks like Roman architecture. I think I''d have cropped just a tiny bit more off the bottom to get rid of the top of that sign?', '2007-06-29 15:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849062, 541023, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and lighting. Waldo is hiding behind the tree in the right foreground.</td>', 'Nice tones and lighting. Waldo is hiding behind the tree in the right foreground.', '2007-06-29 15:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849070, 542349, 66398, '<td valign="top">That is some interesting shrubbery. I''m sure he''s there but I can''t find Waldo. He''s probably somewhere in the trellaced garden area (called an arbor?).</td>', 'That is some interesting shrubbery. I''m sure he''s there but I can''t find Waldo. He''s probably somewhere in the trellaced garden area (called an arbor?).', '2007-06-29 15:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849148, 541986, 30214, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Bryce canyon! Good job on hiding the Waldo</td>', 'Beautiful Bryce canyon! Good job on hiding the Waldo', '2007-06-29 16:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849151, 542608, 30214, '<td valign="top">great composition, and perfectly meets the challenge</td>', 'great composition, and perfectly meets the challenge', '2007-06-29 16:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849152, 541994, 30214, '<td valign="top">very interesting find, I wish the photo was more crisp...</td>', 'very interesting find, I wish the photo was more crisp...', '2007-06-29 16:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849160, 540929, 30214, '<td valign="top">clever!</td>', 'clever!', '2007-06-29 16:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849167, 540993, 30214, '<td valign="top">love the soft shadow on the wall. I think I''d prefer it without the fence, i don''t know... it''s just too new and metal and rigid and structured for this scene...</td>', 'love the soft shadow on the wall. I think I''d prefer it without the fence, i don''t know... it''s just too new and metal and rigid and structured for this scene...', '2007-06-29 16:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849172, 542242, 30214, '<td valign="top">oh, you most definitely shouldn''t have done this cheap selective desaturation (I prefer to call it selective destruction :)) trick - it would''ve been a great waldo shot forcing me to look hard. but now - where is the challenge? :)</td>', 'oh, you most definitely shouldn''t have done this cheap selective desaturation (I prefer to call it selective destruction :)) trick - it would''ve been a great waldo shot forcing me to look hard. but now - where is the challenge? :)', '2007-06-29 16:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849177, 541794, 30214, '<td valign="top">right. and on top of that - not a great technical quality photo.</td>', 'right. and on top of that - not a great technical quality photo.', '2007-06-29 16:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849183, 542816, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice idea. too bad I don''t see Waldo, only her bikini... maybe it''s my monitor?</td>', 'nice idea. too bad I don''t see Waldo, only her bikini... maybe it''s my monitor?', '2007-06-29 16:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849190, 540932, 30214, '<td valign="top">seems like a bit too much noise reduction and coloring has been applied, sky feels too smooth and too blue, and the water is too green... i may be wrong, though</td>', 'seems like a bit too much noise reduction and coloring has been applied, sky feels too smooth and too blue, and the water is too green... i may be wrong, though', '2007-06-29 16:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
