(3850854, 542632, 63269, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea! And creepy-looking to, with that bizarre chair. It looks like it could use a tiny bit more contrast...  And also, since so much of the image is in black and white colors, it would have been cool to just convert it to black and white anyways, so that the spots of color here and there don''t feel so out of place. But great idea! :)</td>', 'Awesome idea! And creepy-looking to, with that bizarre chair. It looks like it could use a tiny bit more contrast...  And also, since so much of the image is in black and white colors, it would have been cool to just convert it to black and white anyways, so that the spots of color here and there don''t feel so out of place. But great idea! :)', '2007-06-30 10:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850855, 542865, 63269, '<td valign="top">What a dizying picture! Very interesting take on the challenge... the lighting doesn''t seem very good for some reason... and the skin tones are a little unnatural looking, but that could just be me, or my monitor or something. :) Good composition... neat image!</td>', 'What a dizying picture! Very interesting take on the challenge... the lighting doesn''t seem very good for some reason... and the skin tones are a little unnatural looking, but that could just be me, or my monitor or something. :) Good composition... neat image!', '2007-06-30 10:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850856, 540274, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very cool image - I like all the contrasts and the details.</td>', 'Very cool image - I like all the contrasts and the details.', '2007-06-30 10:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850857, 541397, 63269, '<td valign="top">Might want to straighten the horizon, but LOVELY colors - usualy sunsets are done in orange and red, but I love the purple hues you have here!</td>', 'Might want to straighten the horizon, but LOVELY colors - usualy sunsets are done in orange and red, but I love the purple hues you have here!', '2007-06-30 10:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850860, 542420, 63269, '<td valign="top">Lol! Very interesting idea!</td>', 'Lol! Very interesting idea!', '2007-06-30 10:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850861, 542869, 63269, '<td valign="top">Good composition and lighting.</td>', 'Good composition and lighting.', '2007-06-30 10:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850864, 541489, 63269, '<td valign="top">Too neat! The textures and the square patches of colors on the building are great... and something about the posture of the waldo on the roof is somehow comical and pathetic looking. Cool image!</td>', 'Too neat! The textures and the square patches of colors on the building are great... and something about the posture of the waldo on the roof is somehow comical and pathetic looking. Cool image!', '2007-06-30 10:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850867, 541744, 63269, '<td valign="top">awesome hiding of the waldo! He looks like part of the motorcycle at first! Your use of the paintings on the wall is excellent - all the textures and tones camoflauge the waldo perfectly.</td>', 'awesome hiding of the waldo! He looks like part of the motorcycle at first! Your use of the paintings on the wall is excellent - all the textures and tones camoflauge the waldo perfectly.', '2007-06-30 10:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850869, 542609, 63269, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors... oh now I see the waldo! I couldn''t find him at first - excellent hiding!</td>', 'Interesting colors... oh now I see the waldo! I couldn''t find him at first - excellent hiding!', '2007-06-30 10:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850872, 542607, 63269, '<td valign="top">Cool - love the face-paint and the vibrant greens! Putting the subject off-center would have been neat, and more interesting composition maybe, but still a good image. :)</td>', 'Cool - love the face-paint and the vibrant greens! Putting the subject off-center would have been neat, and more interesting composition maybe, but still a good image. :)', '2007-06-30 10:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850875, 542813, 63269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!</td>', 'Beautiful colors!', '2007-06-30 10:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850879, 542626, 63269, '<td valign="top">The textures of the bushes on the hills are perfect for camoflague - good idea. The lighting is a little harsh though... it looks like you were shooting against the sun maybe? It might have been easier to get nicer lighting at a different time of day... but maybe you did this on purpose to help with hiding the waldo. Anyways, neat image. :)</td>', 'The textures of the bushes on the hills are perfect for camoflague - good idea. The lighting is a little harsh though... it looks like you were shooting against the sun maybe? It might have been easier to get nicer lighting at a different time of day... but maybe you did this on purpose to help with hiding the waldo. Anyways, neat image. :)', '2007-06-30 10:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850883, 540833, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the vibrant greens... your post-processing is amazing! Superb image.</td>', 'I love the vibrant greens... your post-processing is amazing! Superb image.', '2007-06-30 10:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850888, 542858, 63269, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I''m almost thinking it might be nice with more contrast... the textures on the building are a little dull... but then you might end up with a really washed out sky. But your composition and the hiding of the waldo is really neat!</td>', 'Awesome! I''m almost thinking it might be nice with more contrast... the textures on the building are a little dull... but then you might end up with a really washed out sky. But your composition and the hiding of the waldo is really neat!', '2007-06-30 10:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850890, 542855, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing colors...everything is a sort of dull gray shade except for the red on the signs, which is really eye-catching. Great image!</td>', 'Very intriguing colors...everything is a sort of dull gray shade except for the red on the signs, which is really eye-catching. Great image!', '2007-06-30 10:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850892, 542764, 63269, '<td valign="top">THe light filtering through the trees is very beautiful and soft - I love it.</td>', 'THe light filtering through the trees is very beautiful and soft - I love it.', '2007-06-30 10:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850893, 542500, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very creative - I like how you can see just the hands. Beautiful image too, the sepia tones are lovely, and the copmosition pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Very creative - I like how you can see just the hands. Beautiful image too, the sepia tones are lovely, and the copmosition pleasing to the eye.', '2007-06-30 10:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850895, 542775, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat! It almost looks like it needs some more contrast, but the composition of your picutre is very nice.</td>', 'Neat! It almost looks like it needs some more contrast, but the composition of your picutre is very nice.', '2007-06-30 10:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850896, 542878, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea!</td>', 'Very cool idea!', '2007-06-30 10:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850898, 540929, 63269, '<td valign="top">Completely awesome use of the zebra camoflauge... great image!</td>', 'Completely awesome use of the zebra camoflauge... great image!', '2007-06-30 10:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850966, 542626, 42013, '<td valign="top">Middle right? Good job of hiding him. Photographically the sky is pretty washed out :(</td>', 'Middle right? Good job of hiding him. Photographically the sky is pretty washed out :(', '2007-06-30 11:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
