(3853166, 542492, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>I give you "Snaps" for courage, My Friend!</b>  However, I''ve been here long enough to know the prevailing opinion about photography.  <i><b>Avante Garde ART</b> is frowned upon &amp; given low marks.  <b>Meeting Challenge INTENT </b>is required for good scores.  (This photo, for example, has no person hidden in the picture...that I can see.  The horse is your subject right.  If so, you will probably be getting alot of DNMC''s because the intent was to hide a person in the photo.)  Finally, <b>muted &amp; dark pastels </b>don''t score as high consistently as vibrant, but not overly-saturated colors.</i> <br/> <b>Much success to you in the future!</b>  Feel free to check out my profile after the challenge closes to see that I have made all these mistakes &amp; learned from them.  Hard lessons, but <b>Little is Learned in Life without a ''Hard Lesson''!  :)</b></td>', 'I give you "Snaps" for courage, My Friend!  However, I''ve been here long enough to know the prevailing opinion about photography.  Avante Garde ART is frowned upon & given low marks.  Meeting Challenge INTENT is required for good scores.  (This photo, for example, has no person hidden in the picture...that I can see.  The horse is your subject right.  If so, you will probably be getting alot of DNMC''s because the intent was to hide a person in the photo.)  Finally, muted & dark pastels don''t score as high consistently as vibrant, but not overly-saturated colors.  Much success to you in the future!  Feel free to check out my profile after the challenge closes to see that I have made all these mistakes & learned from them.  Hard lessons, but Little is Learned in Life without a ''Hard Lesson''!  :)', '2007-07-01 09:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853174, 541103, 50034, '<td valign="top">Great geometry &amp; color!  :)  Great Sky &amp; Sea symmetry with difference in color!</td>', 'Great geometry & color!  :)  Great Sky & Sea symmetry with difference in color!', '2007-07-01 10:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853178, 542813, 50034, '<td valign="top">I am forced to assume that the white dot near the tree line is you or DNMC.  Other than that...Great landscape!  :)</td>', 'I am forced to assume that the white dot near the tree line is you or DNMC.  Other than that...Great landscape!  :)', '2007-07-01 10:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853184, 542745, 50034, '<td valign="top">Lower tier architecture gives appearances of "fish-eye lens," except that I am sure it parallels the curvature of the fountain.  Great little added surprise to the photo!  :)</td>', 'Lower tier architecture gives appearances of "fish-eye lens," except that I am sure it parallels the curvature of the fountain.  Great little added surprise to the photo!  :)', '2007-07-01 10:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
