(3853610, 542818, 55199, '<td valign="top">I can relate!  I like the sky, although its a bit noisy; and, the contrast of the dismal grays with the bright greens, dead tree and live trees. I can see pixels in the vegetation as well (maybe over sharpened?).  This would be a great photo if it were just more crisp/less noisy.</td>', 'I can relate!  I like the sky, although its a bit noisy; and, the contrast of the dismal grays with the bright greens, dead tree and live trees. I can see pixels in the vegetation as well (maybe over sharpened?).  This would be a great photo if it were just more crisp/less noisy.', '2007-07-01 13:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
