(3854924, 541266, 55199, '<td valign="top">I think a different composition would have made this more interesting.</td>', 'I think a different composition would have made this more interesting.', '2007-07-01 21:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3854966, 539399, 55199, '<td valign="top">I like the way you caught the sunlight filtering through the tree canopy and highlighting some leaves/ferns. The dirt of the trail has nice contrast against the green and leads my eyes along the journey.  The angle of the hill adds to a sense of potential motion.  The highlighted leaves on the tree at the very top left distract me though and I think the composition would have been even stronger if some of the top were cropped off.  I like that there is a person in the photo, but I wish I could see a little more of him.  Even with him more exposed, I don''t think he would become the main subject and he would still blend in well with his camoflauged backpack.</td>', 'I like the way you caught the sunlight filtering through the tree canopy and highlighting some leaves/ferns. The dirt of the trail has nice contrast against the green and leads my eyes along the journey.  The angle of the hill adds to a sense of potential motion.  The highlighted leaves on the tree at the very top left distract me though and I think the composition would have been even stronger if some of the top were cropped off.  I like that there is a person in the photo, but I wish I could see a little more of him.  Even with him more exposed, I don''t think he would become the main subject and he would still blend in well with his camoflauged backpack.', '2007-07-01 21:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3854972, 542426, 55199, '<td valign="top">Thats pretty cool.</td>', 'Thats pretty cool.', '2007-07-01 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3854978, 542459, 55199, '<td valign="top">Wow, your sky looks like water.</td>', 'Wow, your sky looks like water.', '2007-07-01 21:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3854995, 542848, 55199, '<td valign="top">If I didn''t know there would be a person, I wouldn''t know that the blurry black ball was a head.  The title helps clarify.  But, I think this would be stronger if there were say a hand peaking over the waves or some other visual clue that would help identify the ball as human.  I think the composition would be stronger by cropping out 2/3rds of the sky so that viewers feel like they are right there in the water too, watching the rescue ship pass by.  Great concept.</td>', 'If I didn''t know there would be a person, I wouldn''t know that the blurry black ball was a head.  The title helps clarify.  But, I think this would be stronger if there were say a hand peaking over the waves or some other visual clue that would help identify the ball as human.  I think the composition would be stronger by cropping out 2/3rds of the sky so that viewers feel like they are right there in the water too, watching the rescue ship pass by.  Great concept.', '2007-07-01 21:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3855004, 541460, 55199, '<td valign="top">Is that a clothing factory?  I don''t get the title.  Waldo looks like the subject, so I don''t feel as though you''ve hidden him.</td>', 'Is that a clothing factory?  I don''t get the title.  Waldo looks like the subject, so I don''t feel as though you''ve hidden him.', '2007-07-01 21:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
