(3855062, 540929, 55199, '<td valign="top">cool :)  I did something kinda like this once, but with spots.  Yours turned out much better than mine though.  I think its because the flowers are your subject, not the person, and the great contrast in pattern and color on b/w.  That and I had to model it myself.  Anyway, I really like this.  Great job.</td>', 'cool :)  I did something kinda like this once, but with spots.  Yours turned out much better than mine though.  I think its because the flowers are your subject, not the person, and the great contrast in pattern and color on b/w.  That and I had to model it myself.  Anyway, I really like this.  Great job.', '2007-07-01 21:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3855066, 542598, 55199, '<td valign="top">lol!</td>', 'lol!', '2007-07-01 21:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
