(3857447, 542428, 68256, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone!  I think a lot of people thought I was messing with them and there wasn''t a troll...Well I could have submitted this one:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=541302" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/68256/thumb/541302.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/68256/thumb/541302.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/68256/thumb/541302.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Both my boys enjoyed getting buried actually and each one wanted a turn.  The thumbnail above is Samuel and the challenge shot was Andrew.<br/> <br/>Thanks again everyone for the great comments, it was so much fun to "watch" the reactions!  So far it is my favorite submission because of all the fun comments.</td>', 'Thanks everyone!  I think a lot of people thought I was messing with them and there wasn''t a troll...Well I could have submitted this one:   Both my boys enjoyed getting buried actually and each one wanted a turn.  The thumbnail above is Samuel and the challenge shot was Andrew. Thanks again everyone for the great comments, it was so much fun to "watch" the reactions!  So far it is my favorite submission because of all the fun comments.', '2007-07-02 11:08:26.000000', NULL, 0),
