(3858218, 542634, 55199, '<td valign="top">The more I looked at this the more I liked it and I gave it a 9.  Personally I think the soft focus/slight blur adds to the sense that something is about to happen.  Its as though even the leaves are shuddering and your Waldo is quivering in anticipation.  I like what you did with this and think it was underrated.  I''m adding it to my favorites.  :)</td>', 'The more I looked at this the more I liked it and I gave it a 9.  Personally I think the soft focus/slight blur adds to the sense that something is about to happen.  Its as though even the leaves are shuddering and your Waldo is quivering in anticipation.  I like what you did with this and think it was underrated.  I''m adding it to my favorites.  :)', '2007-07-02 14:30:09.000000', NULL, 0),
