(3864572, 542873, 66515, '<td valign="top">For those checking: <br/>Waldo One: On the newspaper<br/>Waldo Two: On the milk carton<br/>Waldo Three: It worked better with the full sized image but waldo three is in the picture frame in the background. (Me with my fiancee hence the title)<br/> <br/>PS: I also would have like to move the frame to the right and get rid of that black thing which I had setup to block the view of the bookshelf until I realized the potential "third waldo"...and um...forgot to remove it. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-03 20:39:52.</i></td>', 'For those checking: Waldo One: On the newspaperWaldo Two: On the milk cartonWaldo Three: It worked better with the full sized image but waldo three is in the picture frame in the background. (Me with my fiancee hence the title) PS: I also would have like to move the frame to the right and get rid of that black thing which I had setup to block the view of the bookshelf until I realized the potential "third waldo"...and um...forgot to remove it. ', '2007-07-03 21:38:01.000000', '2007-07-03 21:39:52.000000', 0),
