(3867318, 542329, 51597, '<td valign="top">Steve, <br/>Congratulations on placing in the top 20. (should of been Higher!)..<br/>The wind must of really been blowing judging by the sails yet the water appears calm ... Use to sail quite a bit in the past off of Cape Hatteras not in a boat mind u  wind surfing..Umm Hmm just a board w a sail out in the ocean all the time thinking a shark is going to come up and attack the board.. Anyhow this reminded me of Hatteras..<br/>Can see Waldo watching the water..<br/> <br/>Wives are amazing aren''t they? Sometimes u just need some one to say it''s fine.. <br/> <br/>It is fine.. <br/>Jane</td>', 'Steve, Congratulations on placing in the top 20. (should of been Higher!)..The wind must of really been blowing judging by the sails yet the water appears calm ... Use to sail quite a bit in the past off of Cape Hatteras not in a boat mind u  wind surfing..Umm Hmm just a board w a sail out in the ocean all the time thinking a shark is going to come up and attack the board.. Anyhow this reminded me of Hatteras..Can see Waldo watching the water.. Wives are amazing aren''t they? Sometimes u just need some one to say it''s fine..  It is fine.. Jane', '2007-07-04 12:30:03.000000', NULL, 0),
