(3868858, 540514, 67258, '<td valign="top">I came back to this time and time again during voting and <b>still</b> couldn''t find the figure - I revisit a week later, and there she is staring out!  Strange, very strange! I didn''t knock anything off my scores  if I couldn''t find ''Waldo'' - and now I am glad I didn''t, because this really was a very apt and cool entry.</td>', 'I came back to this time and time again during voting and still couldn''t find the figure - I revisit a week later, and there she is staring out!  Strange, very strange! I didn''t knock anything off my scores  if I couldn''t find ''Waldo'' - and now I am glad I didn''t, because this really was a very apt and cool entry.', '2007-07-04 19:39:54.000000', NULL, 0),
