(4368892, 542871, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Once you do see Waldo it takes on a whole different perspective as far as size.  Doesn''t look like any place on the known earth - more like one of those secret fantasy places only fairies can see.</td>', 'Wow.  Once you do see Waldo it takes on a whole different perspective as far as size.  Doesn''t look like any place on the known earth - more like one of those secret fantasy places only fairies can see.', '2008-01-07 07:12:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4544731, 540993, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''ll notice the commenter score is much higher.  This is one of those shots that the DPC 1-second fly-by voter unfortunately never gets the opportunity to experience, which is their loss, not yours.  Marvelously complex yet simple with a myriad of messages or meanings to be left to the viewer.  The trapping of the shadow behind the fence, the tree living freely beyond...</td>', 'You''ll notice the commenter score is much higher.  This is one of those shots that the DPC 1-second fly-by voter unfortunately never gets the opportunity to experience, which is their loss, not yours.  Marvelously complex yet simple with a myriad of messages or meanings to be left to the viewer.  The trapping of the shadow behind the fence, the tree living freely beyond...', '2008-03-07 06:03:31.000000', NULL, 0),
