(4837550, 540833, 90269, '<td valign="top">I put this on my favorites because we found a large framed photo of the mill when we were going throught Clint''s mom''s stuff - it was taken in 1969 and it was his dad''s favorite picture.  Its all faded and brown now.  I see you put it as your Places photo.</td>', 'I put this on my favorites because we found a large framed photo of the mill when we were going throught Clint''s mom''s stuff - it was taken in 1969 and it was his dad''s favorite picture.  Its all faded and brown now.  I see you put it as your Places photo.', '2008-07-21 21:15:54.000000', NULL, 0),
