(5012716, 542871, 62187, '<td valign="top">Oh wow...!...I remember this photo. At the time I was a dumb-*ss and gave it a 7. Now that I''m all growed up I''m still a dumb-*ss but now I think it''s definitely a 10!</td>', 'Oh wow...!...I remember this photo. At the time I was a dumb-*ss and gave it a 7. Now that I''m all growed up I''m still a dumb-*ss but now I think it''s definitely a 10!', '2008-10-17 18:04:44.000000', NULL, 0),
